<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">LUK- Arum NT</book>
  <para style="h">Aluka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Aluka</para>
  <para style="toc2">Aluka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">TSIFA NANA REH ANYI NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">Aluka</para>
  <para style="mt1">ALUKA</para>
  <para style="imt">IKPI TSIFA</para>
  <para style="im">A bu Aluka mi a ŋa amgbasho ata areh. Ŋoh tana a bu kyangwri Yahudawa kpeh, tasa za tana a bu kyangwri uwra. Ŋoh za tana a bu anyimbehreh nimeh amboh tufa Yeso mboh tswanza mgbiri amboh ŋa amgbasho mboh nza ma a ŋa tsifa ma ikpi Yeso reh. A ŋa amgbasho reh ma ahushi 59 tasa 80 neh Yeso kǝ kwo. Mgbiri ma a gu la a ŋa amgbasho reh ma Roma.Tama a ŋa amgbasho reh a na Tiyofilus mi tasa mgbiri kyangwri mboh za mata a hunji.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tsifa nana ata nza anyi na Aluka reh, a jiji atsifa la Yeso a ba atsi sa Israila mboh a hwana tasa inziyo nambri. Amgbasho reh a jiji na tsifa nana agohsoh atsi bleh tsifa mara Yeso, tasa za a gyuru a bleh tsifa hinga a ŋoh anyi ma kwo a na inza za. Aluka reh a tsana za la kyangwri amboh nza ma a leh a kwo mboh reh a wa Yeso reh aniye.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tsifa amboh anyi ma a yama ata nza bu amgbasho Aluka tsene ma nza atsifa ma ikpi reh, tswanza handra 1-2 tasa handra 9-19. Atsifa ma ikpi mara Ayohana kyangwri wra Batisma tasa ma ikpi ata Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ta ka a na ni Maryamu, tasa za riri ata mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh tama ka a te ameh ata amboh sumu mboh ta maka a na atsi mara Yeso reh, tasa kwere Nnoh ata Simeyon tasa Hannatu ta maka a lisa nimeh ida Nnoh reh. Tasa za atsifa ma ikpi de Yeso na ma ida Nnoh reh, tasa za ma ikpi kyangwri Samariya Alindeh, tasa amehreh ata nza a bleh. Nimeh tsifa nana reh nambri, atsifa a keh ma ikpi kwere Nnoh, tasa Huru zanana, tasa ndohmoh ifiya mboh nimeh hende Yeso tasa za la Nnoh a te kohhroh na kpakpana mboh.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ikpi tsifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Kyangwri mboh gaga ma a fa akeki la mata a ŋa ma ikpi tsifa amboh ata ta maka a su na ambohroh reh, <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />tswanza tama a yi a nga reh anyi na amboh ata mata ka a jiji a nza ni iyo amoh mboh tasa tama a bu ahwra tsifa reh. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Nza a bu dehreh, mya na ikpi amya meh jiji fa akeki awumu mboh reh nambri mya meh nza a zohhoh meh ti ŋa awumu mboh reh ba nnoh ma a sa, nnoh Tiyofilus kyangwri agba, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />Meh lisa dehreh la ti wina a zizi tsifa amboh ata nza ma a tsana noh reh.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maka A bleh Mara Ayohana Kyangwri Wra Batisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Na ameh ata Hirudus ta ka a bu Agohmoh Yahudiya, firist anyi tana a yama isa a ŋoh tana a bu Zakariya, a bu nimeh kyangwri sangra mya ata hwara vari afya Abiya. Isa afya a ŋoh a bu Alisabatu ŋoh reh anyi alohsoh Haruna. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Na afri ma amoh, ma a tufa Nnoh yehlehleh, ma tufa tsifa doka Ada reh tasa akpi a ŋoh reh nambri, ma a sohroh a kya mboh mbimbi kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Ma a sohroh a bu na amehreh kpeh, la Alisabatu reh a tuma akwri; tasa za ma te achoh na afri ma amoh.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Ibi anyi Zakariya ka a leh a te ndohmoh a ŋoh ata firist nimeh ida Nnoh, a buti te ndohmoh ata ka a te na tutu reh.la ibi ndohmoh amoh kǝ ba. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Maka a were akabeh masa a seh ŋoh, sa aniye a na nimeh ida kwere Nnoh mboh reh ta a na na afya awumu nyungo alindeh, biroh ika ata firist ka a lisa nimeh ida Nnoh Ada reh. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Na ameh ata Zakariya ta ka a leh afya awumu angǝshi alindeh reh, duma agba ma a nati a kasa ma inziyo mata a leh kwere Nnoh.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Amehreh tohmoh Ada anyi ka kate ŋoh, ka a shi na mgba ivoh rya a kpa ma bagadi atsi ata maka afya awumu angǝshi reh. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Zakariya nza ka a nza ŋoh reh agohsoh ŋoh ka a hwa, tasa za ka nyiri. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh neh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kama nyiri kpeh nnoh Zakariya, maa sa kwere anzoh, afya anzoh Alisabatu a nati a mara nnoh amehreh, ma a nati a gya isa ŋoh la Ayohana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Ni nati johjoh ti kwende gaga, Duma za ma a nati a kwende ni mara amehreh reh, <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />ŋoh amehreh reh a nati bu kyangwri agba ma tohmoh Nnoh. A nati a wa amwo inabi kpeh ha ta a wa awumu te fya kpeh. Ma a nati a hama ŋoh na huru zanana reh anyi avoh mara ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />A nati a gyuru Israila mboh gaga mata a ba amoh na Ada Nnoh amoh. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Ŋoh a nati a bu ma tohmoh ni Nnoh, nimeh huru tasa wuwana ata Iliya, ta a gyuru agohsoh ada mboh a ba ni mara amoh mboh tasa amboh wuwa ikpi mboh za a nati a gyuru mboh mata a bu na lomo tufa yehlehleh, a nati a lisa kyangwri mboh mata a bana ba Nnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakariya ka a luhu Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh na amgba reh la,&lt;&lt;Meh nati lisa lele misi wina la andromboh ata nza ni a bleh meh reh a nati a bu dehreh? mya mi te achoh, afiya amya za kǝ te ibi afri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh bu Jibrailu. Mya meh shi ni tohmoh Nnoh, ma a tohmoh meh la meh ti tsifa na anzoh, tasa za meh ti a bleh noh tsifa nana. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Nehnehreh, ni nati bu gbalala ni nati za wina tsifa za kpeh a nati a bu ibi ata tsifa reh kǝ su feh, la ni sa tsifa amya reh kira kpeh, ata nza a bana ameh ta su.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Kyangwri mboh ma tuma a bana mata a nza kate Zakariya reh, maka leh a kohnoh la a ka bu mboh a te feh neh a ka a leh a yanda nimeh ida Nnoh reh. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Zakariya nza ka a kate reh, ka a za a wina tsifa na amoh za kpeh, maka a wina la kǝ nza huru nimeh ida Nnoh reh, ka zaka a leh atsifa a tsana mboh ni ivoh ma a za a wina tsifa za kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Ameh ndohmoh a ŋoh nza ka a trina reh, ka a gyuru a na a ŋoh afiya. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />A te ibi afri kpeh, afya a ŋoh Alisabatu ka a hunu ivru. Ka a huho ikpi a ŋoh a te ibi atungu. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Alisabatu reh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A bu Ada mi a lisa meh andromboh ata areh&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ibi amboh areh a nza kwini amya a ka a fufa sa a kate meh ma tohmoh kyangwri mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A bleh Mara Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Alisabatu nza a bu na ivru nara atehrehkifi reh, Nnoh ka a tohmoh Amehreh tohmoh a ŋoh anyi ata nza maka a fi isa ŋoh la Jibrailu a na Nazaret, akpo afiya ma Galili, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />a na na anyifa anyi ata kǝ hehreh wina atsifa kpeh nza ma a handa ŋoh a gya ma Yusufu nza anyi ma alohsoh Agohmoh Dawuda. Anyifa reh isa a ŋoh a bu Maryamu. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh ka a ba ba a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Tuma alindeh a bu na anzoh nnoh ni lisa alindeh reh! Ada a bu na anzoh tasa za a te nnoh atoh gaga!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Maryamu nza ka a sehreh nza ma atsifa na a ŋoh reh, a ka a gu kohnoh a fi ma agohsoh a ŋoh, a ka a kohnoh la ata areh a bu tsifa ika atamaa dehreh. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh neh ka a bleh ŋoh la, kama nyiri kpeh, Maryamu, ni hunji lisa alindeh ma tohmoh Nnoh. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Ni nati sa ivru, ni nati mara amehreh, ni nati gya ŋoh isa la Yeso. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />A nati a bu agba tasa ma nati a fi ŋoh la Amehreh Nnoh ata nza a keh agba reh. Ada Nnoh a nati a nga ŋoh kpra Agohmoh alehmeh Dawuda, <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />tasa ŋoh a nati a de afiya Yakubu ka nina; kpra Agohmoh a ŋoh reh a nati a trina kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Maryamu ka luhu Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh na amgba reh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh hehreh wina atsifa kpeh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Meh nati lisa lele misi hunji Amehreh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh reh ka a kira ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Huru zanana Nnoh a nati a tamba ma ikpi anzoh, tasa wuwana Nnoh ata nza a keh agba reh a nati a hama nnoh. Amehreh ata huru Nnoh nza a nati a mara ŋoh reh ma a nati a fi isa ŋoh la Amehreh Nnoh. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Nza asra anzoh Alisabatu za a nati a mara na achoh ŋoh ma, kyangwri tama a bleh la a nati a tuma akwri, a bu na ivru nara atehrehkifi na aniye nehnehreh. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Tsifa andromboh a sohroh a keh Nnoh ta lisa kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Maryamu ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh bu afya ahwra Ada&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Ta ka bu na amya dehreh tswanza nza ni tsifa reh.&gt;&gt; Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh na amgba reh ka ata ŋoh.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maryamu A ba Sene na Alisabatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Na ameh wohroh Maryamu ka a de a hinga ni gbugbo, ka a na a ŋoh akpo afiya agbohgboh anyi ata nza bu ma akpo afiya agba ata Yahudiya mboh. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Ka niye nimeh afiya Zakariya ka atsifa na Alisabatu. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Alisabatu za ka a sehreh tsifa Maryamu reh, amehreh atisha ka a tsu nimeh yira ŋoh. Alisabatu za a hunu ni huru zanana. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Ka a vuru agba yivoh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Te atoh a bu na anzoh nimeh ifiya mboh reh, amehreh ata nza ni nati mara reh za ma nati a te nnoh atoh! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />A ka bu lele feh andromboh alindeh reh a hunji meh, tasa za la akre Ada amya ta a ba na amya? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Agba tsifa anzoh nza ka niye ma ashotoh amya reh, amehreh atisha nza bu nimeh yira amya reh ka a hinga a tsu a johjoh. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Te atoh a bu na anzoh, nnoh ata nza ni sa tsifa reh kira la tohmoh ata Ada nza a de a ba nnoh reh a bu zizi.!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Maryamu A kpa Amumu A krumusu Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Maryamu ka a bleh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">&lt;Fene amya ariri Ada agba<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />tasa za huru amya a johjoh na Nnoh ata nza a nati a sa reh a hwana,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />ŋoh leh a kohnoh na amya, mya nza ni bu afya ahwra anzoh ata kuku ikpi reh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">ka a gu anyi nehnehreh kyangwri ma a nati a fi meh la te atoh,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />Ŋoh Nnoh nza a bu na wuwana reh kǝ lisa meh agbugba awumu mboh reh nambri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">Isa a ŋoh a bu zanana,<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />kwini a ŋoh a nati a ba na amboh ata nza ma a nyiri ŋoh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">a gu anyi ika ata nehnehreh a na ni ika ata ba.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />A lisa agbugba awumu na ivoh a ŋoh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">A sangra na amboh ata nza ma a wuwa ikpi na kohnoh ata agohsoh amoh mboh reh.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />A fira agohgohmoh mboh a gya tamba anyi ma ikpi kpra agohgohmoh amoh mboh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">a nati a fira amboh ata nza ma a bu na kuku ikpi a ka ma inza.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />a nati nga amboh ata inyo nza a te mboh reh awumu alilehndeh.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="LUK 1:53">amboh asabara neh ka ata mboh ma a na amoh ivoh wusu.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />A shingi ahwra a ŋoh Israila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">a kohnoh la ŋoh ta a nza kwini<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />a gu ka a na na Ibrahim tasa alohsoh a ŋoh mboh a nati tuma atono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">a tswanza nza ma a bleh ma ada ambohroh mboh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Maryamu ka a tuma na Alisabatu a tswa atsi te nara atatoh feh sa ka a gyuru a na a ŋoh afya.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mara Ayohana kyangwri Wra Batisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Ameh mara amehreh Alisabatu reh nza ka a ba, a ka a mara amehreh atsifa. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Amboh nza ma a bu ma nda a ŋoh, tasa kikini a ŋoh mboh ma a sehreh la Ada kǝ nza kwini a ŋoh kǝ nga ŋoh Amehreh reh, maka a johjoh na a ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 1:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Amehreh nza ka su ibi atsiyatsiya maka shimba kpanda ŋoh, tama a nati a gya ŋoh isa alehmeh Zakariya.<verse eid="LUK 1:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Akre amehreh reh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Uwa! meh kira ma a fi sa reh la Ayohana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Maka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Akyo nimeh alohsoh amohnoh a bu na isa reh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Maka a luhu alehmeh amehreh reh na kpra ivoh, la ta a bleh mboh isa ata ma a nati a gya ma amehreh reh.<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Ka a bleh mboh la ma a de akloh ŋa a ba ŋoh, ka a ŋa isa amehreh reh la, &lt;&lt;Isa a ŋoh a bu Ayohana&gt;&gt; Kyangwri mboh reh nambri maka a shi a ŋara aniye a leh a nza ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Heriheri aniye Zakariya reh ka a vuruna tasa za arimi a ŋoh ka a hingrena, ka a leh a tsifa a riri Nnoh. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Amboh nza ma a yama ma nda amoh reh maka a nyiri nambri ma amoh, tasa kyangwri maka a hehndeh a bleh tsifa reh a treh akpokpo atsifi ma agbohgboh Yahudiya mboh. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Amboh ata nza ma a sehreh tsifa reh, maka a leh a kohnoh nimeh agohsoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;Amehreh areh a nati a bu umbo?&gt;&gt; Ma a wina la Ivoh Ada a nati a bu na a ŋoh.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zakariya A kpa Amumu Ariri Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Alehmeh Zakariya reh tana a bu na huru zanana reh gaga, tasa za tana a bleh tsifa Nnoh la,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />&lt;&lt;Riri turoh Ada, Nnoh Israila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">Telema la kǝ ba ta a sa kyangwri a ŋoh mboh a hwana ta nga mboh tuma kpi amoh.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />A gu akyo ata nza a nati a sa reh timi nvara a kate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">nimeh afiya ahwra ŋoh Dawuda<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Tswanza ta ka a bleh a gya na kpikpi reh, ma aniye amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh amboh zanana a bleh reh.<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Nvara ambohroh anyi na amboh ata ma a fi reh ma tohmoh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">tasa za anyi na amboh ata ma a kira mata a nza iyo ambohroh kpeh<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />mata a tsana kwini ma ada ambohroh mboh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">tasa za la mata kohnoh na tsifa bleh gya ata nza zanana alindeh reh.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />ata areh a bu faku ata ta ka a gu ma ada Mbohroh Ibrahim:<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />ta a sa reh hwana nyi ma ivoh amboh ata ma a fi reh ma tohmoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">ta a zohhoh reh meh ti krumusu ŋoh meh ti sohroh nyiri kpeh,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />meh ti bu na zanana tasa meh ti tsana aki tufa yehlehleh ma tomo Nnoh a tswa atsi kwo ambohroh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />&lt;&lt;Tasa nnoh, amehreh amya, ma a nati a fi noh la kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh ata nza a keh agba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">nnoh ni nati bu ma tohmoh Nnoh ti lisa ŋoh aki.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />ti nga nnoh ma kyangwri a ŋoh mboh lomo ata nvara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">ma aki ata ma a nati a te kohhroh na kpakpana amoh mboh,<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />telema la kwini Nnoh ambohroh reh a bu gaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">zanana ata nvara reh a nati anyi inza ta a zana reh<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />ta a zana amboh ata ma a tuma nimeh shini</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">tasa nimeh lulu kwo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">ta a wa reh a fi a na ma aki ata meh nati tuma alindeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Amehreh reh nza ka a hinga a te agba reh, huru Nnoh ka a nga ŋoh wuwana agba; ka a kasa na tuma a ŋoh ma hohroh bini a tswa ameh ata a nati a kate a ba ta ahwra akpi a bleh ma Israila mboh.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Mara Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Ama 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Na ameh wohroh reh, Agohmoh Kaisar Augustas ka a bleh tsifa la ma bleh kyangwri mboh reh a nza nza ma a yama ma kpra Agohmoh ŋoh nza a de mboh ma akpo inzi Roma reh. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Ata areh a bu ble kyangwri mboh reh a nza ata jiji ŋoh ameh ata Kiriniyus ta ka a de akpo afiya Suriya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Kyangwri mboh reh nambri maka a na amoh akpokpo afiyafiya amoh mboh la tama a bleh mboh a nza.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Yusufu za ka hinga anyi Nazaret, ata akpo afiya Galili, ka a na a ŋoh akpo afiya Yahudiya, ka a na akpo afiya Dawuda ma Batalami. Yusufu reh tana a na ma a huru tsifa la ma bu alohsoh anyimbehreh mboh ma Dawuda. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />A na atsi ata nza ma a nati a bleh mboh a nza reh mboh ma Maryamu, ata ma ta ka a handa a gya ŋoh la ta a sa ŋoh reh, tasa za mara a ŋoh kǝ ba hwiri. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Nza maka a treh a yama ma Batalami reh, nara mara a ŋoh kǝ ba, <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />ka a mara amehreh a ŋoh na anyimbehreh, amehreh atsifa. Ka a hama amehreh reh na lefe huhwa, maka a fi amehreh reh ka a leh ma kakara were irya Londo mboh, telema ma a hunji atsi leh nimeh ida sehneh mboh reh kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">amboh Sumu Londo mboh tasa Mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Na a gbo atsifi reh, amboh sumu londo ma a leh ma inda amoh, ma a leh a sumu avavara londo amoh mboh ni shini. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ka a kate mboh heri, zanana Ada reh ka a de zana a hama mboh, maka a nyiri gaga. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh neh ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Kama nyiri nnoh kpeh! Meh de tsifa nana ba nnoh, ata a nati a nga nana agohsoh ma kyangwri mboh nambri ma amoh. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Andrehmeh areh nimeh akpo afiya Dawuda ma a mara noh Kristi; ŋoh bu Ada ata nza a nati a sa reh a hwana <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Ata areh a nati a bu kpra na amohnoh: Ni nati hunji noh ma a hama amehreh atisha ni hwashi kuri tasa za a nati a leh ma atsi were irya londo mboh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Ma a huru neh mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh gaga maka a tamba anyi inza, maka a leh ariri Nnoh la, da<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />&lt;&lt;Riri a tswa na Nnoh ata nza a yama nimeh inza agba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">tasa za la ma inziyo areh ta tuma alindeh ta a bu na kyangwri amboh ata Nnoh a nza nana amoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Mara tohmoh mboh reh nza maka ata mboh maka a na amoh inza, amboh sumu londo mboh reh maka a bleh ma itoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;Ba turoh meh na Batalami nehnehreh, timi na ni nza andromboh ata ma a lisa reh, ata Ada ta ka a bleh reh ma ikpi reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Maka a na amoh na gbugbo a na na a hunji Maryamu tasa Yusufu, tasa amehreh atisha reh, ka a leh ma kakara ata maka a were irya ma londo mboh. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Amboh sumu londo mboh nza maka a nza Yeso reh, maka a bleh tsifa ata Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ta ka a bleh mboh ma ikpi amehreh reh. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Tasa za amboh ata nza ma a sehreh tsifa reh nambri maka a ŋara aniye tsifa nza ma a sehreh anyi na amboh sumu londo mboh reh <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Maryamu neh ka a de tsifa mboh nza ma a leh a bleh ŋoh reh nambri, ka a leh kohnoh na agohsoh ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Amboh sumu londo mboh reh maka a gyuru a ba amoh na londo amoh mboh, maka a leh a kpa amumu ariri Nnoh ma ikpi andromboh ata mboh nza ma a nza mata a sehreh za reh, a ka bu dehreh tswanza amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ta ka a bleh mboh reh.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A gya Isa ma Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Ibi na atsiyatsiya ŋoh, ameh shimba kpanda amehreh reh kǝ tswa, maka a gya isa amehreh reh la Yeso, a bu isa areh ŋa Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ta ka a jiji a gya feh sa hunu ivru amehreh reh.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A de Yeso A na Ida Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Ameh ata Maryamu tasa Yusufu ma a nati a lisa andromboh ata akpi Musa nza a tsana la ma a lisa ta a hwara mboh reh. maka a gu amehreh reh a na na a nga Ada ma Urushalima. <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Tswanza nza ma a ŋa a gya nimeh tsifa hwra akpi Nnoh reh la, &lt;&lt;Amehreh atsifa ata nza ma a jiji a mara ŋoh reh, ma a nati a gya ŋoh na zanana ma Ada.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Tasa za mata a de ngǝnga ata awumu nana agohsoh ma ikpi tsifa hwra akpi Ada reh ta ka a su la, &lt;&lt;Ikukuba afri ha tatabara akǝkehreh afri&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Kyangwri anyi a yama ma Urushalima, isa ŋoh a bu Saminu, ŋoh a bu kyangwri tufa Nnoh yehlehleh. Ka a leh a bana ibi ata nza ma a nati a sa Israila mboh a hwana tasa za mata a nga mboh wuwa agohsoh. Huru zanana ka a bu ma ikpi a ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Huru zanana reh tana a bleh ŋoh la, a nati a kwo kpeh, tana a nza Ada Kristi reh feh. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Huru reh ka a gu ŋoh a hehndeh, ka niye nimeh ida Nnoh. Alehmeh mboh tama ka a de Yeso a ba la tama a lisa ŋoh andromboh ata hwra akpi nza a tsana reh. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Saminu neh ka a gu ŋoh a ka inza ni mgba ta ka a riri Nnoh la:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />&lt;&lt;Ada, nehnehreh, tsifa ata nza ni bleh gya reh kǝ su,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">ta ahwra anzoh avoh ta a na ŋoh na tuma alindeh.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Iyo amya kǝ nza nvara anzoh,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />ata nnoh nza ni lisa gya ma tohmoh kyangwri mboh reh nambri,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />zanana anzoh a nati tsana amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">tasa za la mata a de nga agba a ba ma Israila kyangwri anzoh mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Alehmeh Yeso reh tasa akre maka a ŋara aniye ni tsifa ata Saminu nza a bleh mboh ni kpi Amehreh reh. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Saminu neh ka a te mboh atoh ka a bleh ma Maryamu akre amehreh reh la: &lt;&lt;Nnoh a seh amehreh areh la ŋoh a nati a de hwa a ba ma mgbiri mboh tasa ta a de hinga za a ba ma mgbiri vara Israila mboh, tasa za a nati a bu kpra anyi na Nnoh ata kyangwri mboh gaga ma a nati a kira ŋoh kpeh, <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />nza bu dehreh la kohnoh ata ayuhu nza a bu nimeh agohsoh mboh reh mata a bleh mboh. Tasa nnoh Maryamu za ambya gara a nati a hwashi agohsoh anzoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Afya sa tohmoh Nnoh anyi za a yama, isa a ŋoh a bu Hanatu, anyifa Fanuwel, arimi tsifa ŋoh a bu Ashiru. Kǝ te achoh veve kpeh; ma a tuma mboh ma atsifa ŋoh reh ahushi atehrehkifi na anyi, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Atsifa a ŋoh ka a kwo ata ŋoh neh a bu na ahushi agrumavoh ida atsiyatsiya a hwa aniye. A sohroh ata na ida Nnoh reh ta a na na krumusu ŋoh na nnoh a wa shini kpeh, a de aniye tasa za a leh a kwere Nnoh. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Na ameh wohroh reh, ŋoh Hanatu ka ba na amoh ka kwende Nnoh, ka a gyuru atsifa ma ikpi amehreh reh mboh ma amboh ata nza ma a leh a bana la Nnoh ta a nga Urushalima tuma kpi a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A gyuru a na amoh Nazaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Yusufu tasa Maryamu mboh nza maka a lisa awumu amboh ata akpi Ada nza a tsana reh, maka a gyuru ka a na amoh akpo afiya amoh Nazaret ma Galili. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Amehreh reh ka a hinga a te agba ta ka a wuwana; ka a bu na lomo gaga, lisa alindeh Nnoh za ka a bu na a ŋoh.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso, Ameh Amehreh reh, Nimeh Ida Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Ma ahuhushi Alehmeh Yeso mboh ma akre maka a na Urushalima tsifa kira gǝga handa. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Yeso nza ka bu na ahushi agrumavoh a hwa afri ni mara, maka a na amoh atsi dohsohkpi reh tswanza maka a lisa ni tutu reh. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Dohsohkpi reh nza ka a trina, Alehmeh Yeso mboh ma akre maka buti na amoh afiya, ŋoh amehreh amoh Yeso reh ka a treh ma nyina ma Urushalima, akre mboh ma Alehmeh reh ma a wina kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Kohnoh amoh reh la ha amehreh reh a bu na hohroh duma mboh, hende reh a gu mboh ibi anyimbehreh. Maka a leh a fa amehreh reh a na na kikini amoh mboh tasa ziza amoh mboh. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Nza ma a nza amehreh reh kpeh, maka gyuru a na amoh Urushalima la mata a na na a fa ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Ibi na atatoh nza ka a gǝga neh maka a fa ŋoh a na na a hunji nimeh ida Nnoh, ka tuma ma hohroh amboh tsana mboh, a ka a leh a sehreh mboh a treh feh sa ka a luhu mboh tsifa mboh. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />amboh ata nza ma a sehreh tsifa a ŋoh reh maka a leh a ŋara aniye na biroh lomo ata nza a bu na wohroh reh tasa biroh kira tsifa nza a leh a sa mboh reh. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Alehmeh tasa akre nza maka a nza ŋoh na a huru reh, maka a ŋara aniye. Akre ka luhu ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Amehreh, ni kǝ lisa dehreh tsifa umbo? Mbohroh ma atsiyoh mi tre atsifi leh hende fa nnoh kavoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Yeso ka a gyuru a luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ leh hende fa meh noh tsifa umbo?&gt;&gt; Ni wina noh la a zohhoh meh ti kasa ma afiya Ada amya kpeh? <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Mboh reh neh ma a sohroh a sehreh lomo tsifa amehreh amoh reh a wina kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Yeso ka a hinga a wa mboh ka a na Nazaret tasa ŋoh za a bu na kuku ikpi na amoh. Akre amehreh reh ka a de tsifa mboh reh a leh ka kohnoh na agohsoh a ŋoh nambri.<verse eid="LUK 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Yeso ka a hinga a te agba nimeh lomo tasa na wuwana, ka a hunji rya tomo alindeh ma tomo Nnoh tasa ma tomo kyangwri mboh.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Ayohana Kyangwri Wra Batisma A lisa Aki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Ama 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mk 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoh 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Nehnehreh, nimeh ahushi ata agrumavoh a hwa atungu ameh ata Tibariya Kaisar a de Agohmoh, Buntus Bilatus ka a de a ŋoh mgba Yahudiya. Hirudus ka a de a ŋoh mgba Galili. Atsini Filibus ka a de a ŋoh mgba Ituriya tasa Tarakunitas. Lisaniyas ka a de a ŋoh Abilene. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Na ameh wohroh reh Hannana tasa Kayafa ma bu agbugba Firist mboh, tsifa Nnoh ka a ba na Ayohana amehreh Zakariya na hohroh bini. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Ayohana neh ka a hehndeh a treh atsifi ma akpo inzi fini Urdu, ka a leh a hwra tsifa a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Gyuruna ta noh kpakpana amohnoh mboh reh, mata wra noh batisma, tasa za Nnoh a nati a te kohhroh na kpakpana amohnoh mboh. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />A tswanza nza a yama nimeh amgbasho tsifa Ishaya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;&lt;Agba akyo anyi a leh a fi ma hohroh bini la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;Lisa nnoh aki ma Nnoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">lisa nnoh aki a ŋoh reh ta a bu yehlehleh,<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Ma a nati a kpa tsitsiyo mboh a suhru ta a su,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">ma a nati a kpa agbohgboh mboh tasa kpakpa mboh za a sasara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Akeki amboh ata nza ma a huhuruna za mata akpi mboh a sara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">akeki amboh ata nza ma a bu kwakwanya za mata a lisa ta a zohhoh.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Kyangwri mboh nambri mata a nza nvara Nnoh reh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Ayohana ka a leh a bleh ma duma mboh nza ma a leh a ba na ŋoh la ŋoh ta a wra mboh batisma reh la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh alohsoh anu mboh! A ka bu anyi akpi nnoh ashotoh ni kpi gofo ata nza a buti ba reh? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Lisa nnoh ndohmoh alindeh ta a tsana la ni gyuruna ta nnoh akeki agugu amohnoh mboh reh. Kama kohnoh nnoh ma agohsoh amohnoh la, &lt;Ibrahim a bu ada Mbohroh kpeh&gt;Meh bleh noh la nimeh kpakpa amboh areh Nnoh a nati a wina lisa amehreh ma Ibrahim. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Maa a gu aniye ikeh a gya na ma chuhu ariri agbeh. Agbeh ata nza a mara mara alindeh kpeh, ma nati a biri a fi nimeh shira.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Duma mboh reh maka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati lisa lele?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a bu na kuri afri ta nga anyimbehreh ma akyo ata nza a bu na wohroh kpeh,akyo ata nza a bu na irya za ta a lisa ika wohroh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />amboh sa hungroh gandu za maka a ba la ta a wra mboh batisma. Maka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;A bu umbo meh nati lisa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Kama sa gǝga handa nnoh andromboh ata nza ma a bleh la sa noh reh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />amboh de ita amboh anyi za maka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu umbo meh nati lisa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Kyangwri mboh reh tama a leh a bana ba kristi, nambri ma amoh ma kohnoh nimeh agohsoh la ha a bu Ayohana mi a bu ata nza a nati a sa reh a hwana reh. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Ayohana ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh wra nnoh batisma na amwo. Akyo ata nza a keh meh reh a nati a ba, meh nati wina hingre rishi akpehtreh hwana a ŋoh kpeh. Ŋoh a nati a wra nnoh batisma na huru zanana tasa na shira. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />A de kumu a ŋoh ma ivoh, a nati a blisa yohroh ma fi ta ka a fira a gya na ma lohkehreh a ŋoh, ta ka a fira atutu reh afya nimeh shira ata ka kwo na gbugbo kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Na mgbiri vara tsifa mboh za Ayohana ka a leh ahwra tsifa nana a bleh ma kyangwri mboh, tasa za ka a leh a kwere mboh la mata a sehneh akeki amoh mboh. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Ayohana neh ka atsifa a vuru iyo ma Agohmoh Hirudus reh, telema la Hirudus reh a sa Hirudiya, afiya atsini Filibus, a gyuru a lisa awumu amboh ata nza a zohhoh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Hirudus neh ka a kputu tsifa nza ka a nga mboh aniye la ma a de Ayohana a ka ma ida ka.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A wra Batisma ma Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Ama 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mk 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Ma a wra batisma ma kyangwri mboh a treh feh, ma sa ka a wra Yeso za batisma. Nza ka a buti kwere Nnoh, inza ka reh a vuruna <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />tasa za Huru zanana ka a tamba ma ikpi a ŋoh nimeh itoh kyangwri tswanza ikukuba. Maka a sehreh agba anyi inza la, &lt;&lt;Ni bu amehreh amya, ata mya meh kira; mi nza nana anzoh gaga.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">A zizi Chuhu Tsifa Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Ama 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yeso ka a jiji ndohmoh a ŋoh neh kǝ bu na ahushi agrumavoh da atatoh ma inziyo reh. Ma a gu ŋoh la ŋoh bu amehreh Yusufu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:23">amehreh Heli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli a bu amehreh Mattat,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Mattat a bu amehreh Alawi, Alawi a bu amehreh Malki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">Malki a bu amehreh Yanna, Yanna a bu amehreh Yusuf,<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Yusufu a bu amehreh Mattatiya, Mattatiya a bu amehreh Amos,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Amos a bu amehreh Nahum, Nahum a bu amehreh Hasli,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">Hasli a bu amehreh Najaya <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Najaya a bu amehreh Maata,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Maata a bu amehreh Mattatiya, Mattatiya a bu amehreh Shimeya,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">Shimeya a bu amehreh Yosek, Yosek a bu Amehreh Yoda.<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yoda a bu amehreh Yowanan, Yowanan a bu amehreh Resa,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Resa a bu amehreh Zerubbabel, Zerubabel a bu amehreh Sheyaltiyel,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">Sheyaltiyel a bu amehreh Niri,<verse eid="LUK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Niri a bu amehreh Malki,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Malki a bu amehreh Addi, Addi a bu amehreh Kosama,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">Kosama a bu amehreh Elmadama, Elmadama a bu amehreh Er<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Er a bu amehreh Yoshuwa, Yoshuwa a bu amehreh Eliyezer,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Eliyezer a bu amehreh Yorim,Yorim a bu amehreh Mattat,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">Mattat a bu amehreh Alawi <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Alawi a bu amehreh Simeyon,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Simeyon a bu amehreh Yahuda,Yahuda a bu amehreh Yusuf,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">Yusuf a bu amehreh Yonam, Yonam a bu amehreh Eliyakim,<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliyakim a bu amehreh Meleya, Meleya a bu amehreh Menna,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Menna a bu amehreh Mattata, Mattata a bu amehreh</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">Natan, Natan a bu amehreh Dawuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Dawuda a bu Amehreh Yesse,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Yesse a bu amehreh Obida, Obida a bu Amehreh</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">Bowaz, Bowaz a bu amehreh Salmon, Salmon a bu amehreh Nashon.<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nashon a bu amehreh Amminadab, nza anyi alohsoh Yeso reh Amminadab a bu amehreh Aram,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Aram a bu amehreh Hezron,Hezron a bu amehreh</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">Ferez, Ferez a bu amehreh Yahuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yahuda a bu amehreh Yakubu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Yakubu a bu amehreh Ishaku, Ishaku a bu amehreh Ibrahim,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">Ibrahim a bu amehreh Tera, Tera a bu amehreh Nahor,<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nashor a bu Serug, Serug a bu amehreh</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Reyu, Reyu a bu amehreh Feleg, Feleg a bu amehreh Eber,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">Eber a bu amehreh Shela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Shela a bu amehreh Kenan,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Kenan a bu amehreh Arfakshad, Arfakshad a bu amehreh Shem,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">Shem a bu amehreh Anuhu, Anuhu a bu amehreh Lamek,<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lamek a bu amehreh Metusela, Metusela a bu amehreh Enok,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Enok a bu amehreh Yared, Yared a bu amehreh Mahalalehl,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">Mahalalehl a bu amehreh Kenan, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kenan a bu amehreh Enosh,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">Enosh a bu amehreh Set, Set a bu amehreh Adamu,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">Adamu feh ka bu Amehreh Nnoh.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Agugu A tsara Yeso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Ama 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mk 1:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yeso neh ka a ba a ŋoh anyi iba fini Urdu, ka a bu na Huru Zanana gaga. Huru reh ka a gyuru a sa ŋoh a gu a na hohroh bini. <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />Ma atsi a huru neh agugu ka a tsara ŋoh ibi agrumavoh da anneh. Nimeh ibi amboh areh a sohroh a rya andromboh kpeh, nza ka a ba trina ŋoh neh inyo ka a de ŋoh.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Agugu reh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza ni bu Amehreh Nnoh reh bleh kpakpa ata areh ta a bu afohfohnoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Ma a ŋa a gya nimeh tsifa Nnoh la, &lt;Kyangwri a nati a sohroh a hunji fene na afohfohnoh tsene kpeh.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Agugu neh ka a gyuru a gu ŋoh a na agbohgboh anyi ka a tsana ŋoh akpokpo afiyafiya mboh nza ma a yama ma inziyo reh. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Agugu reh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati nga nnoh wuwana agba ma ikpi awumu amboh reh nambri, awumu mboh reh ma a bu ma ivoh amya nambri, meh nati wina gu anyi nga akyo ata mya meh kira. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Nza ni krumusu meh reh, awumu mboh reh nambri a nati bu anzoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yeso ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ma a ŋa a gya la,&lt;Krumusu Ada Nnoh anzoh a bu ŋoh tsene ni nati tufa ŋoh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Agugu reh ka a gu Yeso a na Urushalima ka a gu ŋoh a gya na ma agboh ida Nnoh Ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza ni bu amehreh Nnoh reh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Hwa tamba nyi mareh. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Ma a ŋa a gya la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">&lt;A nati bleh mara tohmoh a ŋoh mboh ma ikpi anzoh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:10">mata a sumu nnoh ve;<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />ma a nati a shushwa nnoh na ivoh amoh mboh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:11">la ti kama kpa hwana ma kpakpa kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Yeso ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ma a ŋa a gya la, &lt;kama tsara Ada Nnoh anzoh kpeh.&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Agugu nza ka a tsara ŋoh ka a treh ma akeki mboh reh nambri, a ka a na a ŋoh ata ŋoh fiya.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A jiji Ndohmoh a ŋoh ma Galili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Ama 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mk 1:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yeso ka a gyuru a ba ŋoh Galili nimeh wuwana huru zanana, tsifa a ŋoh reh ka a treh atsifi ma inziyo. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Ka a leh a tsana mboh nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh, duma mboh maka a leh ariri ŋoh.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma A leke Yeso Ma Nazaret</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Ama 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mk 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Ka a ba Nazaret atsi ata ŋoh nza a te agba reh, a ka aniye nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh ma ibi Asabar tswanza ŋoh nza ka a lisa reh. Ka a de a hinga a shi ta a bleh amgbasho reh a were mboh. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />Maka a gu amgbasho Ishaya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh a nga ŋoh. Ka a vuru, ka a fa atsi ata nza ma a ŋa la:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />&lt;&lt;Huru Ada reh a bu ma ikpi amya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">telema la ma a wo meh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">meh ti hwra tsifa nana bleh ma amboh ata ma a bu iya amoh ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Ŋoh a tohmoh meh la meh ti na ni bleh ma amboh ata ma a ka mboh reh la ma a nati ata mboh avoh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">amboh ata ma a hama iyo ma nati a nza atsifi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">mata ata avoh ma amboh ata agugu nza fla mboh a gya.<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />meh ti gyuru hwra bleh za la ahushi kǝ ba ata Ada a nati a sa kyangwri a ŋoh mboh a hwana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Nza a bleh amgbasho reh a treh, ka a gu a nga kyangwri te ndohmoh nimeh ida Nnoh reh, ta ka tuma ma a huru. Kyangwri mboh nza ma a yama nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh maka a fira iyo amoh mboh a nza ŋoh, <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />ka a gyuru a bleh mboh la,&lt;&lt;Andrehmeh areh tsifa nimeh amgbasho reh kǝ su na amohnoh nza ni sere nnoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Amboh nza ma a yama ma a huru reh maka bleh tsifa nana ma ikpi a ŋoh, maka a leh a ŋara aniye na tsifa alilehndeh mboh nza ma a leh a kate anyi ma aniye a ŋoh reh, maka a leh a luhu la, &lt;&lt;Ha ata areh a bu amehreh Yusufu kpeh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Yeso ka kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Meh wina ni nati bleh meh noh lomo tsifa tsana aki areh: &lt;Nnoh kyangwri nga wra bishi, nga wuwana ma ikpi anzoh! lisa na mareh afiya anzoh andromboh ata mbohroh nza meh sehreh la ni lisa ma Kafarnahum reh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Ka a gyuru a bleh mboh za la, &lt;&lt;meh bleh noh zizi,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Maka a nza kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh nashi na ikpi ma akpo afiya a ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Meh bleh noh zizi la ifiya akwri mboh tama a yama gaga ma Israila ameh ata Iliya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh ta ka a yama reh, a ka a gu ahushi atatoh na mgbiri neh awi a sohroh a tamba anyi ma inza kpeh, inyo agba ka a treh atsifi ma inziyo reh nambri. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Ma kama a tohmoh Iliya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh a na na akyo anyi nimeh amoh kpeh, maka a tohmoh ŋoh a na na afiya akwri anyi nza a bu ma Zarefat ata nza a bu ma akpo afiya sidon. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Kyangwri gaga tama bu na bishi kohmoh ma Israila ameh ata Iliya kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh ta ka a treh a yama reh, ma kama a nga wuwana ma akyo anyi nimeh amoh kpeh, a ka a bu ŋoh Naaman kyangwri Suriya tsene ma nza a hunji wuwana reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Kyangwri mboh nza ma a bu nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh maka a te gofo gaga nza ma a sehreh tsifa reh <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Maka a de a hinga a gu Yeso ka na mgba inziyo, maka a gu ŋoh ka na agbohgboh anyi nza ma a mina afiyafiya amoh mboh reh, la mata a yi ŋoh a fi a tamba anyi ma ikpi agbohgboh reh. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Ka niye a gǝga na hohroh kyangwri mboh reh a na ŋoh.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kyangwri Huru Agugu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mk 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Ka a na ŋoh Kafarnahum, akpo afiya anyi ma Galili, ka a leh a tsana lomo tsifa ma kyangwri mboh na ibi Asabar. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Maka a ŋara aniye na lomo tsifa a ŋoh reh, telema la tsifa a ŋoh reh a bu na wuwana. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh, kyangwri anyi a bu na huru agugu arishi. Ka a kpanga a vuru agba mama la, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />&lt;&lt;Kwehu! A bu umbo a wa nnoh aniye na ambohroh, nnoh Yeso ata Nazaret? Ha la ni ba la ti ba bu mla reh kwo mi? Meh wina akyo ata nnoh nza ni bu, noh ni bu zanana ata Nnoh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Yeso ka a bleh ma amehreh tufa ŋoh reh la, &lt;&lt;Hama aniye anzoh!&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Kate nyi ma itoh kyangwri ata areh!&gt;&gt; Huru agugu ka a gu kyangwri reh ava ma inzi na tohmoh amoh a treh feh sa ka a kate, ata kyangwri reh a kama a gya ŋoh bla andromboh ma itoh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Kyangwri mboh na agba ma amoh maka a leh a ŋara aniye tasa maka a bleh ma itoh amoh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ata areh a bu lomo tsifa ika tama? A zaka vuru aniye atsifa na wuwana na abibi inyo mboh reh maka a kate!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Tsifa Yeso ka a treh atsifi ma akpokpo afiyafiya mboh reh nambri.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A nga Vara Kyangwri mboh Wuwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Ama 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mk 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yeso ka a kate anyi ma ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh ka a na afiya Siman. Akre agba Siman reh a wuwana kpeh a bu na bishi avoh. Maka kwere Yeso la tana ta shingi mboh <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Ka a gǝga a na na a hunji ŋoh ka a bleh ma bishi hwene itoh reh la ta a kate, bishi reh ka a kate ata ŋoh, ka a de a hinga ma hwana anyimbehreh ka a trisa mboh irya.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Nza ka a na mgba nnoh Nvishi, kyangwri maka a leh a fira amboh bishi mboh reh ma atsetse a ba na a ŋoh, ka a gu ivoh ka a babara mboh nambri, maka a hunji wuwana <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Inyo mboh maka a leh a kate anyi ma itoh vara kyangwri mboh maka a leh a vuru aniye a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ni bu Amehreh Nnoh!&gt;&gt; Yeso neh ka akpi mboh ashotoh, ka a ha mboh tsifa, telema ma a wina la ŋoh bu Kristi.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso Ahwra Tsifa A bleh Nimeh ida Nnoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Mk 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Ibi nza ka a yanda Yeso ka a na atsi ata akyo a yama kpeh. Kyangwri mboh maka a leh a hehndeh a fa ŋoh, maka a ba ba a hunji ŋoh. Ma kira la mata a ha ŋoh gyuru na akpo anyi za. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Ŋoh neh ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;A zohhoh meh ti de lomo tsifa nana akpo afiya Nnoh reh na ni mgbiri akpokpo afiyafiya mboh za, ma a tohmoh meh ni ikpi tsifa amboh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Ka a leh a hehndeh a hwra tsifa Nnoh a bleh nimeh dida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh Yahudiya mboh.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yeso A fi Amboh Tufa A ŋoh amboh Jiji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Ama 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mk 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Ibi-anyi Yeso nza ka a buti shi ma akachi fini Janisarat, kyangwri mboh maka a leh a kpusu a ba ni inda a ŋoh la tama a sehreh tsifa Nnoh reh, <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />ka a nza gbogblondo amwo afri ma akachi fini reh, a bu amboh de kpo mboh ma a kate a leh a hwara arishi de kpo amoh mboh reh. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Ŋoh ka niye nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh anyi, ata ŋoh nza niye reh a bu Abitrusu a ŋoh, ka a luhu ŋoh la ta a yi gbogblondo amwo reh anyi ma inzi a na nimeh amwo shidi. A ka a tuma nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh a leh a tsana duma mboh. <verse eid="LUK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Yeso nza ka atsifa a treh reh, ka a bleh ma Abitrusu la, &lt;&lt;Kpusu gbogblondo amwo reh na ma atsi niye ŋoh reh, ti fi noh arishi de kpo amohnoh mboh reh ti de noh kpo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Abitrusu ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, mbohroh meh te ndohmoh nyi avoh shini meh hehreh de andromboh kpeh. Nnoh nza ni tsifa dehreh reh, meh nati were arishi ambohroh mboh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Nza maka a fi arishi de kpo amoh reh nimeh amwo, maka a fira agbugba kpo na arishi de kpo amoh reh ka a hwashina. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Nza maka a nza dehreh, maka a fi ziza amoh mboh nza ma a yama nimeh gbogblondo amwo ata afri reh la mata a shingi mboh. Maka a fira kpukpo a ba ba a su nimeh gbogblondo amoh mboh reh na afri ma, gbogblondo mboh reh la mata niye a bleh nimeh amwo. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Abitrusu nza ka a nza dehreh, ka a hwa na tohmoh Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Hinga meh ni mareh, Ada; mya meh bu kyangwri kpakpana!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Abitrusu tasa amboh ata ma a bu mboh ma amoh reh maka a leh a ŋara aniye ni kpo ata mboh nza ma a leh a fira reh, <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />ka a bu dehreh za na Yakubu tasa Ayohana, mara Zabadi mboh, iziza ndohmoh Abitrusu mboh. Yeso neh ka a bleh ma Abitrusu la, &lt;&lt;Kama nyiri kpeh; nza ka a gu anyi nehnehreh ni nati de kyangwri mboh ba na amya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Maka a kama gbogblondo amwo amoh a na ma akachi fini inzi a tuhwara, maka ata awumu amoh mboh ma a huru nambri maka a tufa ŋoh.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A hwara Kyangwri Bishi Kohmoh Anyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Ama 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mk 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Yeso nza ka a na akpo afiya anyi, kyangwri bishi kohmoh anyi ka a ba na ŋoh. Nza ka a nza Yeso reh, a ka a hwa ni tohmoh a ŋoh ma inzi ta ka a kwere ŋoh la, Ada, nza a tswa nnoh ma agohsoh reh, ni nati wina lisa meh meh ti bu fyafya.<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Yeso ka a gu ivoh a ŋoh a bara kyangwri reh, ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kǝ tswa meh ma agohsoh amya&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Te fyafya!&gt;&gt; na a huru heri bishi kohmoh reh ka ata ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Yeso ka akpi ŋoh ashotoh la, &lt;&lt;Kama bleh ma akyo kpeh, na anzoh ma, ti na ni tsana kpi anzoh ma firist, ti nga ŋoh awumu nana agohsoh ata Musa ta ka a bleh la lisa ti bu noh fyafya reh. lisa dehreh ti tsana ma kyangwri mboh ni hunji wuwana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Nza ka bu dehreh reh tsifa ni ikpi a ŋoh reh ka a treh atsifi ka a nina ma, vara kyangwri mboh maka a leh a ba na a ŋoh ta a nga mboh wuwana itoh. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Yeso neh ka a hinga a na ŋoh akpo anyi atsi ata akyo nza a yama kpeh ka a na na a kwere Nnoh.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A nga Kyangwri Kwo Tamba Mgba Anyi Wuwana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Ama 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mk 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Ibi-anyi Yeso ka buti tsana mboh, Farisiyawa mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi mboh nza maka anyi akpokpo afiyafiya mboh nza ma yama ma Galili tasa Yahudiya tasa Urushalima mboh nza ma a yama na a huru. Wuwana Ada ka a bu na a ŋoh ta a nga ma amboh bishi mboh wuwana. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Kyangwri amboh anyi za maka a ba na a ŋoh na kyangwri bishi anyi za ma atakpa, a bu na bishi kwo tamba mgba anyi ma a kira mata a de ŋoh a na afiya reh ma tohmoh Yeso. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Ma kama a hunji aki kpeh telema la duma mboh reh ma a keh gaga, maka a gu kyangwri bishi reh a ka ma ikpi tsitsi ida reh maka a vuru atara da reh neh maka a de ŋoh ka a tamba na atakpa ma tohmoh Yeso ma atsitsifi duma mboh reh. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Yeso nza ka a nza nga agohsoh amoh reh, ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Iza amya, maa a te kohhroh na kpakpana anzoh mboh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh tasa Farisiyawa mboh maka a leh a bleh ma itoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;Ata areh ka bu anyi ata nza a bleh tsifa abibi ma ikpi Nnoh reh? Anyi a nati a wina te kohhroh na kpakpana ambohroh mboh nza a bu Nnoh ma ŋoh tsene reh kpeh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Yeso a wina kohnoh amoh nambri ka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kohnoh nnoh andromboh areh ma agohsoh amohnoh tsifa umbo? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Atamaa a keh zohhoh: mata a bleh la, &lt;Maa a te kohhroh na kpakpana anzoh mboh,&gt; ha mata a bleh la, &lt;Hinga ti hende&gt;? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Meh nati tsana noh la amehreh kyangwri a nati a bu na wuwana ta a te kohhroh na kpakpana mboh ma inziyo areh.&gt;&gt; Ka a bleh ma kyangwri nza a kwo a tamba mgba anyimbehreh reh la, &lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh la, hinga, ti gu atakpa anzoh na afiya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Ka a de a hinga a shi ma tohmoh amoh heri, ta ka a sa atakpa a ŋoh a gu ka a leh ariri Nnoh. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Nambri ma amoh maka a leh a ŋara aniye tasa za maka ariri Nnoh. Nyiri ka a de mboh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh nza andromboh ata meh hehreh nza kpeh andrehmeh areh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A fi Alawi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Ama 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mk 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Nza ka a treh areh, Yeso ka a kate, ka a nza kyangwri sa hungroh gandu anyi isa a ŋoh nza bu Alawi, a tuma a te ndohmoh nimeh ida sa hungroh gandu reh, Yeso reh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Hinga wa meh,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Alawi ka a de a hinga ata awumu a ŋoh mboh na a huru nambri, ta ka a tufa ŋoh.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Alawi ka a fi kira agba ma afiya a ŋoh, ka a bleh ma Yeso za ka a na. amboh sa hungroh gandu mboh gaga ma a yama tasa mgbiri kyangwri mboh maka a leh a rya irya mboh ma amoh. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Farisiyawa mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh maka a leh atsifa ma itoh amoh maka luhu amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;A ka bu umbo a te feh ni leh rya nnoh irya tasa wa mohnoh ma amboh sa hungroh gandu mboh tasa amboh kpakpana mboh&gt;?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la,&lt;&lt;A bu kyangwri wuwana a nati a na ida wra kpeh, a bu kyangwri bishi mi. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Meh ba meh ti fi amboh tufa yehlehleh kpeh, meh ba neh tsifa amboh kpakpana mboh la tama gyuruna ta kpakpana amoh mboh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A luhu Yeso Ma Ikpi De Aniye</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Ama 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mk 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;amboh tufa Ayohana mboh maka de aniye mata a kwere Nnoh, tasa amboh tufa Farisiyawa mboh za maka a lisa dehreh, anzoh mboh neh ma a leh a rya irya mata a wa a na ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni nati wina ha nnoh irya ma ziza atsifa afya afeh nimeh ida wa afya neh atsifa afya afeh reh a yama mboh ma a ŋoh? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Ameh a nati a ba ata ma a nati a gu atsifa afya afeh reh a hinga anyi na amohnoh; ameh wohroh reh ma a nati a de aniye.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Ka a bleh mboh kakranda areh: &lt;&lt;Akyo a nati a wina gu hwashi kuri afeh ta a wono kuri atono kpeh. Nza a lisa dehreh reh, a nati a tswanza hwashi kuri a ŋoh afeh reh tasa za wono reh a nati a su ni kuri atono reh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Akyo a nati a wina were amwo mara agbeh inabi afeh a na nimeh amgbo atono mboh kpeh. Nza a lisa dehreh, amwo mara agbeh inabi afeh reh a nati a vasa gama reh, amwo mara agbeh inabi reh a nati a sangrana amgbo mboh reh mata a te abibi <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Mma, amwo mara agbeh inabi afeh reh ma a nati a were nimeh amgbo afeh mboh. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Akyo ata kǝ wa amwo mara agbeh inabi atono reh a nati a za a kira ta a wa afeh reh za kpeh, a nati a bleh la, &lt;Atono reh a keh zohhoh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Nnoh ata Ibi Asabar</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Ama 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mk 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Ibi Asabar anyi Yeso mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh maka a leh a hehndeh ma inzi akroh, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a leh a fira akpi akroh reh a ndunduru ma ivoh amoh a leh a rya yohroh ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Mgbiri Farisiyawa mboh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A ka a bu mboh a te feh ni leh lisa nnoh andromboh ata nza a zohhoh kpeh ma ibi Asabar?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni hehreh a bleh nza noh andromboh ata Dawuda mboh ta maka a lisa mboh ma ziza a ŋoh mboh inyo ta ka a keh mboh reh kpeh? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Dawuda tana niye a na ida Nnoh, ka a gu afohfohnoh ata nza ma a gya ma Nnoh, ka a rya andromboh ata nza a zohhoh na Agba Firist mboh tsene ma mata a rya. Tasa za ka a nga mgbiri ziza hende a ŋoh mboh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Ni trina neh Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Amehreh kyangwri a bu Ada ata ibi Asabar.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Ni ibi Asabar anyi za ka niye nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh ka a leh a tsana mboh, kyangwri anyi a yama ma a huru ata ivoh rya a kpa a ŋoh Anvinvina <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Farisiyawa mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh maka a leh a fa akeki ata mata a nza hwa Yeso reh, maka a leh a nza ŋoh a na ve ha a nati a nga kyangwri reh wuwana ma ibi Asabar. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Yeso neh ka a wina kohnoh amoh nambri, ka a bleh ma kyangwri ata ivoh rya a kpa ŋoh nza Anvinvina reh la, &lt;&lt;Hinga ti shi ma tohmoh kyangwri mboh ni mareh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Yeso a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ta meh ti luhu nnoh, a bu mboh ata nza a zohhoh mata a lisa na ibi Asabar reh: mata a lisa andromboh alindeh ha mata a lisa andromboh abibi, mata a sa fene a hwana ha mata a mla fene a tavoh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Ka a nza mboh nambri, ka a bleh ma kyangwri reh la, &lt;&lt;Tsitsi ivoh anzoh kate&gt;&gt; Kyangwri reh ka a lisa dehreh, ivoh a ŋoh reh ka a gyuru a zohhoh yama. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Maka a te gofo gaga, maka a leh atsifa ma itoh amoh ni ikpi andromboh ata ma a nati a lisa ma Yeso reh.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">amboh Sa Tohmoh Nana Yeso A bleh Mboh Agrumavoh A hwa Afri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Ama 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mk 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Ibi amboh wohroh Yeso ka a na a ŋoh mgba agbohgboh la ŋoh ta a na na a kwere Nnoh, a gu ŋoh shini anyimbehreh atsi leh kwere Nnoh reh. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Nerebi nza ka a yanda, ka a fi amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la ma a ba na a ŋoh, ka a seh mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri, ka a fi mboh la amboh sa tohmoh nana a bleh. Nza sa amoh mboh areh: <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Ma bu Abitrusu, tasa atsini Andarawus, tasa Yakubu, tasa Ayohana, Filibus, Bartalomi, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />Amatiyu, Toma,Yakubu, amehreh Halfa, Siman ata maka a fi ŋoh la Zaloti, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />Yahuda amehreh Yakubu, tasa Yahuda Iskariyoti, ŋoh ata ta ka a dohsoh aniye ma ikpi Yeso reh.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A tsana Kyangwri Mboh, A ka A nga mboh Wuwana za</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Ama 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Yeso ka a tamba mboh ma amoh ka a na na a shi ma atsi a tana ŋoh. Duma agba amboh tufa ŋoh mboh tasa vara kyangwri mboh nza maka anyi Yahudiya tasa Urushalima, tasa akpo afiya taya tasa Sidon, <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />ma a ba la mata a sehreh tsifa a ŋoh reh tasa za la mata a hunji wuwana anyi ma bishi amoh mboh reh. amboh ata huru agugu reh a leh a wa mboh aniye za ma a hunji wuwana, <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />tasa kyangwri mboh reh ma a kira la mata a leh a bara ŋoh, ma a wina la wuwana anyi na a ŋoh tasa za ka a nga mboh nana itoh.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nana Agohsoh ata A zizi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Ama 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yeso nza ka a nza amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh, ka a bleh la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">&lt;&lt;Te atoh a bu na amohnoh, mohnoh amboh ata iya nza a te nnoh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">akpo afiya Nnoh ata inza reh a bu amohnoh.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Te atoh a bu na amohnoh, mohnoh amboh ata inyo nza a te nnoh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">ni nati hunu nnoh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Te atoh a bu na amohnoh, mohnoh amboh ata nza ni leh kpanga nnoh nehnehreh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">ni nati wehneh nnoh.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Te atoh a bu na amohnoh, mohnoh amboh ata kyangwri mboh nza ma a leke nnoh reh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">nza ma a fira nnoh a gya a kate tasa za mata a kya nnoh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">tasa za maka a leh a fi isa amohnoh la ni bu noh agugu mboh,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="LUK 6:22">la tsifa amya amehreh kyangwri.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />&lt;&lt;Johjoh nnoh ni ibi ata wohroh, ti tsyumuna bibirina nnoh, La fanga amohnoh a nati a bu gaga ma inza. A bu dehreh Ada amoh mboh tama a lisa ma amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh mboh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />iya agba na amohnoh mohnoh amboh ata nza ni bu noh na asabara nehnehreh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">mohnoh ni sa nnoh nana amohnoh heri.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Iya agba na amohnoh mohnoh amboh ata nza ni bu noh na hunu nehnehreh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">inyo a nati a keh nnoh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">iya agba na amohnoh mohnoh amboh ata ni leh wehneh nnoh nehnehreh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">ni nati bu noh ni hungwa yira ti kpanga nnoh.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />iya agba na amohnoh mohnoh amboh ata kyangwri nza ma atsifa alindeh ma ikpi amohnoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">A bu dehreh Ada amoh mboh tama a lisa ma amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh ata huru tsifa reh.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kira na amboh Ata ma A fi noh ma Tomwo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Ama 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />Mya neh meh bleh noh mohnoh amboh ata nza ni sere meh noh reh, la ti kira nnoh na amboh ata nza ma a fi noh ma tohmoh reh, lisa nnoh andromboh alindeh ma amboh ata ma a kira na amohnoh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Te noh atoh ma amboh ata ma a kya nnoh, ti kwere nnoh Nnoh ma amboh ata ma nga noh iya. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Nza akyo a mla nnoh ma mbiri itoh anyi, gyuru ŋoh ata mgba anyi za ta a gyuru a mla. Nza akyo ka a sa kuri anzoh ata inziyo a hwana fufa ata meh za nga noh. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Akyo ata nza a kwere nnoh andromboh, nga ŋoh, tasa za nza akyo ka a sa andromboh anzoh a hwana, kama bleh ŋoh la ta a gyuru a nga noh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Lisa ma kyangwri mboh andromboh ata nnoh za ni kira mata a lisa nnoh.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />&lt;&lt;Nza ni kira na amboh ata ma a kira na anzoh ma reh, a bu kwende atamaa ni nati hunji noh? Amboh kpakpana mboh za ma a kira na amboh ata ma a kira na amoh. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Nza ni lisa noh andromboh alindeh ma amboh ata ma a lisa nnoh alindeh ma reh, a bu kwende atamaa ni nati hunji noh? Amboh kpakpana za maka a lisa ika wohroh! <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Nza ni nga nnoh kohfoh ma amboh ata ni nza noh ma nati a wina a gyuru fanga nnoh ma reh, a bu kwende atamaa ni nati hunji noh? Amboh kpakpana za maka a nga kohfoh ma amboh kpakpana mboh, la mata gya agohsoh la ma a nati a gyuru a sa andromboh ata nza ma akofo mboh reh nambri yama. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Mohnoh neh kira nnoh na amboh ata nza ma a fi noh ma tohmoh, lisa mboh nnoh alindeh, nga mboh nnoh kohfoh ti kama kohnoh nnoh la ni nati gyuru hunji andromboh kpeh. Fanga anzoh a nati bu agba, ni nati bu noh mara Nnoh ata nza bu agba a keh reh. Telema la ŋoh ka a nza kwini amboh ata maka a kwende kpeh tasa agugu mboh. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Bu nnoh amboh nza kwini, tswanza Ada amohnoh za ka a nza kwini.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hwra Akpi Ma Mgbiri mboh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Ama 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />&lt;&lt;Kama hwra noh akpi ma akyo kpeh, mohnoh za mata a kama a hwra noh akpi kpeh. Kama nza noh hwa akyo kpeh, mohnoh za mata a kama a nza hwa amohnoh kpeh. Te noh kohhroh na kpakpana mgbiri mboh, mohnoh za mata a te kohhroh na kpakpana amohnoh. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Nga mboh nnoh, mohnoh za Nnoh a nati a nga noh. Mata a sara alindeh tama a fla a tamba, mata a zuzu feh sa ka a su a sangrana, a nati a sangrana ma ivoh anzoh. Na gbugba ata nza ni gu sara nnoh ma kyangwri mboh reh, a bu na gbugba sara ika wohroh za ma a nati a gu a sara nnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Ka a gyuru a bleh mboh kakranda anyi za la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri hama iyo a nati a wina tsana aki ma atohngoh kyangwri hama iyo? Na afri ma amoh ma nati a hwa ma njoro kpeh? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Amehreh kpeh amgbasho a wina a keh kyangwri tsana a ŋoh kpeh, amehreh kpeh amgbasho ata nza akpeh a treh nambri reh, a nati a wina tswanza kyangwri tsana a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />&lt;&lt;Ka bu umbo a te nnoh ni leh nza ameh avuvu nimeh iyo atsi anzoh, nnoh ni sohroh kohnoh na mgbiri agbeh agba ata nza a yama nimeh iyo anzoh kpeh? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Ha neh ti bleh ma atsi anzoh la, &lt;Ta meh ti fufa nnoh ameh avuvu nimeh iyo anzoh,&gt; nnoh neh ni wina nza mgbiri agbeh agba ata nza a treh a yama nimeh iyo anzoh kpeh? Nnoh agugu reh, jiji fufa mgbiri agbeh agba nza yama nimeh iyo anzoh reh fya, ta a zohhoh nnoh nza alindeh fufa ameh abibi reh ni iyo atsi anzoh.<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Agbeh tasa maraa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Ama 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />&lt;&lt;Agbeh alindeh a nati a wina mara mara agbeh abibi kpeh, ka bu dehreh za agbeh abibi a nati a wina mara mara agbeh alindeh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Maka a nza agbeh a wina anyi na mara agbeh a ŋoh. Ma a nati a wina hwra mara agbeh mgbungba anyi ma atohtoh kpeh, ha mata ahwra mara agbeh inabi anyi ma atohtoh. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Kyangwri alindeh ka a de awumu alilehndeh a kate anyi ma ganzi awumu alilehndeh nza a yama ma agohsoh a ŋoh reh. Kyangwri abibi ka a de awumu abibi a kate anyi ma ganzi awumu abibi nza a yama ma agohsoh a ŋoh reh.A bu andromboh ata nza a yama nimeh agohsoh kyangwri ma a nati a bleh a kate.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">amboh Mina mboh Afri</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Ama 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />&lt;&lt;Mohnoh ni leh fi meh noh la, &lt;Ada, Ada,&gt; reh tsifa umbo? mohnoh neh ni leke ti lisa nnoh andromboh ata mya nza ni bleh noh la lisa nnoh reh. <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Akyo ata nza a ba na amya ta a sehreh meh, ta a lisa andromboh ata mya nza ni bleh ŋoh la ta a lisa reh, meh nati tsana noh ha kyangwri areh a tswanza umbo. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />A tswanza kyangwri ata nza a mina afiya a ŋoh reh, a kya inzi a tamba feh sa a gya chuhu ida reh ma ikpi kpakpa. Nza awi a ba ba ava afiya reh a nati a sohroh wina zuzu afiya reh kpeh la ma a mina alindeh. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Akyo ata neh nza a sehreh tsifa amya ta tufa mboh kpeh a tswanza Kyangwri ata nza a mina ida a ŋoh ta a gya chuhu ida reh alindeh ma inzi kpeh. Nza awi ava ida reh a nati a hwa ahwra na nambri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Nga Agohsoh Agba amboh de Ta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Ama 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Na ameh ata Amehreh Nnoh nza ka a bleh tsifa amboh ata areh a treh nambri ma ashotoh kyangwri mboh reh, a ka niye a na kafarnahum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Ahwra Agba amboh de ita anyi a yama, agba ŋoh reh la a kira na a ŋoh veve kpeh, a buti leh bishi waka a na ti kwo. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Agba amboh de ita mboh nza ka a sehreh tsifa ma ikpi Yeso reh, ka a tohmoh agbugba kyangwri Yahudawa amboh tswa a na na a ŋoh, la mata a luhu ŋoh ta a ba ba a nga wuwana ma ahwra ŋoh reh. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Nza maka a ba na Yeso reh maka avohvoh ŋoh yivoh, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri ata areh a tswa ti shingi ŋoh <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Kyangwri reh a kira inzi ambohroh tasa za a bu ŋoh nza a fanga hungroh mina ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh ambohroh areh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Yeso maka a na mboh ma amoh. Nza ka a ba ma inda afiya reh, agba amboh de ita reh ka a tohmoh iziza a ŋoh mboh a na la mata a bleh a ŋoh la: &lt;&lt;Agba ambohroh, agohsoh anzoh ta a kputuna kpeh meh tswa meh ti fi noh la ti ba afiya amya kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />A bu wohroh mya meh nza la meh tswa meh ti ba na anzoh kpeh. nnoh bleh tsifa anzoh reh ma, ahwra amya reh a nati hunji nana itoh a ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Mya na ikpi amya za meh bu ma hohroh wuwana akyo, tasa za meh bu na amboh de ita mboh ma ivoh amya. Meh kǝ bleh la nnoh ata areh, &lt;Na,&gt; a nati na; tasa za meh ti bleh ata ari la, &lt;Ba,&gt; a nati ba. Meh kǝ bleh ahwra amya la, &lt;Lisa dehreh,&gt; a nati lisa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Yeso nza ka a sehreh dehreh, ka a ŋara aniye, ka a gyuru ka a nza duma nza ma a tufa ŋoh reh, ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh bleh noh la, mya meh hehreh nga agohsoh gaga ika wohroh kpeh, ha ma Israila.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Kyangwri mboh amboh nza ma a tohmoh mboh reh nza maka a gyuru a ba amoh afiya reh ma a ba ba a nza ahwra reh kǝ hunji nana a ŋoh.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A yiri Amehreh Afya Kunu Anyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />A yanda kpeh, Yeso ka a na akpo afiya anyi maka a fi la Nayin, tasa amboh tufa a ŋoh tasa duma agba maka a tufa ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Nza maka a ba ni inda akpo afiya reh, maka a buti a gu kohmoh kyangwri anyi a kate a bu amehreh ata akre nza a mara ŋoh tsene ma atsifa a ŋoh za kǝ kwo. Tasa duma agba nyi akpo afiya reh ma a bu na afya reh. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Ada ambohroh nza ka a nza ŋoh reh, agohsoh a ŋoh ka a su na kwini na afiya reh ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kama kpanga kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Ma a huru a ka a na na a bara tundu kohmoh reh, tasa amboh gu ŋoh reh maka a shi ma akpo anyimbehreh. A ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kafa kyangwri, mya meh bleh noh la, hinga!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Amehreh ata nza na a kwo reh ka a hinga tuma atsifa, Yeso ka a wa a ŋoh a nga akre. <verse eid="LUK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Nyiri ka a te mboh gaga mata ka ariri Nnoh. &lt;&lt;Kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh agba kǝ krembena kate ma hohroh ambohroh,&gt;&gt;maka a bleh la, Nnoh kǝ ba ta a shingi kyangwri a ŋoh mboh mata anvara. <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Tsifa ata areh ma ikpi Yeso reh ka a yangana a treh akpokpo atsifi Yahudiya tasa ka a gohna a wa akpo inzi mboh.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso mboh ma Ayohana kyangwri Wra Batisma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Ama 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />amboh tufa Ayohana mboh maka a bleh ŋoh ma ikpi andromboh mboh reh. ka a fi mboh afri, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />ka a tohmoh mboh a na na Ada mata a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu noh wohroh ata nza ni nati ba reh ha meh ti kya iyo na akyo anyi tse?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Kyangwri mboh reh nza maka a ba na Yeso, maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ayohana kyangwri wra batisma a tohmoh reh a ba na anzoh meh ti luhu nnoh la,&lt;A bu noh wohroh nza ni nati ba reh, ha meh ti kya iyo na akyo anyi tse?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Na ameh wohroh Yeso ka a nga wuwana ma vara kyangwri amboh nza ma a bu na bishi mboh, amboh nza ma wuwana kpeh tasa amboh huru agugu mboh, tasa ka a vuru iyo ma amboh hama iyo mboh gaga. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />A nza dehreh ka a kira ma amboh nza ma tohmoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Gyuru na ni bleh noh ma Ayohana andromboh ata nza ni nza noh tasa nza ni sere nnoh reh: Amboh hama iyo mboh ma a nza atsifi, amboh gbo na a gboro ma a hinga a hehndeh, amboh bishi kohmoh ma a hunji wuwana, amboh kpa ashotoh ma a hunji a sehreh, amboh nza ma a kwo maka a hinga a yiri, tasa maka a bleh tsifa nana reh ma amboh nza ma anyinana atsi a bleh tsifa Nnoh. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Te atoh a bu na kyangwri wohroh ata nza a hwa ma aki tufa meh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Amboh tohmoh Ayohana nza maka a na amoh a treh, Yeso ka a leh atsifa na duma mboh reh ma ikpi Ayohana: &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ kate na ni nza noh umbo ma hohroh babba reh? A bu amgba bini ata inyo nza ka afo a kakama reh? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Kavoh kpeh reh neh, ni kǝ kate nati nza noh umbo? A bu kyangwri na ajija akuri mboh? Uwa, amboh were ajija akuri ata maka a nga mboh agba ma a bu ti nza nana ma a kasa ma afiyafiya agohgohmoh mboh. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Neh kǝ kate nati nza noh umbo? Kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh? Ha, meh bleh noh, a keh kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />A bu Ayohana mi ata amgbasho Nnoh nza bleh ma ikpi a ŋoh reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">&lt;Meh nati tohmoh kyangwri tohmoh mya ta a jitomo na amohnoh,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">Ata nza a nati a jiji a lisa nnoh aki amohnoh.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Meh bleh noh za la, nimeh amboh ata nza bu afya mi a mara ŋoh, akyo anyi amohnoh a mishi a keh Ayohana agba kpeh; akyo ata nza a bu akehreh amoh ma akpo afiya Nnoh reh a keh ŋoh agba.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Kyangwri mboh nambri, ka wa amboh sa hungroh gandu mboh, nza maka a sehreh tsifa Yeso reh, maka a sa tsifa Nnoh reh a tufa yehlehleh, mboh za Ayohana ta a wra mboh batisma. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Farisiyawa mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh neh maka a leke tsifa Nnoh ma ikpi amoh, ma a kira la Ayohana ta a wra mboh batisma kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />Yeso ka a bleh la, meh nati tsara ika kyangwri amboh ata areh na umbo? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Ma a tswanza amehreh mboh nza ma a tuma ma atsi kpakpranda rifa awumu maka a tuma a fi itoh amoh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">&lt;Mbohroh meh wri nnoh afifi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">Ni sohroh kira nnoh kpeh;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">mbohroh meh gu amumu kwo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">ni sohroh kpanga nnoh kpeh.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Ayohana kyangwri batisma tana a ba, a rya irya kpeh tasa za tana a wa amwo inabi kpeh, ni bleh noh la, &lt;A bu na inyo.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Amehreh kyangwri za tana a ba, a rya irya tasa za tana ta a wa amwo, ni bleh noh la, &lt;Nza nnoh kyangwri ata areh! a keh rya tasa wa, tasa za a de iza na amboh sa hungroh gandu tasa amboh kpakpana mboh!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Lomo Nnoh reh a tsana la a bu zizi, na amboh ata nza ma a sa a kira reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Afya kpakpana Anyi A hwara Hwana Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Farisiyawa mboh reh anyi a fi Yeso la ta a na na a rya irya nvishi na a ŋoh, Yeso ka a na na a tuma ma atsi rya irya. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Afya anyi neh hende a ŋoh a mishi a zanana kpeh ma akpo afiya wohroh reh, nza ka a sehreh la Yeso a buti rya irya ma afiya kyangwri Farisiyawa anyi, a ka a de ameh amgbo amehneh wo nyungo alindeh anyi nza ma a lisa na kpakpa onis, <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />tasa za ka a ba ba a shi ma nyina a ŋoh ma hohroh hwana a ŋoh, ta ka a leh a kpanga, mwueneh a ŋoh ka a leh a manda ŋoh hwana. Ka a firu hwana a ŋoh reh nashi na a ŋoh, a ka a fla mboh a de feh sa ka a wo mboh amehneh wo nyungo alindeh reh ma ikpi. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Farisiyawa ata nza ma a fi ŋoh reh nza maka a nza areh, a ka atsifa ma agohsoh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Mata a bleh la kyangwri reh bu amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh, bu ma a nza akyo nza a babara ŋoh reh a wina ha a ka bu afya ika tama la a bu afya kpakpana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yeso ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Siman, Meh kira meh ti a bleh noh andromboh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">&lt;&lt;Bleh meh, kyangwri tsana,&gt;&gt;a ka a kira dehreh.<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri mboh afri ma a de kohfoh ma amboh nga kohfoh hungroh. Ata na anyimbehreh ŋoh a de ŋoh jwa atungu, na afri ŋoh ka a de ŋoh jwa agrumavoh ida atungu. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Na afri ma amoh ma a bu na hungroh la mata a gyuru a fanga ŋoh kpeh, a ka a te kohhroh na kohfoh reh na afri ma amoh. Nehnehreh nimeh amoh atamaa ka a na ti a keh kira ŋoh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Siman ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;mya meh nza a nati bu akyo ata nza ma a te kohhroh na a ŋoh a keh gaga reh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">Yeso ka a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Ni hwra akpi reh yehlehleh,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Ma huru a ka a gyuruna a nza afya reh ta ka a bleh ma Siman la, &lt;&lt;Ni nza afya ata areh? Mya meh niye ba afiya anzoh ni sohroh nga meh amwo meh ti hwara hwana amya kpeh, afya reh neh avava hwana amya na mwueneh a ŋoh ta ka a firu nashi na ikpi a ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Ni sohroh sa meh ti nvinvi meh ameh ata mya nza ni ba afiya anzoh reh kpeh, afya reh neh nza anyi avoh mya nza ni niye ba reh, ka a tswa atsi leh nvinvi hwana amya. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Ni sohroh wo meh amehneh wo ma ikpi amya kpeh, afya reh neh a wo meh amehneh nyungo alindeh ma hwana amya. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />A bu dehreh ŋa meh bleh noh la maa te kohro na vara kpakpana a ŋoh mboh reh. Akyo ata nza ma a gu kpakpana a ŋoh a te kohhroh shidi ma reh, a bu na kira shidi ma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Ma huru Yeso ka a bleh ma afya reh la, &lt;&lt;Ma a gu kpakpana anzoh a te kohhroh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Mgbiri sene maka buti tsifa alulu ma itoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;ka bu anyi areh nza ka la ŋoh ka a gu kpakpana a te kohhroh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Yeso neh ka a bleh ma afya reh la, &lt;&lt;Nga agohsoh anzoh kǝ nga nnoh wuwana, na ti tuma alindeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ifiya Amboh Anyi ma A wa Yeso A na amoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Areh nza ka a gǝga, Yeso ka a leh a hehndeh a treh akpokpo afiyafiya akǝkehreh tasa agbugbaa, atsi leh hwra tsifa nana a bleh ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh. Tana a bu mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />tasa za mgbiri ifiya mboh amboh ata mata ka a katsi huru agugu a kate ma itoh amoh mboh tasa ata bishi mboh: Maryamu ata nza anyi Magadala reh, anyi ma itoh a ŋoh tama a katsi huru agugu atehrehkifi na anyi a kate; <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yowanan afya Kuza, nza a bu agba afiya Hirudus; Suzana; tasa vara amboh tswa. Ifiya amboh ata areh maka shingi mboh atsi hende amoh mboh reh na awumu amoh mboh.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakranda Kyangwri Biya Awumu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Ama 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mk 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Duma agba maka buti dohsohna tasa kyangwri mboh maka bu ti ba na Yeso anyi akpokpo afiyafiya mboh, a ka a bleh mboh kakranda ata areh la: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />&lt;&lt;Kyangwri hafa anyi ka a na atsi hwina biroh ma aye a ŋoh. nza ka a buti hwina biroh reh mgbiri amboh tswa maka a sangrana a na amoh ni ikpi aki agba; maka a gǝga akpeh tasa akuku inza mboh maka a tanga a rya. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />mgbiri tswa ma a hwa a na amoh ni ikpi kpakpa, a ka kate a te agbugba, awumu reh ka a shi ka a hwara a hunji amwo kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Mgbiri biroh mboh neh maka a sangrana a na amoh hohroh atohtoh, a ka a te agbugba neh atohtoh reh ka a hahamba awumu mboh reh. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />amboh mgbiri tswa nza maka a sangrana a na ma avru alindeh. Awumu reh ka a hinga a zohhoh, a keh biroh reh agrumavoh ida agrumavoh ma ta ka a jiji a hwina reh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Nza ka a bleh ata areh, a ka a bleh a yi ivoh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a bu na ashotoh sere, ta a sehreh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lomo Kakranda Kyangwri Biya reh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Ama 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Mk 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Amboh tufa Yeso mboh reh maka luhu ŋoh lomo kakranda reh, <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />ka kira la, &lt;&lt;Ma a nga noh lomo la ti wina noh tsifa ayuhu ata kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh, na amboh tswa neh a ba tswanza kakranda reh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">&lt;Ma a bu na iyo neh, maka a nza a wina kpeh;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">maka a sehreh neh, ma a sohroh a sehreh a wina kpeh.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A tsana Ma Ikpi Kakranda Kyangwri Biya reh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Ama 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Mk 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />&lt;&lt;Kakranda reh a tsana la: biroh reh a bu tsifa Nnoh reh. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />amboh nza ma a hwa ma aki agba reh ma a bu amboh nza ma a sehreh neh, agugu ka a gǝga a fira tsifa reh anyi ma agohsoh amoh reh a na a ŋoh, la mata hunji sa tsifa reh kira mata nvara kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />amboh ma ikpi kpakpa reh ma a bu mboh wohroh nza ma a sa tsifa reh ni johjoh na ameh nza maka a sehreh reh, neh ma a bu na ariri kpeh. Ma a bu na nga kira shidi ma, na ameh tsara maka a hwa a na amoh ari. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />biroh ata nza a hwa a na hohroh atohtoh reh ma a tswanza amboh nza ma a sehreh atsifi Nnoh reh, nza maka a buti hinga maka a gu kohnoh inziyo agba ka a fi, asabara tasa nana mboh, ma a hinga ayiyina kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Biroh ata avru alindeh reh neh a tswanza amboh agohsoh alindeh, nza maka a sehreh tsifa reh, maka a sa a de na agohsoh amoh anyimbehreh mata a gyuru a mara gaga.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Afitila Ma Hohroh Gbugba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mk 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />&lt;&lt;Akyo ka mishi a mloh afitila a gya a huho ma hohroh gbugba ha ma hohroh abla kpeh. Maka a gya ma ikpoh kohhroh shira la amboh nza ma a buti ba mata a nza zana. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Andromboh a yama atsi huho ata nza ma a nati a vuru kpeh, tasa andromboh nza ma a nati a gu a fi a kate ma inziyo kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Lisa nza noh nza ni sere nnoh. Ha a bu anyi wohroh ata nza a bu ni wohroh ma a nati kpiri nga ŋoh gaga; akyo wohroh ata nza a bu ni wohroh kpeh, ha a bu ata ŋoh nza a kohnoh la ŋoh a bu ni wohroh ma a nati a sa a hwana anyi na a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akre Yeso Tasa Atsini Mboh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Ama 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mk 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Na ameh wohroh akre Yeso tasa atsini mboh maka a ba ti nza ŋoh, ma a hunji a ba nda a ŋoh kpeh, duma mboh ma a keh gaga. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Akyo anyi ka a ba ba a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Nza atono tasa atsi anzoh mboh ma a buti shi ma inziyo a bana mata a nza noh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Ka kira la, &lt;&lt;Nna amya tasa atsi mya mboh ma a bu amboh nza ma a sehreh tsifa Nnoh mata a sa a gu a te ndohmoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A de Inyo Agba Akuku</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Ama 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mk 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Ibi anyi Yeso ka a bleh ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ba nnoh meh ti te hwa na na ni ba fini ata ari.&gt;&gt; maka a hwa niye a na ma gbogblondo amwo mata ka a na amoh. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Nza maka a buti kama gbogblondo amwo reh a na, mla ka a de ŋoh. Inyo agba ka a ba ma ikpi amwo reh, amwo ka a leh a su nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh, maka a bu nimeh nyiri agba.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a na na a yiri ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada ambohroh, agba ambohroh, amwo waka a nati rya reh!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">A ka a hinga a shi ta ka a bleh inyo reh tasa amwo gofo reh; inyo reh ka a tamba atsifi ka a kukuna. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Ka a luhu amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Nga agohsoh amohnoh reh a bu ma?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">Nimeh nyiri maka a luhu la a ka bu anyi areh nza atsifa na inyo tasa amwo, maka a sehreh ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Wuwana ma Kyangwri Bishi Inyo Anyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Ama 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mk 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Maka a kama ka a na amoh ni mgba Garasinawa, nza a bu na iba fini Galili. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Yeso nza ka a tamba a ba aniye fini ma inzi a tuhwara reh, a ka a dohsohna na kyangwri anyi nza a bu na bishi inyo anyi akpo afiya reh. kǝ yanda kyangwri reh ka a sohroh a were kuri kpeh ha la ta a leh ma afiya kpeh, a ka a leh ma atsi ikpi nyifo mboh. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Kyangwri bishi inyo reh nza ka a nza Yeso, a ka a kpanga a kate ta ka a hwa ada gboro ŋoh inzi ma hohroh a hwana a ŋoh a kpanga a vuru agba a ŋoh yivoh,&lt;&lt;Ni kǝ kira umbo na amya, Yeso, Amehreh Nnoh ata nza a keh agba reh? Meh kwere nnoh, kama nga meh iya kpeh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Neh Yeso kǝ tsifa na huru agugu reh la ta a kate anyi ma itoh kyangwri reh. A ka a tswa ti de ŋoh na tutu dehreh, ma a lafa ŋoh ivoh tasa hwa na na rishi njehnjehreh tasa karafi ata hwana, a ka a shishimba lafa reh, inyo reh ka a kakama ŋoh a na inzi a tuhwara.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yeso ka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Isa anzoh bu anyi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">A ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Isa amya bu vara a ka a kira dehreh, tsifa la inyo mboh reh ma bu gaga nza ma aniye ma itoh a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Maka a leh avohvoh ŋoh ka a nina la ta a kama a katsi mboh a kate a na a were a na ma njoro kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Vara atambri afiya mboh ma bu ti hende rya irya ma akachi agbohgboh a huru. Inyo mboh reh maka avohvoh Yeso la mboh mata a kate a na na niye ma itoh atambri afiya mboh reh, a ka nga mboh kira. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Inyo mboh reh nza maka a kate anyi itoh kyangwri reh, maka a na na niye ma itoh atambri afiya mboh reh, maka a gbo ka a tamba a na amoh angaga fini reh, maka a na na niye amwo, amwo ka a fira mboh a na a ŋoh.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />amboh sumu atambri afiya mboh reh nza maka a nza andromboh nza a te reh, maka a gbo a na na a bleh ma akpo afiya tasa ma akpo inzi ata nda, <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />tasa kyangwri mboh maka a kate a ba ti nza andromboh ata nza a te reh. Nza maka a ba na Yeso, maka a nza kyangwri ata inyo mboh nza ma a kate anyi itoh ŋoh reh, ti tuma ma hohroh hwana Yeso, kǝ tuma na akuri ma itoh tasa ni lomo ŋoh yehlehleh; maka a nyiri. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />amboh nza ma a nza reh, maka a bleh ma kyangwri mboh reh ha a bu lele nza ma a nga kyangwri bishi inyo reh wuwana. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Ma huru kyangwri mboh ma akpo afiya Garasinawa mboh reh maka a luhu Yeso la ta ata mboh, telema nyiri a de mboh gaga. A ka aniye ma gbogblondo amwo reh ta ka a na a ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Kyangwri ata inyo nza ma a kate anyi ma itoh a ŋoh reh ka a kwere Yeso la ŋoh ta a wa ŋoh, Yeso ka ata ŋoh avoh, la, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />&lt;&lt;Gyuru na anzoh afiya ti na ni a bleh mboh andromboh Nnoh nza a lisa nnoh gaga reh.&gt;&gt; Kyangwri reh ka a na a ŋoh na a leh a hwra a bleh ma kyangwri mboh nambri ma akpo afiya reh andromboh ata Yeso nza a lisa ŋoh reh.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kohmoh Anyifa Anyi Tasa Afiya Bishi Anyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Ama 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mk 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Yeso nza ka a gyuru a ba a ŋoh, duma agba maka a sa ŋoh, tama a leh a bana ŋoh nambri ma amoh. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Na ameh wohroh kyangwri anyi isa a ŋoh nza a bu Yayirus a bu ŋoh nza bu agba ata ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh, a ka a ba ba a hwa ma hohroh a hwana Yeso, ta ka avohvoh ŋoh la ta a wa ŋoh a ba afiya a ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />la anyifa a ŋoh anyi, nza a bu na ahushi agrumavoh a hwa afri, waka a buti a kwo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Yeso nza ka a buti na a ŋoh, kǝ hwa shidi duma mboh reh mata a mbrihini ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Nimeh amoh afya anyi tana a yama ma a huru ata nza a bu na bishi kpa imya ata kǝ te ahushi agrumavoh a hwa afri, kǝ mla ivoh a ŋoh atsi hehndeh fa wra, akyo wina nga ŋoh wuwana kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />A ka a ba na mgba nyina a ŋoh ta ka a bara anene kuri a ŋoh, ma a huru heri kpa imya a ŋoh reh ka a shimbana.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Yeso ka a luhu la, &lt;&lt;Bu anyi ka a bara meh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Nza maka ata na nambri, Abitrusu ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;agba Mbohroh, kyangwri ma a bu gaga tasa ma a buti yiyi nnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Yeso ka a bleh la, Akyo anyi a bara meh; Mi wina la wuwana wohroh kǝ kate nyi na amya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Ma huru afiya reh, nza ka a nza la ma a nati a nza ŋoh a wina a ka a ba ba a hwa ma hwana a ŋoh a kpokprona. ma tomo kyangwri mboh reh nambri, a ka a bleh mboh tsifa ŋoh nza a bara ŋoh reh tasa lele imya reh nza a shimbana a shi hwana anyimbehreh reh. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Ma huru ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Anyifa, nga agohsoh anzoh kǝ nnoh wuwana. Na ti tuma alindeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Yeso nza ka a treh a buti tsifa, kyangwri tohmoh anyi ka a ba anyi afiya Yayirus, ŋoh nza bu agba amboh de ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh, ka a ba ba a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kama za wa kyangwri tsana reh aniye nza kpeh. Anyifa anzoh reh kǝ kwo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Nza ka a sehreh ata areh, Yeso ka a bleh ma Yayirus la, Kama nyiri kpeh, zakǝ nga agohsoh anzoh ma, a nati a hunji wuwana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Nza ka a na niye ma afiya Yayirus, a sohroh a kira la akyo ta a tufa ŋoh niye a na kpeh ta a bu Abitrusu tasa Ayohana tasa Yakubu, tasa alehmeh anyifa reh mboh ma akre ma. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Neh, kyangwri mboh reh nambri maka a buti kpanga a kohnoh ŋoh.Yeso ka a bleh mboh &lt;&lt;Shimba nnoh kpanga reh. A kwo kpeh a buti leh mla mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Maka a wene ŋoh, ma a wina la kǝ kwo. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />A ka a de ŋoh ma ivoh ta ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Anyifa amya, hinga!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Fene a ŋoh ka a gyuru a ba ta ka a hinga ma hwana anyimbehreh. Ma huru Yeso a ka a bleh mboh la mata a nga ŋoh andromboh ta irya. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Alehmeh mboh maka a ŋara aniye ma, a ka akpi mboh ashotoh la ma a kama a bleh ma akyo andromboh ŋoh nza a lisa reh kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yeso A tohmoh amboh Tufa a ŋoh mboh Agrumavoh A hwa afri reh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Ama 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mk 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Yeso nza ka a fi amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri a gya ma akpo anyimbehreh, ka a nga mboh wuwana tasa aniye ata nza ma a nati wina katsi inyo mboh nambri a kate tasa ata lisa mgbiri bishi mboh za, <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />tasa za ka a tohmoh mboh la mata a na na a bleh tsifa akpo afiya Nnoh reh tasa za la mata a nga ma amboh bishi mboh wuwana. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Ka a bleh la: &lt;&lt;Kama gu nnoh andromboh de na nnoh hende reh kpeh ha ikpoh kpeh, a kpanga kpeh, irya kpeh, hungroh kpeh, ashidi kuri kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Ha a kama bu afiya anyi ni niye nnoh, tuma noh ma a huru a gu a na a te ameh ata nza ni nati ta nnoh akpo afiya wohroh reh. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Nza kyangwri mboh reh ma a sa noh kpeh, kpohkpoh noh huru hwana amohnoh feh si ta nnoh akpo afiya amoh reh, ti tsana mboh la ni kate ta mboh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Maka a hinga ka a na akpokpo afiya afiya mboh reh, mata ka ahwra tsifa nana Nnoh a bleh tasa mata ka a nga kyangwri mboh wuwana a treh atsifi.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hirudus A kohnoh Gaga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Ama 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mk 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Na ameh wohroh Hirudus nza a bu Agohmoh agba reh nza ka a sehreh andromboh nza a buti na nambri. A ka a wa ŋoh aniye, la kyangwri amboh tswa ma a hehndeh a bleh la Ayohana a kwo a yiri, <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />mgbiri la Iliya a krembena a te, itswa za la a bu amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh na kiri reh anyimbehreh amoh tana a kwo ka a gyuru a ba a ŋoh yama anyi na amehmeh. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Hirudus neh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nza a bu Ayohana reh, meh ti bleh la tama a shimba ŋoh ikpi. A bu anyi, wohroh, mya nza ni sere tsifa mboh ma ikpi a ŋoh dehreh?&gt;&gt; Tasa ta ka la ŋoh a nati a nza ŋoh.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A nga Rya ma Kyangwri Dubu Atungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Ama 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mk 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoh 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />amboh sa tohmoh nana Yeso a bleh reh nza maka a gyuru a ba amoh, maka a bleh ma Yeso andromboh mboh nza ma a lisa reh. Ma huru a ka a wa mboh a de maka a kpina ni ikpi amoh ka a na akpo afiya anyi nza maka a fi la Betsaida, <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />duma mboh reh maka a wina dehreh neh maka a tufa ŋoh. A ka a sa mboh ta ka atsifa na amoh ma ikpi akpo afiya Nnoh, ka nga wuwana ma amboh nza ma a wuwana kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Na mgba nnoh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh maka a ba ba a bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Tavoh duma mboh reh tama a na amoh na a fa andromboh irya tasa atsi leh, ma akpo afiya mboh amboh anyi Mbohroh ma bu ma hohroh bini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Nga mboh nnoh andromboh mata rya.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Maka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Meh bu na afohfohnoh atungu ma tasa kpo. Ni kira la meh ti na ni sa irya ma duma mboh areh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Kyangwri dubu atungu tama a yama ma a huru.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Neh a ka a bleh ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Bleh mboh nnoh la mata a tuma ma agǝshi agrumavoh ida atungu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />amboh tufa ŋoh reh maka a lisa dehreh, kyangwri mboh reh nambri ma amoh maka a tuma ma inzi. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Nza ka a gu afohfohnoh atungu tasa kpo afri reh ka a nza inza a na, ka a kwende Nnoh ta ka a kya mboh. Ta ka a nga ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh la ma a gafa ma kyangwri mboh reh. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Maka a rya a hunu nambri ma amoh, amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh maka a fira mgbiri ata nza na a hwa reh a su akwri agrumavoh a hwa afri.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abitrusu A bleh Tsifa na Ikpi Kristi na Aniye A ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Na ameh anyi Yeso a buti kwere Nnoh ma atsi huho ŋoh tasa amboh tufa ŋoh mboh tama a bu na a ŋoh, a ka a luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Duma mboh reh maka a bleh la mya bu anyi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Maka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Itswa ma a bleh la nnoh bu Ayohana kyangwri wra batisma; mgbiri tswa la nnoh bu Iliya; tasa za amboh tswa la, a bu amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh anyimbehreh amboh ata amehmeh reh a gyuru a ba yama.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Ka a luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mohnoh neh? ni bleh noh la mya meh bu anyi?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Abitrusu ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Ni bu Kristi ata nza anyi na Nnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A bleh kwo A ŋoh A wina</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Ama 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mk 8:31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Yeso ka akpi ashotoh ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh la mata a kama a bleh ma akyo kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Tasa ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Amehreh Kyangwri a nati wa iya ma atsetse kanga tasa ma a nati leke ŋoh ka wa Agba Firist mboh, tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh, tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh. Ma a nati a mla ŋoh a kwo kanga ibi na atatoh ŋoh a nati a hinga a yiri ta a fene yama.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Ma huru a ka a bleh mboh nambri la: &lt;&lt;Nza akyo a nati tufa meh, a nati a leke ikpi a ŋoh kanga ta a gu gbohrohgboh a ŋoh ta a tufa meh ibibi. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Akyo ata nza a kira ta anvara na fene a ŋoh, a nati a hunji kpeh, akyo ata neh nza a nati a hunji fene a ŋoh kpeh tsifa amya, a nati anvara. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />A bu umbo a nati a bu zohhoh ŋoh la kyangwri ta a hunji inziyo agba areh nambri, ŋoh neh ta a hunji nvara kpeh ha mata a lohfoh ŋoh? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Nza akyo a kwo isa na amya tasa tsifa amya, Amehreh Kyangwri za a nati a kwo isa na a ŋoh ameh ata nza a nati a ba nimeh agba a ŋoh tasa za nimeh agba Ada a ŋoh, tasa ata mara tohmoh a ŋoh mboh amboh zanana reh. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />meh bleh noh zizi, mgbiri amboh tswa nza ma a buti shi na ma areh ma a nati a mishi a nza kwo kpeh ma sa a nza kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Itoh Yeso ka Sehnehna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />A gu ibi a tsitsiya neh Yeso kǝ a bleh tsifa mboh reh a treh, ka a fi Abitrusu, Ayohana Tasa Yakubu ka a wa mboh ka a na ma agbohgboh la ŋoh ta a kwere Nnoh. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Nza ka a buti kwere Nnoh reh, tohmoh a ŋoh ka a sehnehna, ajija akuri a ŋoh reh ka a kasa a tswanza a bu rya a nza reh. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Kyangwri afri, Musa tasa Iliya, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />maka krembena a kate na zanana ika ata inza reh, maka a shi atsifa na Yeso ma ikpi ata tsifa Nnoh nza a nati a su mata a mla ŋoh a kwo ma Urushalima reh. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Abitrusu mboh ma ziza mboh mla ka a sa mboh a gu, nza maka a fyafyana yama reh, maka a nza zanana Yeso tasa kyangwri afri atsi shi na a ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Kyangwri mboh reh nza maka a buti a na amoh ata Yeso, Abitrusu ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ada ambohroh, a zohhoh meh ti bu ma mareh! Ba nnoh meh ti la dasa atatoh, anyi anzoh, anyi Musa a ŋoh, tasa anyi Iliya a ŋoh.&gt;&gt; A wina andromboh ŋoh nza a buti a bleh reh kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Nza ka a treh a buti tsifa, avereh ka a kate ka a hama mboh, maka niye nimeh avereh reh na nyiri. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Maka a sehreh agba anyi ma hohroh avereh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ata reh bu Amehreh amya ata mya nza ni seh ŋoh reh; kya nnoh ashotoh na tsifa a ŋoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Agba reh nza ka atsifa a treh, maka a nza la Yeso a bu ŋoh tsene. amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh maka a de ma agohsoh amoh, maka a bleh akyo kpeh na ameh wohroh andromboh ata mboh nza ma a nza reh.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso a nga wuwana ma Amehreh Anyi Ata Nza a bu Na Huru Agugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Ibi nza ka a yanda, Yeso mboh ma amboh atatoh reh nza maka a tamba anyi agbohgboh a ba amoh, duma agba maka a dohsohna na a ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Kyangwri anyi nimeh hohroh duma mboh reh a ka a fi a kate mama la, &lt;&lt;kyangwri tsana, mi kwere nnoh nza amehreh mya, a bu ŋoh wohroh tsene nza a bu amehreh amya. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Huru agugu ka ava ŋoh ta ka a kpanga ma a huru; a gu ŋoh ka a de ŋoh a hwa a kwo a ka a leh a te ahohhoh ma aniye. Ka ata ŋoh fifi kpeh waka a nati mla ŋoh a tavoh. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Mya meh kwere amboh tufa anzoh mboh la mata a shingi meh mata a katsi huru agugu a kate, ma a sohroh a wina kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Yeso ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mohnoh kyangwri amboh ameh ata areh, nza ni bu noh amboh sa tsifa leke tasa mohnoh agugu mboh reh! Na ameh atamaa feh meh nati tuma na amohnoh, meh ti soh ivoh yira na amohnoh?&gt;&gt; Ka a bleh ma kyangwri reh la, &lt;&lt;De amehreh anzoh reh ba ma mareh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Amehreh reh nza a buti ba, agugu reh ka a gu ŋoh ava inzi ka a hwa a nyiri itoh. Yeso ka a hwa huru agugu reh, ta ka a fufa bishi reh ta ka a gu ŋoh a nga alehmeh yama. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Nambri ma amoh maka a shi a ŋara aniye ma na andromboh ata Nnoh nza a lisa reh.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yeso A gyuru Atsifa za ma Ikpi Kwo a ŋoh</para>
  <para style="r" vid="LUK 9:43">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Ama 17:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mk 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Nza maka a treh a shi a ŋara aniye na andromboh ata Yeso nza a leh a lisa reh, ka a bleh ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh la, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />&lt;&lt;Hana nnoh ashotoh amohnoh alindeh ti sere nnoh andromboh mi nza ni nati a bleh noh reh: Amehreh Kyangwri a nati tana meh ta a yi meh a nga ma ivoh kyangwri mboh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Ma a sohroh a sehreh a wina kpeh andromboh nza na a bleh reh. Ma a huho mboh, la mata a kama a sehreh a wina kpeh, tasa maka a nyiri mata a luhu ŋoh a sehreh a wina kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anyi A nati a bu agbaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Yaha aniye ka a hinga mboh ma itoh amoh ma ikpi la a bu anyi a nati a keh agba nimeh amoh. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yeso, nza ka a wina kohnoh nimeh agohsoh amoh a nza, a ka a gu amehreh akehreh anyi dehreh la ta a ba ba a shi ma nda a ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Ma huru ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a sa amehreh akehreh ata areh nimeh isa amya a sa meh mi; tasa akyo ata nza a sa meh a sa ata nza a tohmoh meh. Akyo ata nza a bu mbimbi nimeh amohnoh nambri bu ŋoh a keh agba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Akyo Ata Nza A leke Nnoh kpeh, A bu Amohnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Ayohana ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Agba, mbohroh meh nza kyangwri anyi a leh a fufa bishi inyo nimeh isa anzoh, mbohroh meh kǝ shwa ŋoh, la ŋoh a bu anyimbehreh nimeh ambohroh kpeh,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />&lt;&lt;Kama shwa nnoh kpeh,&gt;&gt; Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Akyo nza a leke nnoh kpeh a bu amohnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Leke Ma Samariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Ameh a ŋoh ata nza ma a nati a gu ŋoh a hinga a ka a na a ŋoh inza reh kǝ ba nda, Yeso ka a kira la ŋoh a nati a na a ŋoh Urushalima. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />A ka a tohmoh amboh sa tohmoh mboh reh la mata a jitomo na a ŋoh, maka a na akpo afiya Samariya la mata a na na a hehreh a lisa awumu mboh reh a gya a bana ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Kyangwri mboh reh neh maka a leke mata a sa ŋoh, la a buti na a ŋoh Urushalima. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh Yakubu tasa Ayohana nza maka a nza dehreh, maka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, ni kira reh meh ti a bleh shira ta tamba anyi inza ta a ba ba a lofo umbo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Yeso ka a gyuru a hwa mboh, <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />mata ka a na amoh akpo afiya anyi.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">amboh bleh la ma A nati A tufa Yeso Ma a nati a wa iya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Nza maka a bu ti hende a na aki, kyangwri anyi ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati tufa na atsi ata nza ni nati na reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yeso a kira la, &lt;&lt;Avava bini mboh ma bu na dashi amoh mboh tasa akuku inza mboh ma bu na avru amoh mboh, Amehreh Kyangwri neh a bu na atsi fi ikpi a ŋoh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Ka a bleh ma kyangwri anyi za la, &lt;&lt;tufa meh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Kyangwri reh neh a kira la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh ta meh ti na ni nyifo ada amya fya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Ta kohmoh mboh mata anyifo kohmoh amoh mboh, na neh ti na ni hwra tsifa kpra Agohmoh Nnoh bleh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Anyi wa za a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati tufa nnoh, Ada; ta meh ti na ni a bleh ma mara amya mboh fya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a nati a jiji hafa ta a gyuruna ka a nza nyina a nati a na, a zohhoh na akpo afiya Nnoh ata inza reh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso A tohmoh agrumavoh ida atehrehkifi na anyi a hwa afri a kate.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Ata areh nza ka a gǝga Ada ka a seh mgbiri amboh tswa agrumavoh da atehrehkifi a hwa afri ka a tohmoh mboh ma afafri a na tohmoh na a ŋoh mata a na akpo afiyafiya tasa atsifi atsi ŋoh nza a nati na reh. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Yeso Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Awumu ata nza ma a nati fasa reh a bu gaga, amboh ndohmoh reh neh ma a bu shidi ma. Nza bu dehreh, kwere turoh Ada ata fasa awumu reh, ta a tohmoh amboh te ndohmoh mboh reh, mata a na na a fasa a ŋoh awumu reh. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Na nnoh! nehnehreh Nza nnoh neh meh tohmoh nnoh kate tswanza atashi mboh ma hohroh ava aye mboh. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Kama de noh hungroh, ha a kpanga hungroh ha akpehtreh hwana; tasa kama shi tsifa nnoh na akyo ma aki kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />&lt;&lt;Nza ni niye nnoh ma afiya anyi, jiji bleh noh la,&lt;Afiya areh ta tuma alindeh.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Nza kyangwri kira tuma alindeh a yama ma a huru, agohsoh anzoh a nati kukuna na a ŋoh; nza a bu dehreh kpeh, a nati a gyuru a ba na anzoh. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />tuma noh ma afiya wohroh, rya nnoh tasa ti wa nnoh ha bu mboh ma a nga noh, akyo ata nza a te ndohmoh ma a nati a nga ŋoh firoh a ŋoh. Kama hende tre nnoh afiyafiya mboh kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />&lt;&lt;Nza ni nnoh ma akpo afiya anyi maka a sa noh, rya nnoh andromboh ata nza ma nga noh, <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />ti nga nnoh wuwana ma amboh bishi mboh nza ma a yama ma a huru reh, &lt;Kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh kǝ bu ma nda amohnoh.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Nza ni na nnoh akpo afiya anyi neh ma a sa noh kpeh, na nnoh ma akeki amoh mboh ti bleh noh la, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />&lt;Ha a bu huru akpo afiya amohnoh ata nza a handana ma hwana Mbohroh meh nati kpohkpoh yi ta nnoh. mohnoh neh ti wina noh za la kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh kǝ ba nda!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Meh bleh noh zizi la ma ibi hwra akpi Nnoh reh, Nnoh a nati a nza kwini Sodom mboh a keh akpo afiya agba reh.<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />&lt;&lt;Iya agba na amohnoh korasinu mboh! Iya agba na amohnoh Betsaida mboh! agbugba ndohmoh ata meh ti kǝ lisa na amohnoh ma a bleh la meh ti ni lisa ma mgba Taya tasa Sidon dehreh, bu tama a gbo ta aki agugu amoh reh mata a tuma na akuri kpanga kwo mata a fira atoh shira a were ma itoh. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Nnoh a nati a nza kwini Taya mboh tasa Sidon mboh ibi hwra akpi a keh nnoh mohnoh. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Tasa nnoh, Kafarnahum! Ni kira ti gu ikpi anzoh ka na ma avereh inza? Uwa! Ma a nati a gu nnoh a fi a na nimeh afiya shira.<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />&lt;&lt;Yeso ka a bleh ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh la, akyo ata nza a sehreh noh a sehreh meh; akyo ata nza a leke nnoh a leke meh; akyo ata nza a leke meh a leke akyo ata nza a tohmoh meh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Agrumavoh da atehrehkifi na anyi a hwa afri mboh reh. maka a gyuru a ba na johjoh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, a wa inyo mboh za ma a sa tsifa ambohroh a kira, nza meh bleh mboh andromboh nimeh isa anzoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Meh nza Agugu a hwa anyi inza tswanza yenge anyi inza. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Sehreh nnoh! Mya meh nga nnoh wuwana ti huya nnoh iyoh mboh tasa ina mboh, tasa za ni nati keh nnoh wuwana amboh ata nza ma a fi noh ma tohmoh reh; andromboh abibi a nati hunji noh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Mohnoh neh kama johjoh la huru agugu reh a sehreh noh kpeh, johjoh nnoh la ma a ŋa isa amohnoh ma inza.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Na ameh wohroh Yeso, nimeh johjoh gaga nyi ma huru zanana, ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Meh riri nnoh, Ada, Nnoh ata inza tasa ata inzi, la ni hama andromboh mboh amboh ata areh ma amboh lomo tasa amboh wina, tasa ti kǝ vuru ma amehreh akǝkehreh nnoh. Haa, Ada, areh ni nza a zohhoh nnoh.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />&lt;&lt;Ada amya a nga meh awumu mboh reh nambri. Akyo anyi a wina Amehreh reh kpeh a bu alehmeh ma, tasa akyo a wina Alehmeh reh kpeh a bu Amehreh a ŋoh reh tasa amboh ata amehreh reh nza a seh ta a vuru ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Ma huru Yeso a ka a gyuruna a na na amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh ta ka a bleh mboh na ayuhu la, &lt;&lt;Te atoh a bu na iyo ata nza a nza andromboh mohnoh nza ni nza noh. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />meh bleh noh la, amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh mboh gaga tasa agohgohmoh mboh ma a kira la mboh mata a nza andromboh ata mohnoh nza ni nza noh neh meh bleh noh ma a nza kpeh, tasa la mata a sehreh andromboh mohnoh nza ni sehreh noh neh ma a sehreh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyangwri Samariya Alindeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Ibi anyi, kyangwri tsana akpi Musa anyi ka a hinga a shi la ŋoh ta tsara Yeso a nza. Ka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana meh nati lisa lele meh ti hunji fene ata tuma atono?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />&lt;&lt;Tama a ŋa la mboh ma amgbasho akpi Musa reh?&gt;&gt;Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni a bleh nza noh lele?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Kyangwri reh ka a kira la: &lt;&lt;Kira na Ada Nnoh anzoh na agohsoh anzoh nambri tasa na fene anzoh nambri tasa na wuwana anzoh nambri tasa na kohnoh anzoh nambri&gt; tasa za ti, &lt;Kira na atohngoh anzoh tswanza nza ni kira na ikpi anzoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni lisa yehlehleh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Lisa nnoh dehreh ni nati hunji noh fene.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Kyangwri tsana akpi reh ka a kira la ŋoh ta a tsana la ŋoh wa bu yehlehleh, neh a ka a luhu Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Ka a bu anyi bu atohngoh amya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri a buti tamba anyi Urushalima a na Jeriko, nza ka aniye ma ivoh ayuhu mboh. maka a fufa ŋoh akuri mboh, mata a mla a ŋoh mata a na amoh amoh, mata ka ata ŋoh na mgbiri fene. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Firist anyi za a buti gu aki wohroh anyimbehreh, nza ka a nza kyangwri reh, a ka a kya a gǝga aki anyi tse. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Kyangwri shingi amboh te ndohmoh nimeh ida Nnoh ata nza anyi alohsoh Alawi za, nza ka a ba a huru nza ka a nza ŋoh, a ka a kya a gǝga aki anyi tse a na ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Kyangwri samariya anyi neh a buti na a ŋoh hende, a ka a ba atsi ata kyangwri reh nza a bu; nza ka a nza ŋoh, ka a nza kwini kyangwri reh. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />A ka a na na a lafa ŋoh ibla a ŋoh mboh reh, ta ka awo ŋoh amehneh tasa amwo inabi. Ma huru a ka a gu kyangwri reh a gya ma ikpi nyama a ŋoh, ta ka a gu a na atsi tuma fo anyi ta ka a nga ŋoh irya. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Ibi na afri, ka a gu hungroh kabo afri a nga kyangwri tuma a nza atsi tuma fo reh, ta ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;Lisa sumu meh noh kyangwri reh, nza meh gyuru ba mya reh, meh nati gyuru mishi nnoh andromboh ata ni mla ma ikpi a ŋoh reh.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Yeso ka a luhu kyangwri tsana reh la,&lt;&lt;Nimeh kyangwri mboh atatoh reh a bu atamaa bu atohngoh kyangwri ata nza aniye ma ivoh ayuhu mboh reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />amboh wina lomo akpi maka kira la, &lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a nza kwini ŋoh reh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Yeso ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Na ti na ni lisa ika wohroh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso Ma Afiya Marta Tasa maryamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Yeso mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh nza maka a bu nimeh hehndeh, a ka a ba ma akpo afiya anyi atsi ata afiya anyi isa a ŋoh a bu Marta a ka a sa ŋoh a na mgba afiya a ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />A bu na afi anyi isa a ŋoh bu Maryamu, a ka tuma ma hohroh hwana Ada a sehreh tsana a ŋoh mboh reh. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Marta neh ka a kakamana kavoh a te ndohmoh mboh reh nambri ata mboh nza ma a nati a te reh. A ka a ba na a ŋoh ka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, ni wina la afi mya ata mya meh leh te ndohmoh mboh reh nambri na ikpi amya kpeh? Bleh ŋoh ta a ba ba shingi meh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Ada ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Marta, Marta! Ni wa aniye ma ikpi anzoh tasa ni kputu ahroh anzoh ma ikpi awumu gaga, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />neh ma a kira andromboh anyimbehreh ma. Maryamu kǝ seh andromboh ata nza a keh zohhoh, tasa akyo anyi a nati a wina sa a hwana anyi na a ŋoh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Yeso A tsana Ma Ikpi Kwere Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />A te ibi anyi Yeso ka buti kwere Nnoh ma akpo anyi. nza ka a treh, amboh tufa ŋoh reh anyimbehreh amoh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, tsana reh nza ma nati kwere Nnoh reh, tswanza Ayohana ta ka a tsana ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nza ni nati kwere nnoh Nnoh reh ti bleh noh la,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">&lt;&lt;Ada,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">isa anzoh bu agba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">kpra Agohmoh anzoh ta a ba<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Nga reh irya ata andrehmeh tasa ata ma ibibi<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Ti gu kpakpana ambohroh reh te kohhroh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">tswanza nza meh kǝ gu kpakpana amboh nza maka a lisa reh abibi te kohhroh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Tasa kama wa reh na atsi mata a tsara reh kpeh.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Ma huru Yeso ka a bleh ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mata a bleh la akyo amohnoh anyi a bu na iza, a ka a na na a ŋoh na atsitsifi shini ta ka a bleh la, &lt;Iza amya, nga meh kohfoh Afohfohnoh atatoh, <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />iza mya anyi anyi hende a ba meh, meh bu na andromboh meh ti nga ŋoh kpeh.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />&lt;&lt;Ma a bleh la iza reh ta ka a kira na mgba meh la, &lt;Kama wa meh aniye kpeh, mya meh ka anida, mbohroh ma mara amya mboh meh leh mla, meh nati wina hinga ba bu nga nnoh andromboh kpeh.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Meh bleh noh, ha a kira la ŋoh ta a hinga a nga ŋoh afohfohnoh reh kpeh la a bu iza a ŋoh, a nati nza rishi wuwa agohsoh kyangwri reh ta a hinga a nga ŋoh andromboh ata nza a kira gaga.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />&lt;&lt;Nza a bu dehreh neh meh bleh noh: Luhu ma a nati nga nnoh; fa ni nati hunji; kpa anida ma a nati a vuru nnoh. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Akyo ata nza a luhu a nati sa; akyo ata nza a fa; tasa na akyo wohroh nza a kpa anida; ma a nati a vuru ŋoh.<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />&lt;&lt;Anyi nimeh amohnoh ada mboh, amehreh anzoh a nati luhu kpo, ta nga ŋoh iyoh? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Ha neh la ta luhu asubeh, mata nga ŋoh ina? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Nza a bu dehreh, mohnoh nza bu noh agugu mboh, ni wina nga noh mara amohnoh mboh awumu alindeh, Ada amohnoh ata nza a bu na inza a buti a bana ta a nga Huru zanana ma amboh nza ma a luhu ŋoh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso Mboh Ma Agohmoh Huru Agugu mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Yeso ka a buti fufa inyo kate ata nza a kpa ashotoh. Inyo reh nza ka a kate, kyangwri nza a kpa ashotoh reh ka atsifa, duma mboh reh maka a shi a ŋara aniye ma, <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Amboh mgbiri amoh neh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A sa anyi na Baalzabul, Agohmoh inyo mboh reh, sa a wina katsi inyo mboh reh a kate.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Itswa maka a tsara ŋoh a nza la ta a tsana mboh kpra ata nza anyi Nnoh inza.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Yeso ka a wina kohnoh amoh a nza ta ka a bleh mboh la, kpra Agohmoh ata nza a gafa na na itoh a ŋoh a nati a hwa, tasa afiya ata nza a gafa na na itoh a ŋoh a nati a hwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Agugu ata nza a gafa na na itoh a ŋoh, a nati lisa lele kpra Agohmoh a ŋoh ta a shi? meh bleh dehreh neh tsifa la mohnoh ni gu nnoh la mya meh fufa inyo kate na wuwana Baalzabul Agohmoh huru agugu. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Nehnehreh nza meh katsi inyo kate ni wuwana Baalzabul Agohmoh huru agugu, a bu na sa anyi amboh tufa nnoh reh maka a fufa huru agugu mboh reh a kate? nza a bu dehreh neh mboh ma a nati bu amboh hwara nnoh akpi? <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Nza meh fufa inyo mboh reh kate nimeh sa Nnoh neh, wina noh la kpra Agohmoh reh Nnoh kǝ tamba ba na amohnoh. <verse eid="LUK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />&lt;&lt;Nza kyangwri wuwana a bu na awumu mlana gofo, ka sumu mgba afiya a ŋoh, awumu afiya a ŋoh mboh reh nambri ma a nati tuma alindeh. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Nza ka bu akyo ata nza a keh wuwana a ŋoh feh ka a ba neh ka a nati a mla ŋoh a sa awumu gofo a ŋoh ata kyangwri reh nza gya agohsoh na wohroh reh nambri ta ka a gafa ma mgbiri kyangwri mboh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />&lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a bu na amya kpeh a shi meh tomo zizi, tasa akyo ata nza a shingimeh a suhru kpeh a buti kpa sasara zizi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />&lt;&lt;Nza huru agugu reh a kate anyi ma itoh kyangwri reh, a kate a na ma hohroh bini la ŋoh ta a na na a hunji fo, nza ka a hunji kpeh. Ma huru ka a nati kohnoh la, &lt;Meh nati gyuru na amya afiya ata meh ti kǝ yi ta reh yama,&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Nza ka a ba reh neh ka a hunji afiya ma a firu a gya sehsehseh tasa ka a bu wusu. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Ma huru ka a gyuru a na na a fira mgbiri huru agugu mboh atehrehkifi na anyi nza ma a keh ŋoh te nyi, mata ka a na na aniye ka a tuma ma a huru. kyangwri reh ka te abibi a keh ata ta ka jiji a bu na amehmeh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Yeso nza ka a buti a bleh tsifa amboh reh, afya anyi nimeh duma mboh reh ka a fi a kate, &lt;&lt;Te atoh a bu na atono ata nza a mara nnoh tasa a fyoh nnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Te atoh a bu na amboh nza ma a sehreh tsifa Nnoh mata a tufa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kpra Ayunana reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Duma mboh reh nza maka a buti lisa a keh, Yeso ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Areh a bu ika agugu mboh. Ma a luhu kpra agbugba ndohmoh, ma a nati tsana noh andromboh kpeh a bu kpra ata Ayunana reh ma. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Tswanza Ayunana ta ka a bu kpra ma amboh Nineba mboh, a nati a bu dehreh na Amehreh Kyangwri na ika ata areh. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Ibi hwra akpi reh, Agohmoh afya Sheba a nati a hinga na biroh kyangwri amboh ata ameh ata areh, ta a tsana mboh la ma a sohroh a lisa alindeh kpeh, la tana anyi akpo inzi gbugba a ba la ŋoh ta a ba ba a sehreh lomo Solomon, nehnehreh akyo ata nza a keh Solomon a bu uwe. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Kyangwri Nineba mboh ma a nati a hinga a shi ibi hwra akpi mata a tsana la ni lisa noh yehlehleh kpeh, tsifa la ma ta aki agugu amoh ameh ata Ayunana ta ka hwra bleh mboh tsifa Nnoh reh, nehnehreh akyo ata nza a keh Ayunana a bu uweh.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zana Ata Itoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />&lt;&lt;Akyo ka a sohroh a mloh shira afitila a gya na ma atsi huho kpeh, ha ma hohroh gbugba kpeh, neh maka a kohhroh ma ikpoh kohhroh shira, la amboh niye ba mata a nza zana shira reh. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Iyo anzoh a tswanza afitila ata itoh anzoh. Nza iyo anzoh a zohhoh, itoh anzoh nambri a nati a zana. Nza iyo neh a bu abibi, itoh anzoh za a nati bu shini ma. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Lisa nza noh shira nza a bu ma itoh anzoh tama a hwa shini kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Nza a bu dehreh neh, nza itoh anzoh nambri a zana, akpo anyi a te arishi kpeh, a nati a zana na nambri, tswanza shira afitila nza zana ma ikpi anzoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso La kpeh Na Farisiyawa mboh Tasa amboh tsana Lomo Akpi Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Yeso nza ka atsifa a treh, Farisiyawa anyi ka a fi Yeso la ta a ba ba a rya irya na a ŋoh; a ka a na nimeh ka a na na a tuma ma ikpi kpra. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Farisiyawa ka a nza la Yeso a hwara ivoh sa a rya irya reh kpeh, a ka a wa ŋoh anneh.<verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Ma huru Ada reh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;mohnoh Farisiyawa mboh ni kǝ hwara nnoh iji hohndoh tasa gbugba ta bu fyafya, neh nimeh amohnoh ni bu noh fa akpi tasa inyi ma. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Kyangwri amboh duduna mboh! a bu Nnoh ŋa nza a lisa iji ŋoh nza a lisa imeh ŋoh reh kpeh? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Mohnoh neh nga nnoh andromboh ata nza a bu nimeh gbugba reh ma amboh iya mboh, awumu mboh reh na amohnoh a nati a bu na zanana.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />&lt;&lt;Iya agba na amohnoh Farisiyawa mboh! Ni nga nnoh ma Nnoh itrenyi awumu asho shifa ata aye mboh, tasa mgbiri asho firu mwi mboh reh ma asaa nambri, mohnoh neh ni sohroh sa nnoh tsana ata a zizi tasa kira Nnoh reh kira nnoh kpeh. A bu awumu amboh ata areh mi nza a zohhoh ti lisa nnoh reh, la ti kama ta nnoh mgbiri kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />&lt;&lt;Iya agba na amohnoh Farisiyawa mboh, la ni kira nnoh kpra ata nza a keh zohhoh nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh, tasa la mata ka atsifa na amohnoh ma atsi sa tasa rifa mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />&lt;&lt;Iya agba na amohnoh, la ni bu noh tswanza ikpi nyifo ata nza kǝ lalana kpra a za a yama kpeh, kyangwri mboh maka a ka hende ma ikpi ma a wina kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Kyangwri tsana akpi Musa reh anyi ka a bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, nza ni bleh dehreh reh, wohroh ni kya reh za.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Yeh na mohnoh, mohnoh amboh tsana akpi Musa reh, yeh na amohnoh, la ni leh nga nnoh kyangwri mboh iya na awumu nza ma a nati wina gu kpeh, tasa mohnoh ni ikpi amohnoh ni nati gu nnoh ameh ivoh shingi mboh nnoh.<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />&lt;&lt;Iya agba na amohnoh, la ni mina nnoh ikpi nyifo alilehndeh ma amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh mboh, ata atsiyoh amohnoh mboh na kiri ta maka a mla mboh a kwo reh. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Mohnoh na ikpi amohnoh ni nza ti bleh noh, tasa za ni kira nnoh na andromboh ata atsiyoh mohnoh mboh amboh kiri mata ka a lisa reh; tama a mla amboh nza wono mboh a wina, tasa tini mina mboh nnoh kpikpi nyifo mboh. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Ikpi tsifa ata areh, Nnoh nimeh lomo a ŋoh a bleh la, &lt;Meh nati tohmoh amboh sa tohmoh nana Nnoh tasa amboh ble tsifa nana Yeso reh, itswa ma a nati a mla mboh tasa mgbiri ma a nati a nga mboh iya.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Nza bu dehreh ma a nati ahwra akpi ma kyangwri amboh ameh ata areh, tsifa ata nza ma a mla amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh mboh a kwo nambri nza a gu anyi ameh ata tama ka a jiji a lisa inziyo agba reh, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Nza ka anyi na imya Habila ka a wa imya Zakariya, mata ka a mla mboh a kwo ma atsitsifi bagadi tasa ma ida Nnoh nza zanana reh. Haa, meh bleh noh zizi, la ma a nati nga kyangwri amboh ata ameh ata areh iya tsifa amoh nambri.<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />&lt;&lt;Iya agba na amohnoh amboh tsana akpi Musa reh, la ni fufa nnoh akpreh ata vuru anida ata ka a vuru anida wina reh, mohnoh na ikpi amohnoh ni sohroh niye nnoh kpeh, ni shwa nnoh amboh ata nza ma a kira mata aniye a na nimeh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Yeso nza ka a yi atsi wohroh ata, Farisiyawa mboh reh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh reh maka a leh a fa ŋoh na akpi, tasa maka a leh a luhu ŋoh tsifa mboh gaga, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />La iko anduhwa mata a de ŋoh na kpakpana nimeh andromboh ata nza a nati a bleh reh.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Yeso Akpi Ashotoh Ma amboh Tufa ŋoh Reh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Na ameh wohroh, kyangwri mboh gaga nza maka a dohsohna maka a leh a ka a huhuya itoh amoh, Yeso ka a jiji atsifa na amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Lisa nza noh feh ni tsana Farisiyawa mboh reh. Ata nza bu te inyi amoh reh. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Andromboh a yama huho ata nza ma a nati vuru kpeh, ha nza ma a hama ata nza ma a nati a wina kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Andromboh ata nza ni bleh ma hohroh shini reh ma a nati a sehreh na nnoh, tasa za andromboh ata nza ni bleh ma ashotoh na ayuhu nimeh ida meh reh, ma a nati a hwra a bleh a kate anyi ma ikpi tsitsi.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />&lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh, iziza mya mboh, kama nyiri nnoh amboh nza ma a nati mla itoh ma a kwo kpeh, ma inyina wohroh ma a za a nati wina lisa nnoh andromboh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Meh nati tsana noh akyo ata nza ni nati nyiri ŋoh reh: Nyiri nnoh Nnoh, ata nza kǝ mla kwo reh, a bu na wuwana a gu nnoh a shebiri a na nimeh shira ata ka a kwo kpeh. Sa tsifa amya kira, a bu ŋoh ata nza ni nati nyiri ŋoh reh. <verse eid="LUK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Maka a rifa ichuchiri mboh atungu na kabo shidi kpeh? Nnoh a mishi a gu anyimbehreh amoh a te kohhroh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />A bu dehreh, a zizi shina ikpi amohnoh ma a shi ma a sa maka a bleh mboh a wina. Kama nyiri nnoh kpeh; ni zohhoh keh nnoh ichuchiri mboh reh.<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsana la ni kira na Yeso Ma Tomwo Kyangwri mboh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32-33">Ama 10:32-33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19-20">10:19-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />&lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh la, akyo ata nza a kira na amya ma tomo kyangwri mboh, Amehreh kyangwri reh a nati kira na a ŋoh ma tomo mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh na amgba reh. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Akyo ata nza a leke meh ma tomo kyangwri mboh ma a nati a leke ŋoh ma tomo mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh na amgba reh. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Tasa akyo ata nza a bleh tsifa abibi ma ikpi Amehreh Kyangwri ma a nati a gu te kohhroh, akyo neh ata nza a biya nyi ma ikpi Huru zanana ma a nati a gu a te kohhroh kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />&lt;&lt;Nza ma a de noh a ba ma ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh atsi hwra akpi, ha ma tohmoh Agohmoh agbaa ha amboh de kpra Agohmoh mboh tasa amboh wuwana mboh, kama kohnoh nnoh la meh kǝ nati tsifa lele meh si hwana ikpi ambohroh ha la ti kohnoh nnoh na andromboh ata nza ni nati bleh noh. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Huru zanana a nati tsana noh na ameh wohroh andromboh ata nza ni nati bleh noh reh. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakranda Kyangwri Asabara Ata nza Duduna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Kyangwri anyi ma hohroh duma mboh reh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, bleh ma atsi amya ta a gafa gohmoh ada ambohroh reh ta a nga meh amya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yeso ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri, a bu anyi a gu meh a gya kyangwri hwra akpi ha kyangwri shi gafa gohmoh amohnoh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Ma huru a ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Lisa nza noh feh, la ti te nnoh gbugba na awumu ata nza a nati a de te yo a ba nnoh, fene kyangwri a kasa ma ikpi vara asabara a ŋoh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh kakranda ata areh la: &lt;&lt;Kyangwri asabara anyi a bu na inzi anyi ata nza ka a zohhoh awumu ni nza kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Ka a kohnoh ma agohsoh a ŋoh la, &lt;Meh nati lisa lele? Meh bu na lo akehreh meh ti gya awumu mya mboh reh kpeh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />&lt;&lt;Ma huru a ka a bleh la, &lt;Nza andromboh ata mya nza ni nati lisa. Meh nati druhu lohkehreh amya reh meh ti mina agbugba ŋoh mboh, a huru meh nati gya awumu yohroh amya mboh tasa awumu amya mboh nambri. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Tasa meh ti kǝ a bleh ma ikpi amya la, &lt;&lt;Ni bu na ajija awumu mboh gaga ata nza a nati gu meh ahushi vara. gu inziyo ve; irya, wa tasa ti kǝ bu johjoh ma.&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Nnoh neh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;Ni duduna! Na shini areh ma a nati a sa fene anzoh anyi na anzoh. Anyi ka a nati a de awumu anzoh ata nza ni lisa a gya ma ikpi anzoh reh?&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />&lt;&lt;A nati a bu dehreh na amboh nza ma gya awumu ma ikpi amoh ma inziyo areh ma tohmoh Nnoh neh ma a bu amboh iya mboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kama Kohnoh Nnoh Kpeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Ma huru Yeso ka a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh la ti kama kohnoh nnoh ma ikpi irya ata nza ni nati irya ti hunji noh fene kpeh; ha ma ikpi itoh anzoh, andromboh ata nza ni nati were kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Fene a keh rya, tasa itoh reh a keh kuri mboh reh. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Nza nnoh kukuba mboh: Ma a hafa kpeh ha la mata a fasa, ma a bu na lohkehreh ha atara kpeh; Nnoh a nga mboh irya. mohnoh ni keh nnoh akuku mboh reh zohhoh! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Anyi amohnoh nza la ma atsi kohnoh a nati wina fi ameh anyimbehreh a mangara ma ikpi fene a ŋoh? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Nza ni nati wina lisa nnoh andromboh akehreh areh kpeh, ni kǝ leh kohnoh fa nnoh umbo ma ikpi mgbiri awumu tswa?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />&lt;&lt;Nza nnoh akru agbeh bini mboh nza maka te agbugba reh. Ma a te ndohmoh kpeh ha ma wina wohnoh alulu kpeh. meh bleh noh, Solomon na agba a ŋoh nza a bu na asabara gaga a sohroh jimi a keh anyimbehreh nimeh amboh ata areh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Nza a bu dehreh Nnoh ka jimi bini aye mboh, ata andrehmeh ma a yama, ikya ma a nati afya mboh na shira, mohnoh reh Nnoh a nati jimi nnoh gaga a keh mboh, mohnoh reh ni bu noh na nga agohsoh mbimbi ma! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Tasa kama gya noh agohsoh amohnoh ma andromboh ata nza ni nati irya nnoh ha ata nza ni nati wa nnoh kpeh; kama kohnoh nnoh ma ikpi amboh wohroh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh ma inziyo areh maka a gbo a tufa awumu amboh ika ta wohroh nambri, neh Ada amohnoh a wina la ni kira nnoh awumu amboh areh. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Mohnoh neh jiji fa nnoh kpra Agohmoh Nnoh feh awumu amboh ata areh ma nati nga areh za.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />&lt;&lt;Kama nyiri nnoh kpeh, mohnoh nza ni bu noh tswanza vara atashi mboh shidi ma reh, a nana agohsoh ma Ada amohnoh ta nga noh akpo atsifi a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Rifa nnoh gohmoh amohnoh mboh ti nga nnoh ma amboh iya mboh. Gya nnoh a kpanga hungroh ma ikpi amohnoh ata nza a nati te abibi kpeh ma inza, a bu asabara ata nza a nati trina kpeh, atsi ata ayuhu mboh ma a nati a wina ba ma nda tasa za shinga mboh ma a nati a rya kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Atsi ata asabara anzoh nza a yama, agohsoh anzoh za a nati a bu ma a huru.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kya iyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />&lt;&lt;Shi bana nnoh, ni nati te noh ndohmoh tasa shira afitila amohnoh a nati a leh zana nina, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />tswanza tsifa mboh nza ma a buti shi bana agba amoh nza a nati anyi atsi kira lafa rishi sa afya, la nza a ba ba a kpa anida mata a vuru ŋoh ni gbugbo. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />A nati a bu na johjoh ma ahwra amboh ata agba amoh a nati a gyuru a ba ba a hunji mboh ma atsi ndohmoh nza tana a ba reh, meh bleh noh zizi, a nati a were akuri ahwra reh ta a bleh mboh la mata a ba ba a tuma ma kpra ŋoh a nati a nga mboh irya. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Johjoh a nati a bu na ahwra amboh ata agba amoh a nati ba na atsitsifi shini ha na nerebi shishini ma, a hunji mboh atsi shi a bana. <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Wina nnoh ata areh la: nza kyangwri afiya reh a wina ameh ata ayuhu a nati ba, a nati kira ta a vasa afiya aniye a na kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />mohnoh za tuma bana nnoh, la Amehreh Kyangwri a nati ba na ameh ata mohnoh nza ni wina noh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Abitrusu ka luhu Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Ada, ni buti bleh reh mbohroh kakranda ata areh, ha ma kyangwri mboh nambri?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Ada reh ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu anyi nza bu kyangwri lisa yehlehleh tasa ahwra ata nza a bu na lomo reh? A bu ŋoh ata agba a ŋoh nza a nati a gya ŋoh la ta a sumu afiya a ŋoh reh, tasa za la ta a nga mgbiri ahwra mboh reh irya amoh na ameh ŋoh yehlehleh. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />A nati a bu na johjoh ma ahwra wohroh ata agba a ŋoh reh a nati a ba ta a nza ŋoh atsi shi te ndohmoh a ŋoh reh yehlehleh. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Meh bleh noh zizi, a nati a gu ŋoh a gya agba atsi nza awumu a ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Mata a bleh la, awhra reh ta a bleh ma agohsoh a ŋoh la, &lt;Kyangwri agba amya reh kǝ kama keh yanda a ba kpeh,&gt; ta ka a na a ŋoh na leh ka ava mgbiri ahwra tsifa mboh tasa ahwra ifya mboh reh mla ta ka leh ka a rya irya tasa ta ka leh ka a wa a te fya ma, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Agba kyangwri ahwra reh a nati a hinga ba na ameh ata ŋoh nza a gya agohsoh la a nati ba kpeh tasa na ameh nza a nati a wina kpeh. A nati a nga ŋoh iya veve kpeh ta ka a gu ŋoh a fi a na na amboh ata nza ma sa tsifa leke reh.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />&lt;&lt;Ahwra akyo wohroh nza a wina agohsoh agba a ŋoh reh ta a sohroh a suhru ikpi a ŋoh a bana kpeh ha la ta a sohroh a lisa andromboh ata agba a ŋoh nza a kira kpeh a nati a nga ŋoh iya gaga. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Ahwra ata neh nza a wina andromboh ata kyangwri afiya a ŋoh nza a kira kpeh reh, ta ka a lisa andromboh ata nza a tswa mata a mla ŋoh, ma a nati a mla ŋoh shidi ma, akyo ata nza tama a nga ŋoh gaga, ma a kira gaga anyi na a ŋoh, tasa akyo ata nza ma a nga ŋoh ata a gaga reh, ma a nati a luhu gaga za anyi na a ŋoh.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A de Gafana A ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />&lt;&lt;Mya meh ba meh ti fi shira ma inziyo, mata a bleh la shira reh a buti de! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Meh bu na wra batisma ata iya ata ma a nati a lisa meh, agohsoh amya a buti kputuna gaga, meh nati tuma fo kpeh tama a lisa meh a treh feh! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Ni a bleh noh la meh de tuma alindeh ba ma inziyo? uwa, meh bleh noh, a bu gafana mi. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Nyi nehnehreh a gu a na tohmoh ma afiya anyimbehreh kyangwri atungu ma a nati a gafana a te afri, atatoh ma a nati a fi afri ma tohmoh, afri ma a nati a fi atatoh ma tohmoh. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Ma a nati a gafana, alehmeh mboh ma ameh tasa ameh mboh ma alehmeh, akre mboh ma anyifa a ŋoh tasa anyifa mboh ma akre, akre agba ma a nati gafana mboh ma afya amehreh a ŋoh afya amehreh a ŋoh mboh ma akre agba.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nza Ameh wina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Ma huru Yeso ka a bleh ma duma mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Nza ni nza noh avereh ti ka nyi na mgba Nnoh nerebi reh, a huru ni kǝ a bleh noh la, &lt;Awi a nati ba,&gt; a ka a bu dehreh. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Tasa za nza inyo mgba fo afo a gǝga reh, ni kǝ bleh la,&lt;Ishifoh a nati ba,&gt; a ka bu dehreh. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Mohnoh amboh agugu mboh! ni kǝ wina tsara nnoh ameh ata inziyo areh tasa ata avereh inza wina nza noh. A te lele feh ti nza noh ameh ata nehnehreh wina noh kpeh?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />&lt;&lt;A bu umbo a te feh mohnoh na ikpi amohnoh ti kohnoh nza noh andromboh ata nza a bu yehlehleh reh kpeh? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Nza akyo a gu nnoh a na atsi hwra akpi, kwere ŋoh ti lisa tsifa nnoh ma aki tsifa ta a trina. Nza ni leke tsifa a nati na tohmoh, agba amboh hwra akpi reh a nati a gu nnoh a nga ma amboh lafa chuhu yira. amboh lafa chuhu reh neh ma a nati a de noh a fi ma ida ka. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Meh bleh noh, ni nati fanga mara hungroh reh treh sese feh si hunji kate.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Ta Nnoh Aki Agugu Ha Ti Kwo nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Ma huru heri, mgbiri kyangwri mboh nza ma a yama ma a huru reh maka a bleh ma Yeso ma ikpi kyangwri Galili amboh ata Bilatus ta ka a mla mboh a kwo, ameh ata tama ka a leh a de ngǝnga a ba Nnoh reh. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yeso a kira la, &lt;&lt;Mohnoh ni nza noh amohnoh la kyangwri Galili mboh reh ma kpakpana a keh mgbiri kyangwri Galili mboh nambri nza ma a wa iya na aki wohroh reh? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />meh ti bleh noh shimba, uwa! Gyuruna ta nnoh aki agugu amohnoh reh feh kavoh kpeh reh neh mohnoh za ni nati kwo nnoh. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Ha kyangwri agrumavoh a hwa atsiyatsiya ata ida inza ma Siluwam ta ka a hwa ma ikpi amoh a mla mboh a kwo reh? Ni kohnoh nnoh amohnoh la kpakpana amoh a keh amboh mgbiri nza ma a tuma ma Urushalima reh? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />meh bleh noh shimba, uwa! Nza ni gyuruna ta nnoh aki agugu amohnoh reh feh, kavoh kpeh reh neh mohnoh za ni nati kwo nnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh kakranda ata areh la: &lt;&lt;Kyangwri anyi a bu na agbeh mgbungba, a biya ma aye a ŋoh, ka a nati fa mara agbeh reh ka a sohroh a hunji anyi kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Ka a bleh ma kyangwri nza a sumu ŋoh aye reh la, &lt;&lt;Ahushi na atatoh nehnehreh mya meh kǝ ba atsi fa mara agbeh na agbeh mgbungba reh meh kǝ hunji andromboh kpeh. Biri shebiri! Ka a nati a shi a nasa inzi a te umbo? <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Kyangwri sumu aye reh ka a bleh ŋoh la&lt;&lt;Agba,&gt; yi ŋoh ta, ta a shi a te ahushi anyimbehreh fya, mya meh nati shumu chuhu ŋoh goh meh ti were ŋoh avru ahungwri. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Nza agbeh reh a mara iha, a zohhoh! Nza a mara kpeh ti biri shebiri.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A nga Wuwana ma Afya Nvinvi Hwana ma Ibi Asabar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Ma ibi Asabar anyi Yeso ka a leh a tsana mboh tsifa Nnoh nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh, <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />tasa afiya anyi za a yama ata huru agugu ma ava ŋoh a mvivina a te ahushi agrumavoh a hwa atsiyatsiya. A hehndeh na gana, a za a wina hende tsinziri mbimbi za kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yeso nza ka a nza ŋoh ka a fi ŋoh a na tohmoh ta ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Afya, ma a sa noh a hwana anyi ma ivoh agugu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Ka a gya ŋoh ivoh ma itoh, ka a hinga anyifana a shi tsinziri ta ka a leh ariri Nnoh.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Kyangwri ata nza bu agba amboh de ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh reh ka a te gofo la Yeso a nga wuwana ma afiya reh ma ibi Asabar, ka a bleh ma kyangwri mboh ma a huru reh la, &lt;&lt;Ibi atehrehkifi a yama ata te ndohmoh. Mohnoh ba nnoh tama a nga noh wuwana ma ibi amboh wohroh, ta a sohroh a bu ma ibi Asabar kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Ada Yeso reh ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;Mohnoh agugu mboh! Anyi nimeh amohnoh a nati a wina ta londo a ŋoh ha nyama a ŋoh ta a wa ŋoh a na atsi wa amwo ma ibi Asabar kpeh? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Afya ata areh anyi ma alohsoh Ibrahim ata agugu nza a leh a de ŋoh a lafa, andrehmeh kǝ bu ahushi agrumavoh a hwa atsiyatsiya, a zohhoh tama a nga ŋoh wuwana ma ibi asabar reh kpeh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Nza ka a bleh ata areh, amboh nza ma a fi ŋoh ma tohmoh reh ka a te mboh na abibi, duma mboh reh maka a leh a johjoh na agbugba ndohmoh ata ŋara aniye ata ŋoh nza a leh a lisa reh.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakranda Ma Ikpi Yohroh Kumu Tasa Mehreh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Yeso ka luhu la, kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh a ka bu lele? Meh nati tsara kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh ni umbo? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />A tswa nza yohroh agbeh kumu ata kyangwri nza a gu a biya na aye a ŋoh. Ka a te agbeh agba, akuku inza mboh maka la avru amoh mboh ma avohvoh agbeh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Ka a gyuru a luhu za la, meh nati tsara kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh na umbo? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />A tswa nza mehreh ata afiya nza a gu tofo nimeh mgbokro agba, mgbokro reh a nati ka a tohfohna ni mehreh reh nambri.<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anida Njuriri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Yeso ka a leh a hehndeh a treh akpokpo afiyafiya akǝkehreh tasa agbugba atsi a tsana, nza a bu na aki na ŋoh Urushalima. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Akyo anyi ka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, a bu kyangwri mboh mbimbi nza ma a nati a hunji nvara reh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Ka a bleh mboh la, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />&lt;&lt;Fa noh aki ata nza ni nati wina niye gǝga noh ma anida akehreh reh, meh ti bleh noh la kyangwri mboh gaga ma a nati a fa aki tama aniye, mboh neh ma a nati a wina kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Nza kyangwri afiya reh ka a de a hinga a shi ta a hama anida reh, nnoh ni nati shi nnoh ma inziyo ti leh kpa nnoh anida leh kwere nnoh la, &lt;Agba, vuru reh anida.&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:25">&lt;&lt;Ŋoh neh a nati a kira la, &lt;Mya meh wina noh kpeh ha ni kǝ nyi mma ba nnoh&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />&lt;&lt;mohnoh ni nati bleh noh za la, &lt;Mbohroh meh rya irya meh ti wa Mbohroh ma anzoh, tasa za ni tsana ma afiyafiya ambohroh mboh.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />&lt;&lt;Ŋoh neh a nati a gyuru a bleh la, &lt;Meh wina noh kpeh ha ni kǝ nyi nnoh mgbata kpeh. Na nnoh ari, mohnoh amboh te ndohmoh agugu mboh!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />&lt;&lt;Ni nati kpanga, tasa ti rya nnoh anyini ma a huru, Nza ni nza noh Ibrahim, Ishaku tasa Yakubu tasa amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh nambri na kpra Agohmoh Nnoh, mohnoh neh mata a katsi nnoh a kate inziyo. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Kyangwri ma a nati a ba anyi mgba nnoh nerebi tasa ni mgba nnoh nvishi tasa ni mgba shwa tasa ni mgba fo, ma nati a gu atsi tuma rya irya ma akpo atsifi Nnoh. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Zizi mgbiri amboh trina ŋoh ma a nati a bu jiji ŋoh, tasa amboh jiji ma a nati a bu trina ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A nza kwini Urushalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Na ameh ata wohroh mgbiri Farisiyawa mboh maka a ba ni Yeso maka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Hinga ta atsifi ata areh ti gyuru na anzoh akpo anyi. Hirudus a kira ta a mla nnoh a tavoh&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Ka a kira la, &lt;&lt;Na ni bleh noh ma achi reh la, &lt;Meh nati katsi inyo mboh meh ti nga wuwana ma kyangwri mboh andrehmeh tasa ikya, tasa ibi na atatoh meh nati tre ndohmoh amya&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Dehreh za, meh nati rya tohmoh na hende amya andrehmeh kanga tasa tasa ibi ata tafa, a zohhoh mata a bleh la kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh ta a kwo ma inziyo kpeh, za a bu ma urushalima feh masa a mla ŋoh a tavoh!<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />mohnoh kyangwri Urushalima mboh, mohnoh kyangwri Urushalima mboh, mohnoh amboh ata nza ni mla amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh tasa za ni dadafa nnoh amboh nza ma a tohmoh mboh a ba na amohnoh na kpakpa, a bu hwana amama mya nza ni kira meh ti wa nnoh suhru ba ma akpo anyimbehreh tswanza adeh nza ka suhru mara a ŋoh mboh ta a hama mboh na amgba reh, mohnoh neh ni leke nnoh! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Nza nnoh nehnehreh ma ata nnoh afiya amohnoh kǝ te afiya atono. meh bleh noh shimba, ni nati nza meh noh nza kpeh tini gyuru bleh meh noh feh, &lt;Te atoh a bu na akyo ata nza a buti ba nimeh isa Ada&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Yeso na Afiya Agba Kyangwri Farisiyawa anyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Ibi Asabar anyi Yeso nza ka a na atsi rya irya na afya agba kyangwri Farisiyawa anyi, maka a leh a were a ŋoh iyo a nza ŋoh a na ve. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Kyangwri anyi tana a leh a wa iya na bishi shwe hwana tasa ivoh mboh, tana a ba na Yeso. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Yeso ka luhu Farisiyawa mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;A zohhoh mata nga wuwana ni ibi asabar ha a zohhoh kpeh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Mboh neh maka a tuma gbalala ma. Yeso ka a gu kyangwri reh ka a nga a ŋoh wuwana, ka a bleh ŋoh la ta a na a ŋoh yama. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Yeso ka luhu kyangwri mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Nza londo anzoh ha amehreh anzoh a hwa na tsiyo amwo ma ibi Asabar, ni nati fufa ŋoh kate ni gbugbo kpeh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Ma a za wina bleh andromboh za kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Yeso nza ka a nza kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a fi mboh a ba atsi rya irya reh ma a leh a seh kpra alilehndeh ŋoh, Yeso ka a bleh mboh kakranda areh la: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />&lt;&lt;Nza akyo a fi noh a na ma atsi kira sa afiya, kama jiji na ni tuma ma atsi tuma agbugba kyangwri mboh reh kpeh, ha akyo ata nza a keh nnoh agba a treh a ba ma nyina <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Nza a bu dehreh, ŋoh ata nza a fi noh na afri ma amohnoh reh a nati a ba ta a bleh noh la, &lt;Nnoh, hinga nga ata areh atsi tuma anzoh.&gt;A nati a te nnoh ni sa agba neh ni kǝ nati tuma ma kpra ata akehreh ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Nza ma a fi noh, ma atsi kira reh na ni tuma ma ikpi kpra akehreh ŋoh, ha nza kyangwri ata nza a fi noh reh ta a ba, a nati a bleh noh la, &lt;Iza, kavohshama hinga na ni tuma ma kpra agbaa ata ari.&gt; Wohroh a nati a de nga agba ma tohmoh agbugba mboh nza ma a fi mboh a ba atsi kira reh. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Akyo ata nza a gu ikpi ŋoh a ka inza, Nnoh a nati a de ŋoh a tamba, tasa ata nza a gu ikpi ŋoh a tamba Nnoh a nati a gu ŋoh a ka inza.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Yeso ka a bleh ma kyangwri nza a fi kira rya irya reh la,&lt;&lt;Nza ni nga kyangwri mboh irya ata nnoh ha irya ata nvishi, kama fi ziza anzoh mboh kpeh, ha atsi anzoh mboh kpeh, ha kini anzoh mboh kpeh, ha atohngoh anzoh amboh ata nza ma a bu na asabara kpeh, nza ni lisa dehreh reh, ma a nati a gyuru a fi noh za tasa nnoh ti gyuru fanga mboh za. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Nza ni nati fi kyangwri mboh ba atsi kira reh neh, fi amboh Iya mboh, tasa amboh nza ma a hehndeh na ikpoh, tasa amboh ata nza ma nvinvi hwana tasa amboh hwra iyo mboh, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />ni nati hunji noh te atoh, la ma a nati a wina fanga nnoh za kpeh. A bu Nnoh a nati a fanga nnoh ibi ata nza ma a nati a yiri amboh tufa yehlehleh mboh a hinga anyi ma kwo reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakranda Ma Ikpi kira Agba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Nza maka a sehreh dehreh, anyimbehreh nimeh amboh ata nza ma a tuma na a ŋoh ma kpra rya irya reh ka a bleh ma ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Te atoh a bu na akyo ata nza a nati a rya irya kira ma akpo afiya Nnoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yeso ka a bleh la: &lt;&lt;Kyangwri anyi a leh a lisa kira agba tasa ka a fi duma mboh gaga. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Na ameh ata nza ma a fi kira reh ka a tohmoh ahwra a ŋoh na amboh ata ŋoh a fi mboh reh la, &lt;Ba nnoh, awumu mboh reh ma asaa ma a yama&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />&lt;&lt;Nambri ma amoh neh maka a leh a fa alulu tsifa. ata jiji ŋoh a bleh la, &lt;mya meh sa aye nehnehreh, mya meh nati nza aye reh fya. Meh kwere nnoh ti ta meh. <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Anyi ka a bleh la, &lt;Mya meh sa londo hafa atungu, meh nati tsara mboh nza fya, mya meh kwere luhu nnoh la soh ivoh yira na amya.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />&lt;&lt;Anyi za ka a bleh la, &lt;Mya meh tre sa afiya nehnehreh, mya meh nati wina ba kpeh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />&lt;&lt;Ahwra reh ka a gyuru a ba ba a bleh ma agba a ŋoh andromboh ata nza ma a bleh reh nambri, agba a ŋoh reh ka a te gofo gaga ka a bleh ma ahwra reh la, &lt;Na ni gbugbo ti tufa akeki mboh reh tasa hro ata akpo afya mboh reh, ti de amboh ata ma a wa iya ba meh noh, tasa amboh kya hwana mboh, tasa amboh hwra iyo mboh, tasa amboh vinvi hwana mboh, ti de mboh nnoh ba ni mareh.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Ahwra reh ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;Agba,&gt;&lt;Andromboh ata ni a bleh reh mbohroh meh lisa,&gt; atsifi a treh a yama nehnehreh<verse eid="LUK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />&lt;&lt;Agba reh ka a bleh ma ahwra reh la, &lt;Na nnoh ma akeki akǝkehreh tasa akeki agbugba mboh, ti na ni bleh noh ma Kyangwri mboh mata a ba, la mgba afiya amya ta a su. <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, akyo anyimbehreh nimeh kyangwri amboh ata mya nza ni fi mboh reh, akyo a nati a wina bara awumu mya nza ni lisa reh kpeh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">A bu na Iya Ti bu Amehreh Tufa Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Duma agba maka a leh a hehndeh mboh ma Yeso, tasa ka a gyuruna a bleh mboh la: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />&lt;&lt;Nza akyo ata nza a kira ta bu anyimbehreh nimeh amboh tufa meh, a nati a leke akre tasa alehmeh, kawa afya a ŋoh tasa mara a ŋoh mboh tasa atsini mboh ma asra a ŋoh, tasa za ta a leke fene a ŋoh za a mishi kpeh. A nati a wina bu kyangwri tufa meh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Tasa akyo ata nza na a gu gbohrohgboh a ŋoh a tufa meh kpeh, a nati a wina bu anyimbehreh nimeh amboh tufa amya kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />&lt;&lt;Mata a bleh la anyimbehreh amohnoh a kira ta a mina ida kyangwri sumu. A nati a jiji tuma ta ahwra a nza andromboh ata nza a nati a mla reh, ta a nza la ha ŋoh wa a bu na hungroh ata nza a nati a mla reh. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />ha ni kǝ gya chuhu ida reh tasa wina mina tre kpeh, ha akyo ka a nza a na ti rina a ŋoh, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />ma a nati a bleh la, &lt;Kyangwri areh a buti mina a za wina mina a treh kpeh&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Nza Agohmoh anyi a nati a kate mboh ma amboh shi ita a ŋoh mboh agrumavoh ida agrumavoh, ta a na gofo na Agohmoh anyi ata nza a bu na amboh shi ita mboh agrumavoh ida afri, a nati a jiji a tuma fiya ta a nza la ha ŋoh wa a nati a wina mla na na Agohmoh reh. <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Nza a nati a wina kpeh reh, ta a tohmoh amboh sa tohmoh mboh mata a na na a hunji mgbiri agohgohmoh mboh nza ma a treh bu gbugba reh, mata a na na luhu akeki ata nza ma a nati tuma alindeh reh. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Ma aki wohroh za nambri ma amohnoh, akyo anyi a nati a sohroh bu anyimbehreh nimeh amboh tufa amya kpeh, nza noh ni ta awumu amboh ata nza ni bu na wohroh feh.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />&lt;&lt;Mma a bu andromboh alindeh, nza a sohroh a nana mma za kpeh, ma a nati a lisa lele sa a gyuru a nana mma yama? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />A nati a sohroh a de avru a zohhoh kpeh, ma a nati ka a fira a sangra ma. Akyo ata nza a bu na ashotoh sere, ta a sehreh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:35">&lt;&lt;Akyo nza a bu na ashotoh ta a sehreh, ta a sehreh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Atashi ata Nza A bleh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Kyangwri sa hungroh gandu tasa &lt;&lt;amboh kpakpana mboh&gt;&gt;Ma a shi nambri ma amoh a dohsohna mata a sehreh ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Farisiyawa mboh neh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa maka a leh a te alulu tsifa la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri ata areh a leh a hehndeh mboh ma amboh kpakpana mboh, ta ka a rya irya ma amboh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh kakranda ata areh: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />&lt;&lt;Ma a bleh la anyimbehreh amohnoh a bu na atashi agrumavoh da agrumavoh neh anyimbehreh ka a bleh. A nati a yi agrumavoh da atsiyatsiya na anyi a hwa atsiyatsiya na anyi reh ata ma atsi sumu ta a na na a fa atashi ata nza a bleh reh ta a hunji fya kpeh? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Nza ka a fa atashi reh a hunji, A nati a johjoh ta a gu ka a fi ma agba <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />ta a na a ŋoh afya. a nati ka a fi iziza a ŋoh mboh tasa atohngoh a ŋoh mboh a ba akpo anyimbehreh ta ka a bleh la &lt;Shingi meh noh johjoh, meh hunji atashi amya nza a bleh reh.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Meh bleh noh la a nati bu ma atsifi dehreh, ma a nati johjoh gaga ni inza ma ikpi kyangwri kpakpana anyimbehreh ata nza gyuruna ta aki agugu a ŋoh reh ata, a keh agrumavoh da atsiyatsiya na anyi amboh tufa yehlehleh nza ma a za a kira tama a gyuru na ata aki a gu amoh kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakranda Ma Ikpi Hungroh Ata Nza A bleh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />&lt;&lt;Ha mata a bleh la afya anyi a bu na hungroh agrumavoh, neh anyimbehreh ka a bleh, ka a nati a mloh shira afitila a hehndeh a firu afiya a ŋoh a fa ta a hunji fya kpeh? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Nza ka a hunji hungroh reh, A nati a fi iziza a ŋoh mboh tasa atohngoh a ŋoh mboh a ba ma akpo anyimbehreh ta a bleh la, &lt;Shingi meh noh johjoh, meh hunji hungroh mya ata nza a bleh reh.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Ma aki wohroh za, meh bleh noh dehreh la, mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh ma a nati johjoh gaga ma ma ikpi kyangwri kpakpana anyimbehreh ata nza a gyuruna ta aki agugu a ŋoh reh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakranda Ma Ikpi Amehreh Ata Nza A bleh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Yeso ka a gyuru a bleh mboh kakranda anyi za la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri anyi tana a yama a bu na amehreh tsifa mboh afri. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Akehreh ŋoh ka a bleh ma alehmeh la, &lt;Ada, gafa awumu reh ti nga amya.&gt; A ka a gafa asabara reh a te afri ma mara mboh reh.<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />A yanda kpeh, amehreh akehreh ŋoh reh ka suhru a awumu a ŋoh ta ka a rifa mgbiri, feh ka a ta afiya ta ka a na ŋoh na hungroh. Ka a na ŋoh akpo afiya anyi gbugba. Ka a na a tuma a mla asabara a ŋoh reh ka a treh atsi te inyo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Nza ka a treh asabara ŋoh reh, inyo agba ka a hwa ma akpo afiya agba reh, iya a ka a de ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Ka a na na a fa ndohmoh hungroh na kyangwri anyi ma akpo afya agba reh, a ka a hunji ndohmoh sumu ŋoh atambri mboh. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Ŋoh za a kira ta a hunji atutu ata maka nga atambri mboh nza maka a rya reh, akyo a kama nga ŋoh andromboh kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />&lt;&lt;Lomo nza ka a gyuru a ba ŋoh, ka a bleh la, &lt;Amboh ndohmoh Ada amya maka a rya irya a sangra, inyo neh wa nati a mla meh a kwo! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Mya meh nati hinga gyuru na amya na ada mya meh ti na ni bleh ŋoh la, ada, mya meh kpakpana ma tohmoh anzoh tasa ma tohmoh Nnoh ma inza. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Mya meh tswa meh ti za bu amehreh anzoh za kpeh; gu meh meh ti bu anyimbehreh nimeh amboh ndohmoh anzoh mboh.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />A ka a de hinga ka a na na alehmeh. &lt;&lt;Ŋoh neh nza ka a treh a bu gbugba shidi, alehmeh reh ka a nza ŋoh, amehreh reh ka a nga ŋoh kwini; ka a gbo a na na amehreh a ŋoh reh, ta ka a fi ŋoh ivoh na agba neh ta ka a wa aniye ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />&lt;&lt;Amehreh reh ka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;Ada, mya meh kpakpana na Nnoh ma inza tasa na anzoh. Mya meh tswa meh ti za bu amehreh anzoh za kpeh.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />&lt;&lt;Alehmeh neh ka a bleh ma ahwra a ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;De kuri alindeh a ŋoh anyi ba nnoh na gbugbo ti ba bu were ŋoh, ti fi noh akpreh ma ameh ivoh tasa akpehtreh hwana. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />De nnoh ameh londo ata nza bu agba alindeh feh si fa nnoh, mbohroh meh ti rya timi kira. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Amehreh amya reh tana a kwo, nehnehreh kǝ gyuru hinga a yiri yama; tana a bleh meh hunji ŋoh.&gt;Maka a leh a johjoh na a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />&lt;&lt;Amehreh a ŋoh agbaa neh a treh a kasa ma aye. Nza ka a ba ma nda afiya, ka a sehreh kanga tasa kira. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Ŋoh neh ka a fi ahwra amoh anyi ka a luhu ŋoh la a bu mboh a buti na ma afya? <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />A ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;Atsi anzoh kǝ ba,&gt; &lt;Atsiyoh kǝ fa ŋoh ameh londo agba la a gyuru ba a ŋoh afya alindeh,&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Atsini agba ka a te gofo ka a leke niye a na afya. Alehmeh ka a kate a na na a kwere ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Ŋoh neh ka a kira ma alehmeh la, &lt;Nza! Nimeh ahushi amboh reh nambri mya meh te noh ndohmoh tswanza ahwra, mya meh sohroh leke tsifa anzoh kpeh. Nnoh ni kama de ameh ibi anduhwa fa meh meh ti johjoh mbohroh ziza amya mboh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Nza amehreh anzoh neh ata nza a lofo awumu anzoh a treh nambri atsi leh na angrangra mboh, ŋoh nza a ba afiya, nnoh ni mla ŋoh ameh londo ata nza amwo.<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />&lt;&lt;Alehmeh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;Amehreh amya&gt; ni kǝ bu na amya ni tutu, awumu amya nambri a ba anzoh. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Mbohroh neh a zohhoh meh ti kira tasa johjoh, la atsi anzoh reh tana a kwo nehnehreh neh kǝ gyuru bu na fene yama, tana a bleh Mbohroh meh hunji ŋoh yama.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Kakranda Ma Ikpi Kyangwri Kakama Tsifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yeso ka a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri asabara anyi a yama, a bu na kyangwri ata ka a nza ŋoh awumu mboh reh. Maka a ba ba a bleh ŋoh la kyangwri de awumu reh a de asabara reh alindeh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Ka a fi kyangwri ndohmoh a ŋoh reh ta ka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;A bu umbo ata mya nza ni sehreh ma ikpi anzoh reh? Tsana meh awumu ata nza ni lisa reh, nza a bu dehreh ni nati za bu kyangwri sumu meh awumu amya za kpeh.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />&lt;&lt;Kyangwri te ŋoh ndohmoh reh ka a bleh ma ikpi a ŋoh la, &lt;Meh nati lisa lele nehnehreh? Agba amya kǝ sa ndohmoh amya a hwana. Meh sohroh bu na wuwana ata hafa kpeh, a te meh na sa meh ti hende kwere. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Meh wina andromboh ata mya nza ni nati lisa reh, nza meh ta ndohmoh amya ma mareh, kyangwri mata a sa meh na afiyafiya amoh mboh.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />&lt;&lt;Ka a fi amboh ata agba amoh nza a tufa mboh hungroh reh anyinyimbehreh. Ka a luhu ata jiji ŋoh la, &lt;Agba amya reh a tufa nnoh amama?&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />A ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;A tufa meh amehneh akpehngeh angbogbo Agrumavoh ida agrumavoh,&gt; Agba kyangwri ndohmoh reh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;Gu amgbasho kohfoh nza ma a tufa nnoh reh, tuma na inzi fifi ti lisa ta a bu agrumavoh ida atungu.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />&lt;&lt;Ka a luhu ata afri za la, agba amya reh a tufa nnoh amama?&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">A ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu hungroh agrumavoh ida agrumavoh ata yohroh alikama.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">&lt;&lt;Ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;Gu amgbasho anzoh ti ŋa agrumavoh ida atsiyatsiya.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />&lt;&lt;Kyangwri afiya reh ka a kwende ma kyangwri ata nza te ŋoh ndohmoh yehlehleh kpeh reh la a tsana lomo nimeh ndohmoh a ŋoh. Kyangwri amboh ameh ata areh ma a wina lisa kyangwri amboh ameh amoh mboh reh na lomo a keh amboh ata nza a bu nimeh zana Nnoh reh. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yeso ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh la mla nnoh hungroh amohnoh mboh, ata nza ni hunji nyi nnoh ma aki ata nza bu yehlehleh kpeh reh amohnoh ziza mboh, la nza asabara reh a trina, ma a nati a sa noh nimeh afiya ata tuma atono.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />&lt;&lt;Kyangwri ata nza lisa yehlehleh na na andromboh shidi, ma a nati a gya agohsoh na a ŋoh na andromboh gaga, tasa za kyangwri ata nza a tsana huru tsifa na andromboh akehreh ma a nati a huru tsifa na a ŋoh za na andromboh agba. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Nza ni lisa noh yehlehleh kpeh na asabara amboh ata inziyo reh, ni nati lisa lele feh noh si nga kira na asabara ata a zizi ŋoh reh? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Tasa za Nza ni wina de noh awumu akyo yehlehleh kpeh, anyi a nati a nga noh andromboh ata a bu amohnoh?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />&lt;&lt;Ahwra anyimbehreh a nati a wina te ndohmoh ma kyangwri afiya afri kpeh, ha neh ta a leke anyimbehreh ta a kira anyimbehreh, ha a kira na tsifa anyimbehreh ta a rina tsifa anyimbehreh. Ni nati wina tufa Nnoh tasa hungroh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Farisiyawa mboh nza ma a bu amboh kira hungroh reh, nza maka a sehreh Yeso atsi tsifa dehreh reh maka a sungwra na a ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;A bu mohnoh ni kǝ kira ti tsana noh ikpi amohnoh ma tohmoh kyangwri mboh la ni bu noh kyangwri alilehndeh, Nnoh neh a wina agohsoh amohnoh mboh. Andromboh ata nza a zohhoh na kyangwri mboh, a bu awumu amboh wohroh Nnoh nza kira ta a nza mboh kpeh reh.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mgbiri Tsana Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />&lt;&lt;A bu tsana akpi Musa tasa ata amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh kyangwri nza ma a leh a tufa a gu ka a ba na ameh Ayohana kyangwri wra batisma reh. Nza ka anyi avoh wohroh reh, maka a leh ahwra tsifa nana a bleh ma ikpi akpo afiya Nnoh ata inza reh, anyima maka kira la mata aniye a na nimeh akpo afiya reh. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />A bu na ya kpeh inza tasa inziyo ta a lalana mata a bleh la ŋa anyimbehreh nimeh amgbasho akpi reh ma a fufa a kate.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />&lt;&lt;Akyo ata nza a katsi afiya ŋoh ta a na na a gyuru a sa afiya anyi, a zaka leh ahohndoh na akyo ma, tasa za kyangwri ata nza a sa afiya ata nza a leke atsifa a ŋoh, a zaka leh ahohndoh na akyo ma.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kyangwri Asabara tasa Lazarus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />&lt;&lt;Kyangwri asabara anyi tana a yama, tana ka a were kuri atisha ata ŋana alindeh ata nza bu wi ma, a leh a nza nana tasa za a rya irya alindeh na tutu. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Ma anida afiya a ŋoh reh, kyangwri iya anyi a yama, isa a ŋoh a bu Lazarus, itoh a ŋoh nambri a bu ibla ma, maka a gu ŋoh a ba afiya kyangwri asabara reh na tutu, <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />tasa za ka a leh a fasa irya ata nza a hwa ma nza ni anyi ma ikpi ateburu kyangwri asabara reh. Avava mboh za maka a ba ba a fene ibla ma itoh a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />&lt;&lt;Kyangwri iya reh ka a kwo, mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh reh maka a gu ŋoh a gya ma atsi tuma alindeh ma inda Ibrahim. Kyangwri asabara nza a kwo za maka anyifo ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />A ka a na afiya shira ata maka a fi la Hades, a ka a leh a wa iya agba ma a huru, ŋoh nza ka a gu ikpi a ŋoh a ka, ka a nza Ibrahim anyi gbugba mboh ma Lazarus. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Nza ka a fi, &lt;Ada Ibrahim, nza kwini amya ti tohmoh lazarus ta a soh anene ameh ivoh ŋoh nimeh amwo ta akuku meh arimi, meh buti wa iya nimeh shira reh.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />&lt;&lt;Ibrahim ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;Amehreh amya, kohnoh ameh ata ti kǝ bu ma inziyo reh, tini bu na awumu alilehndeh, neh lazarus tana a bu na awumu abibi. Nehnehreh neh a buti a nza nana, nnoh ni leh wa iya. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Tas a ni amboh areh nambri, ni meh Mbohroh tasa mohnoh agbeh kumu agba nza ma a biya na amboh ata nza ma a kira mata a hinga ni mareh mata a hwana a ba ni mgba amohnoh mata a hunji wuwana, nza a bu dehreh mata a hwana a ba na ambohroh.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Ka a kira la, &lt;mya mi kwere nnoh, ada, tohmoh lazarus na mara amya mboh, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />meh bu na atsi mya mboh atungu, ta a na na a bleh mboh, la mata a sohroh a ba atsi iya reh kpeh.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />&lt;&lt;Ibrahim ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;Atsi anzoh mboh ma a bu na tsana Musa tasa ata amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh, la tama a sehreh andromboh ata nza a bleh mboh reh.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Kyangwri asabara reh ka a bleh la, &lt;Wohroh a sohroh a tswa kpeh, Ada Ibrahim! Nza akyo anyi neh a hinga anyi ma kwo a ba feh, masa ka ta akeki agugu amoh mboh reh.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />&lt;&lt;Ibrahim ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;Nza ma a nati a sa tsifa Musa tasa amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh kpeh, nza akyo a hinga anyi ma kwo za, ma a nati a sohroh a sa tsifa ŋoh a kira kpeh.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Kpakpana, Nga Agohsoh, Ndohmoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yeso ka a bleh ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh: &lt;&lt;Awumu amboh ata nza a nati a de kyangwri mboh mata a kpakpana ma a nati a treh a ba, iya agba neh na akyo ata nza a nati a de kpakpana reh a ba. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />A nati a keh a zohhoh mata a lafa kpakpa hwa ma agba akyo wohroh neh mata a gu ŋoh a shebiri nimeh fini agba na ata mata la ta lisa anyi nimeh amehreh mboh reh mata a kpakpana. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Nza a bu dehreh lisa nza noh ikpi amohnoh mboh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">Nza atsi anzoh a kpakpana nnoh hwa ŋoh, tasa za nza a ka ta aki agugu a ŋoh reh, te kohhroh na kpakpana a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Nza ka a kpakpana na anzoh hwana atehrehkifi na anyi ibi anyimbehreh, tasa za ka a gyuru a ba ba a hunji noh hwana atehrehkifi na anyi la,&lt;Mya meh gyuruna ta aki agugu amya,&gt; te kohhroh na kpakpana a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Amboh sa tohmoh nana Yeso a bleh reh maka a bleh ma Ada Nnoh la, nga reh wuwa agohsoh ambohroh mishi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Ada Yeso reh a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nza ni bu na nga agohsoh mbimbi tswanza yohroh agbeh kumu, ni nati wina a bleh ma agbeh agba areh la, kate ni chuhu ma nyi ni ma mareh ti na ni fana nimeh fini agba,&gt;a nati a kira tsifa anzoh.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Ma a bleh la akyo anyi nimeh amohnoh a bu na ahwra ata ka a hafa ŋoh ha la a sumu ŋoh atashi, na ameh ata nza ka anyi bini a ba ŋoh, a nati a wina a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;Ba fifi, ti ba bu tuma rya irya? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Ha neh a nati a bleh la,&lt;Trisa meh irya amya ata Nvishi, tuma bana meh ti rya irya tasa meh ti wa tre fya nnoh za si rya tasa wa anzoh? <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Ha a nati a kwende ahwra reh la a te ndohmoh ata ŋoh nza a bleh reh? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Tasa mohnoh za, nza ni lisa noh awumu amboh ata nza ma a bleh la lisa nnoh reh nambri, ti bleh noh la, mbohroh meh mboh ahwra abibi mboh; meh zakǝ lisa ndohmoh ambohroh tsene ma.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amboh Bishi Kohmoh Mboh Agrumavoh ma A hunji Wuwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Nza ka a bu ma aki na Urushalima, Yeso ka a gǝga ma hohnoh Samariya tasa Galili. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Nza ka a buti a na a ŋoh akpo afiya akehreh anyi, amboh bishi kohmoh mboh agrumavoh maka a ba ba a hunji ŋoh. Maka a shi anyi gbugba shidi <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />maka a fi ŋoh a vuru agba a kate mama la,&lt;&lt;Ada ambohroh Yeso, nza kwini ambohroh!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Yeso nza ka a nza mboh reh, ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Na ni tsana noh ikpi amohnoh ma firist mboh ma ida Nnoh reh.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Nza maka a buti a na amoh reh, maka a hwara mboh bishi kohmoh reh maka bu fyafya.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Anyimbehreh amoh, nza ka a nza la ŋoh kǝ hunji wuwana reh, ka a gyuru a ba na a ŋoh, ta ka a leh ariri Nnoh a vuru agba mama. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Ka a ba ba a hwa ma hohroh a ŋoh ta ka a kwende ŋoh, ata wohroh reh a bu kyangwri Samariya.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;A bu mohnoh agrumavoh mya nza ni lisa noh ti bu noh fyafya reh kpeh? Mgbiri atsiyatsiya na anyi reh ma a bu na mma? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />A bu lele feh ka bu ŋoh sene tsene ma a gyuru a ba ba ariri Nnoh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, Hinga ti na anzoh; nga agohsoh anzoh kǝ nga nnoh wuwana&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akpo Afiya Nnoh ata Inza A nati A ba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Farisiyawa mboh maka a leh a luhu Yeso ameh ata kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza a nati a ba reh, Yeso ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza reh a nati a ba mohnoh ti nza noh kpeh, <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />ha kyangwri mboh ma a nati a bleh la, &lt;Nza ŋoh uwe&gt; ha neh mata a bleh la, &lt;Nza ŋoh ari&gt; la kpra Agohmoh Nnoh ata inza reh a bu nimeh amohnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Ka a bleh ma amboh tufa ŋoh mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ameh a nati a ba ata ni nati kira ti nza noh ibi anyimbehreh nimeh ibi amehreh kyangwri, mohnoh neh ni nati nza noh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Kyangwri ma a nati a bleh noh la, &lt;&lt;Nza ŋoh uwe!&gt;ha&lt;nza ŋoh ari!&gt; Kama gbo tufa mboh nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Amehreh kyangwri neh ma ibi a ŋoh reh, a nati a tswanza ryanza, ata ka a tsana ta a zana avereh inza anyi mgba anyi a gu a na mgba anyi. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ŋoh neh a nati a jiji a wa iya mboh reh ma atsi tse kanga feh, kyangwri amboh ika ata areh masa leke ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />&lt;&lt;Tswanza ta ka a bu na ameh Anuhu reh, dehreh za a nati a bu na ameh ata amehreh kyangwri. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Kyangwri tama a leh a rya irya mata a leh a wa, ifiya mboh ma tsifa mboh maka a leh a sa itoh amoh, a ka a gu ka a na na ameh ata Anuhu ta ka aniye nimeh gbogblondo amwo reh mboh ma mara a ŋoh mboh. Awi agba nza ka a ba reh ka a mla mboh a sangra nambri. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />&lt;&lt;Tana a bu dehreh za na ameh Lot. Kyangwri mboh tama a leh a rya irya, tasa mata a leh a wa, mata a leh a sa awumu mata ka a rifa awumu, tasa mata a leh a mina dida mboh za. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ibi ata Lot ta ka a yi Sodom ata reh neh, maka a were shira tasa shira nyungo anyi ma inza, ta ka afiya mboh a kwo nambri. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />&lt;&lt;A nati a tswanza ika wohroh ibi ata amehreh kyangwri a nati a ba reh.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Ibi wohroh reh akyo ata nza a yama ma ikpi tsitsi, na awumu ŋoh nimeh ida reh, ta a sohroh a tamba la ŋoh ta a na na a gu andromboh nimeh ida reh kpeh. Tasa za, akyo ata nza a bu ma aye reh, ta a sohroh a gyuruna a na afiya za kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Kohnoh na afiya lot! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Akyo ata nza a kira ta a lisa a gya fene a ŋoh, a nati a hunji kpeh. Tasa za akyo ata nza a hunji fene a ŋoh kpeh, a nati a lisa a gu a gya. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />meh bleh noh zizi, ni shini ibi ata wohroh, kyangwri afri ma a nati a leh ma tundu anyimbehreh; ma a nati a gu anyimbehreh neh mata ata anyi. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />ifiya mboh afri ma a nati a hwa mboh ma atohngoh, ma a nati a gu anyimbehreh neh mata ata anyi&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Kyangwri afri ma a nati a yama na aye, ma a nati a gu anyimbehreh mata ata anyi.<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Amboh tufa mboh reh maka a luhu la,&lt;&lt;Ada, ma mma?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Atsi ata itoh kohmoh mboh nza ma a yama reh akpabi mboh za maka a dohsohna ma a huru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Kakranda Ma Ikpi Afya Nata Anyi Ata Atsifa A ŋoh kǝ kwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yeso ka a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh kakranda ata nza a tsana la mata ka a kwere Nnoh na tutu mata kama a kohhoh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Ka a bleh la: &lt;&lt;Ma akpo afiya agba anyi kyangwri hwra akpi anyi a yama a ka nyiri Nnoh ha andromboh ta a wa ŋoh aniye na kyangwri mboh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Tasa afya kunu anyi tana a yama ma akpo afya reh tana a ka a ba ba a leh a kwere ŋoh na tutu la, &lt;Shingi meh ti nza yehlehleh mata a sa andromboh ata nza a bu amya anyi na amboh ata nza ma a fi aniye amya reh.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Na jiji reh, kyangwri hwra akpi reh tana a leke, Nza ka a ba trina ŋoh neh a ka a kohnoh ma agohsoh a ŋoh la, &lt;Nza mya meh kǝ nyiri Nnoh ha andromboh ta a wa meh aniye na kyangwri mboh kpeh, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />tsifa afya reh neh a wa meh aniye, meh nati hwra ŋoh akpi reh meh ti nza yehlehleh. Ta a kama a ba ba a leh a wa meh aniye na tutu za kpeh!&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Ada ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Sehreh nnoh tsifa ata kyangwri hwra akpi yehlehleh kpeh nza a bleh reh. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Nehnehreh, ha Nnoh a nati a wina hwra akpi alindeh ma kyangwri amboh ata ŋoh nza a seh mboh, amboh ata nza ma a kpanga a fi ŋoh na tutu reh kpeh? Ha a nati a shingi mboh na gbugbo kpeh? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Meh ti bleh noh, a nati a nza la mata a hunji hwra akpi alindeh na gbugbo. Amehreh kyangwri neh a nati a hunji nga agohsoh ma inziyo areh ameh ata ŋoh a nati a ba reh?<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakranda ma Ikpi Farisiyawa Anyi tasa Kyangwri sa Hungroh Gandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yeso a gyuru a bleh kakranda anyi za ma amboh ata nza ma a gu ikpi a moh la mboh ma bu amboh tufa yehlehleh, tasa za maka a gyuru a leh a rina mgbiri kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />&lt;&lt;Kyangwri mboh afri ma a na atsi kwere Nnoh nimeh ida Nnoh, anyi a bu kyangwri Farisiyawa tasa atohngoh a bu amboh sa hungroh gandu: <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Kyangwri Farisiyawa reh ka a hinga a shi a kwere Nnoh ma ikpi a ŋoh la: &lt;Nnoh meh kwende Nnoh la mya meh tswanza mgbiri kyangwri mboh kpeh, amboh te ayuhu, amboh ata nza ma a sa tsifa a kira kpeh, amboh leh ahohndoh na akyo ha kyangwri sa hungroh gandu areh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Meh kǝ de aniye te na afri nimeh sati tasa meh kǝ fufa tre nyi amya ata meh kǝ hunji reh.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />&lt;&lt;Kyangwri sa hungroh gandu reh neh ka a shi a na gbugba. A sohroh a gu kpi a ka inza kpeh, a ka a leh ava agohsoh a ŋoh la, &lt;Nnoh, nza kwini amya mya meh bu kyangwri kpakpana!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Meh bleh noh, kyangwri ata nza a sa hungroh gandu reh a bu yehlehleh na Nnoh, kyangwri Farisiyawa reh neh a sohroh a bu yehlehleh na Nnoh kpeh. Akyo ata nza a gu ikpi a ŋoh a ka, ma a nati a gu ŋoh a gya a tamba, akyo ata nza a gu ikpi a ŋoh a tamba ma a nati a gu ŋoh a ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mara Akǝkehreh tasa Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Kyangwri mboh tama ka a fira amehreh akǝkehreh mboh a ba na Yeso la ta a gya mboh ivoh ta a te mboh atoh. amboh tufa Yeso nza maka a nza dehreh maka a hwa mboh. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Yeso neh ka a fi amehreh mboh reh a na na a ŋoh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ta nnoh amehreh akǝkehreh mboh reh mata a ba na amya, ti kama ha mboh nnoh kpeh, akpo afiya Nnoh reh a bu ata amboh ika wohroh. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Meh bleh noh zizi, akyo ata nza a sa akpo afiya Nnoh tswanza amehreh akehreh kpeh a nati aniye a na nimeh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agohmoh ata Nza A bu na Asabara</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Ama 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mk 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Agba Yahudawa anyi ka luhu Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh kyangwri tsana alindeh meh kǝ nati lisa lele feh misi hunji fene ata tuma atono?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yeso ka a luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ fi meh la kyangwri alindeh reh tsifa umbo?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Akyo anyi a sohroh a bu alindeh kpeh a bu Nnoh tsene ma. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Nnoh ni wina andromboh ata doka nza a bleh reh la, kama leh ahohndoh na akyo kpeh, kama te ayuhu kpeh, kama bleh tsifa ata huru tsifa ma ikpi akyo kpeh, nga agba ma atsiyoh tasa atono.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Kyangwri reh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Meh tufa akpi amboh areh nambri neh meh ti kǝ tre bu amehreh akehreh reh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Yeso nza ka a sehreh dehreh, ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A treh a hwa nnoh andromboh anyimbehreh ti lisa. Na ni rifa na awumu anzoh mboh nambri ti nga hungroh reh ma amboh iya mboh, ni nati hunji asabara ma inza; ti kǝ ba bu wa meh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Kyangwri neh nza ka a sehreh tsifa reh, ka a kputu agohsoh gaga, tsifa la ŋoh a bu na asabara.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yeso nza ka a nza la a kputu agohsoh a ŋoh, ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A nati a bu na iya amboh hungroh mboh mata aniye a na nimeh akpo afiya Nnoh! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />A nati a bu na iya kpeh nyama ta aniye a gǝga ma nvitsi akusu, mata a bleh la kyangwri asabara ta aniye a na akpo afiya Nnoh&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a sehreh tsifa reh, maka luhu la, &lt;&lt;A ka bu anyi ata nza a nati a hunji nvara reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yeso ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Andromboh ata nza ka a keh wuwana kyangwri, ka a sohroh a keh wuwana Nnoh kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Abitrusu ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza! Mbohroh meh ta afiyafiya ambohroh mboh meh nati tufa nnoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Andromboh ata mya nza ni bleh noh reh a bu zizi, akyo ata nza ta afiya a ŋoh, ha afya a ŋoh, ha alehmeh mboh, ha atsini mboh, ha mara a ŋoh mboh, la tsifa akpo afiya Nnoh reh, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />ma a nati a hunji awumu gaga anyi na Nnoh a keh ata nza ma ata ma nyina reh na ameh ata nehnehreh, tasa ameh ata ba, tasa fene ata tuma atono.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A gyuru Atsifa za Ma Kpi Kwo a ŋoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yeso ka a fira amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh a gya na nda ta ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nza! Mbohroh meh nati na ambohroh Urushalima, atsi ata amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh mboh ta maka a ŋa ma ikpi amehreh kyangwri reh a nati a su. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Ma a nati a de ŋoh a nga amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, mata a te ŋoh inyi, mata a kya ŋoh tasa za mata tofo ata a were ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Ma a nati a mla ŋoh na amviri tasa za mata a mla ŋoh a kwo, Ibi na atatoh neh a nati a gyuru a hinga yama.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh neh ma a sohroh a wina andromboh ata Yeso nza a leh a bleh reh kpeh, ma a huho mboh lomo tsifa reh, tasa za ma a sohroh a wina andromboh ata Yeso nza a leh atsifa ma ikpi reh kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kyangwri kwere ata nza A hama iyo A hunji Nza Atsifi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Yeso nza ka a ba ma nda Jeriko, kyangwri hama iyo anyi ka a tuma a kwere aki ka. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Nza ka a sehreh duma mboh atsi gǝga reh, ka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ata areh a ka bu umbo?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Yeso ata Nazaret wa a buti a gǝga.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Ka a fi mama la, &lt;&lt;Yeso! amehreh Dawuda, nza kwini amya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Kyangwri amboh ata nza ma a bu ma tohmoh reh maka a te gofo na a ŋoh, maka a hwa ŋoh la ta bu gbalala. Ka a lisa ka a te kpiriga a keh a leh a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Amehreh Dawuda nza kwini amya!&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yeso ka a shi, a bleh mboh la ma a de kyangwri hama iyo reh a ba ŋoh. Nza ka a kpusu a ba ma nda, Yeso ka a luhu ŋoh, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />Ni kira meh ti kǝ lisa nnoh umbo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">Ka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada amya, meh kira meh ti gyuru hunji nza atsifi yama. <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh ni hunji nza atsifi! A bu nga agohsoh anzoh mi nza a nga noh nvara reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />A ka hunji nza atsifi ma hwana anyimbehreh, tasa ka a tufa Yeso, ta ka a leh nga agba ma Nnoh. Kyangwri mboh nambri nza maka a nza dehreh, maka a leh ariri Nnoh.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Zakka Kyangwri sa Gandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yeso nza ka aniye a gǝga ma Jeriko. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Kyangwri anyi a yama isa a ŋoh a bu Zakka; ŋoh bu agba kyangwri sa hungroh gandu ŋoh a bu kyangwri asabara. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />A kira ŋoh ta a nza la a ka bu anyi a bu Yeso reh, ŋoh neh a bu mgbiri kyangwri, kyangwri mboh maka hama ŋoh ka nza ŋoh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Zakka reh ka a gbo a jitomo a na a ŋoh na a ka ma agbeh mgbungba anyi la ŋoh ta tuma ma agbeh reh la ŋoh ta nza ŋoh, Yeso reh a nati a gǝga ma aki wohroh <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Yeso nza ka a na na a te ma chuhu agbeh reh ka a gu iyo a ŋoh a ka ma inza ka a bleh ŋoh la &lt;&lt;Zakka, tamba nehnehreh. Mya meh nati tuma ma afiya anzoh andrehmeh areh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Zakka reh ka a tamba na gbugbo, ta ka a sa ŋoh johjoh. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Kyangwri mboh nza maka a nza dehreh maka a goh atsetse, maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri ata areh a na sehneh ma afiya kyangwri kpakpana.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Zakka neh ka hinga a shi ka a bleh ma Ada la, &lt;&lt;Agba, sehreh! Meh nati gafa hwashi asabara amya ma amboh iya mboh, tasa za ha meh gǝga hwana awumu akyo meh nati fanga te na aniye ŋoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Andrehmeh areh nvara kǝ ba nashi ata areh, tasa za ŋoh Zakka reh a bu alohsoh Ibrahim. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Ta a sa za la mya amehreh kyangwri meh ba atsi fa ata nza a bleh, meh ti nga ŋoh nvara za.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakranda Na Ikpi Ahwra mboh Agrumavoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Nza maka a treh a shi a sehreh reh, Yeso ka tsifa na amoh nimeh kakranda, ŋoh tana a bu ma nda Urushalima tasa za kyangwri tama ka a nza amoh la kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh kǝ ba heri. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Yeso ka bleh mboh la: &lt;&lt;Kyangwri agba anyi a yama nza ma mara ŋoh anyi ma alohsoh Agohmoh ka a hinga a na a ŋoh akpo afiya anyi na gbugba la mata a na a sa ŋoh a gu a gya Agohmoh sa a gyuru a ba a ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Nza a nati a na a ŋoh reh ka fi ahwra a ŋoh mboh agrumavoh reh, ta ka gafa mboh hungroh &lt;la mata a na na te ndohmoh na wohroh, la ŋoh tana a gyuru a ba a ŋoh feh.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />&lt;&lt;Kyangwri amboh tufa ŋoh neh maka a kira na a ŋoh kpeh maka tohmoh la ma a na na a bleh la &lt;Mboh ma sohroh a kira kyangwri reh ta a ba Agohmoh amoh kpeh.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />&lt;&lt;Nza maka a nga ŋoh Agohmoh reh kukwiyi a treh reh, ka a gyuru a ba a ŋoh afiya. Ka tohmoh la ma a fi ahwra a ŋoh mboh amboh ata ŋoh nza a nga mboh hungroh reh mata a ba ba a tsana ŋoh ha ma a hunji amama a mangara na ikpi ŋoh reh. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Ahwra ata anyimbehreh ŋoh ka a ba ba a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;Agba, mya meh hunji nehra agrumavoh mangara na ata nza ni nga reh.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Agba a ŋoh reh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;Nnoh reh feh, ni bu ahwra alindeh!&gt; Nnoh ni lisa yehlehleh na ameh andromboh akehreh, meh nati nga nnoh wuwana ti tuma de akpokpo afiyafiya agrumavoh.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Ahwra ata na afri ŋoh reh ka a ba ba a bleh za la,&lt;Ada, mya meh hunji hungroh reh nehra atungu mangara na anyimbehreh ata nnoh nza ni nga meh reh,&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />&lt;&lt;Ada a ŋoh reh ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;Tuma ti de akpokpo afiyafiya atungu reh.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />&lt;&lt;Amehreh ahwra anyi neh ka ba a bleh a ŋoh la, &lt;Agba, nza nvitsi hungroh anzoh uwe; meh sa na ni gya huho na hwashi kuri. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Meh nyiri nnoh, lomo anzoh a bu na iya. Nnoh ni kǝ fasa awumu nza a bu anzoh kpeh, tasa za ni kǝ gu awumu na aye ata nnoh ni sohroh biya kpeh.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />&lt;&lt;Agba a ŋoh reh neh ka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;Meh nati gu tsifa anzoh hwra noh akpi, noh ni bu agugu ahwra! noh ni wina la lomo amya a bu na iya, tasa za la meh kǝ fasa awumu atsi ata mya nza ni gya kpeh, tasa za la meh kǝ fasa nyi ma aye ata mya nza ni sohroh biya kpeh? <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />A ka a bu umbo a shwa nnoh ti gu nnoh hungroh amya reh na ni gya nnoh ma ganzi hungroh reh kpeh? nza meh ba neh mata a gya firoh hungroh anyi a mangara meh kpeh?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Neh ka a bleh ma amboh ata nza ma a shi ma nda a ŋoh reh la, maka sa nehra anyimbehreh ata hungroh a ŋoh reh mata a gu a nga ata nza a bu na nehra agrumavoh reh.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Neh maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;Agba, ŋoh kǝ bu na nehra agrumavoh reh!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Agba amoh reh neh ka kira la, meh bleh noh la, akyo ata nza a bu na wohroh, ma a nati a nga ŋoh a mangara, ata nza a bu na andromboh kpeh neh, ambimbi ata ŋoh nza a bu na wohroh ma a nati a sa a hwana. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Amboh ata nza ma a fi meh ma tohmoh reh neh ma sohroh a kira la meh ti te Agohmoh amoh kpeh, de mboh nnoh ba nnoh ma mareh ti ba bu mla mboh nnoh mata a kwo ma tohmoh amya.<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso a Niye a na Urushalima Tswanza Agohmoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Yeso nza ka a bleh mboh dehreh a treh, ka a gu aki a na a ŋoh Urushalima. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Nza ka a na ma nda akpo afiya anyi nza maka a fi la Betafaji tasa Betani ma a gbo anyi nza maka a fi la agbohgboh agbeh akpehngeh, ka tohmoh amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh afri, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />ka a bleh mboh la,&lt;&lt;Na nnoh ma akpo afiya ata tomo amohnoh aro, ni nati nza noh ameh nyama anyi ma de a lafa a gya ma aki ma a huru, akyo kǝ hehreh ka nza kpeh. Hingre ti de ba nnoh ma mareh, <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Nza akyo luhu nnoh la, &lt;Ni hingre nnoh tsifa umbo? Bleh nnoh la, &lt;Ada agba a kira&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Amboh ata nza ma tohmoh mboh reh maka a na na a nza tswanza Yeso nza a bleh mboh reh yehlehleh. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Nza maka buti hingre ameh nyama reh, amboh nyama reh maka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni hingre nnoh nyama reh tsifa umbo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Maka bleh mboh la, A bu Ada agba a kira. <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Maka a de ameh nyama reh a ba na Yeso, maka fese kuri amoh na ikpi nyama reh neh, maka a gu Yeso a gya ma ikpi ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Yeso nza ka buti hende ma aki, kyangwri mboh maka a fira akuri atasaa avuvu ahweh mboh ka dada ŋoh ma aki. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Nza ka a ba ma nda Urushalima, atsifi ata aki nza a leh a tamba a na agbohgboh agbeh akpehngeh reh, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh nambri maka a leh a kwende Nnoh tasa za maka a riri ŋoh a vuru agba mama tsifa agbugba ndohmoh ŋara aniye ata mboh nza ma a nza reh.<verse eid="LUK 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Maka a vuru agba a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh ta te atoh ma Agohmoh ata nza a nati ba nimeh isa Ada reh&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">&lt;&lt;Inza ta tuma alindeh tasa za nga agba a keh ta bu Nnoh ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Farisiyawa amboh anyi nimeh duma mboh reh maka bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, hwa amboh tufa anzoh mboh reh mata a bu gbalala!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Yeso neh ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Meh ti bleh noh la nza amboh areh ma bu gbalala reh, kpakpa amboh areh ma a nati a te kpiriga,&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Nza ka a ba ma nda Urushalima Yeso ka a nza akpo afiya reh, ka kpanga ma akpo afiya reh <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Maka a bleh la mohnoh tini wina noh ha a ka bu mboh a nati a de tuma alindeh a ba nnoh andrehmeh nehnehreh neh maka huho ma iyo amohnoh. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Ameh a nati a ba amboh ata nza ma a fi noh ma tohmoh ma a nati a kpafa agbeh a goh nnoh a gya ma akpo anyimbehreh, mata a goh nnoh a dohsoh tasa za mata a goh nnoh a fi ma atsitsifi. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Ma a nati a lofo nnoh a treh a wa mara amohnoh mboh nambri a wa kyangwri amboh ata nza ma tuma na amohnoh. ma a nati a sohroh a yi akyo anyimbehreh ata kpeh, ma a nati a sohroh ata kpakpa anyi ta a tuma ma ikpi atohngoh kpeh ma akpo afya amohnoh tsifa ata mohnoh nza ni sohroh nza wina noh ameh ata Nnoh nza a ba ta a sa noh a hwana reh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso Nimeh Ida Kwere Nnoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Yeso ka aniye a na nimeh ida Nnoh ka katsi amboh rifa na awumu. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;A bu ŋa gya nimeh amgbasho Nnoh reh la Nnoh a bleh la, &lt;Afiya amya a nati a bu ida kwere.&gt; Mohnoh neh ni gyuru de te nnoh atsi huho ayuhu mboh.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Ibibi ka a leh a tsana mboh nimeh ida Nnoh. Agbugba firist mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh tasa agohgohmoh kyangwri mboh maka a leh a fa akeki la mata a mla ŋoh a kwo. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Mboh neh ma a fa aki mata a mla a kwo kavoh la kyangwri mboh nza maka a sa tsifa a ŋoh a kira reh.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Ma A luhu La Anyi A gu Yeso A gya Agba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Ibi anyi Yeso nza ka aniye nimeh ida Nnoh ka a leh tsana kyangwri mboh tasa za ka a leh ahwra tsifa nana a bleh mboh, agbugba Firist mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh, tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh maka ba na a ŋoh, <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />maka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;bleh reh, ni luhu anyi feh si te ndohmoh agbugba ata areh,&gt;&gt; Ma luhu ŋoh la a bleh reh a bu anyi a nga noh wuwana ata areh?&gt;&gt;Maka a bleh la &lt;&lt;Ni luhu anyi feh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Ka sa mboh aniye la, mya za meh nati luhu nnoh tsifa anyi, mohnoh za ti a bleh meh noh. <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Wra batisma Ayohana ta ka wra reh, tana ka anyi inza ha tana anyi ni kyangwri umbo?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Maka a na na atsifa ma itoh amoh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nza timi bleh la,&lt;Tana anyi inza,&gt; a nati a luhu la,&lt;A ka a bu umbo a shwa nnoh ti sa nnoh tsifa a ŋoh reh kira nnoh kpeh?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Nza timi bleh la, &lt;Anyi na kyangwri mboh&gt; Duma mboh reh ma a nati a dadafa reh na kpakpa, duma na agba ma tama gya agohsoh amoh la, Ayohana tana a bu kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh mi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Maka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh sohroh wina ha tana ka anyi ama kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mya za meh nati sohroh a bleh noh kpeh ha meh sa wuwana reh nyi ama feh misi lisa awumu amboh areh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kakranda Ma Ikpi amboh Sa Kohfoh Aye Inabi</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Ka gyuru a bleh mboh kakranda areh la: &lt;&lt;Kyangwri anyi ka hafa aye a ŋoh neh ka hehreh a gu aye reh a nga kyangwri amboh anyi kohfoh tasa za la mata hehreh a sumu ŋoh aye reh ka na a ŋoh hende ma gbugba ka a na na a yanda ma a huru. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Ameh ata maka a fasa awumu irya anyi Aye a ba afiya reh ka a ba tohmoh ahwra a ŋoh anyi a na na amboh nza ma a sa kohfoh aye reh la mata a na na a sa awumu rya a de a ba ŋoh. Amboh ata nza ma gya mboh ma atsi sumu aye reh neh maka a na na ava ŋoh mla maka katsi ŋoh avoh wusu. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />A gyuru a tohmoh ahwra anyi za ma a za a gyuru a na na ava ŋoh mla mata a ka katsi ŋoh abibi ma kate ŋoh na abibi tasa za ma ata ŋoh avoh wusu. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />A za tohmoh ata na atatoh za maka a na na tsima a te bla tasa za maka yiyi a fi a kate ma inziyo. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Kyangwri aye reh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Meh nati lisa lele feh? meh nati tohmoh amehreh amya, ata mya nza ni kira na a ŋoh; ha ma a nati a nza ŋoh na rishi.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />amboh nza ma a sa kohfoh aye reh nza maka a nza ŋoh neh, maka tsifa na itoh amoh la.&lt;&lt;Areh a bu amehreh a ŋoh,&gt; maka a bleh la ta meh ti mla kwo awumu alehmeh reh ta ka a bu ambohroh.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Maka a kpikpi ŋoh a kate anyi ma aye reh a na ma akachi ŋoh mata ka mla ŋoh a kwo. &lt;&lt;A ka a bu mboh neh kyangwri aye reh ka a nati a lisa umbo? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />A ka a nati a ba ba mla amboh te ndohmoh reh a kwo neh ta ka sa aye reh a hwana a nga kyangwri amboh tswa.&gt;&gt;kyangwri mboh reh nza maka a sehreh tsifa ata areh, maka a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Tsifa ata areh ta kama a su kpeh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Yeso ka were mboh iyo ka a nza mboh ka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ka bu umbo ka bu lomo nza maka ŋa a gya reh la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">&lt;&lt;&lt;Kpakpa ata amboh mina mata ka leke reh</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">kǝ te kpakpa alindeh ata gya chuhu ida&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Akyo ata nza hwa ni kpi kpakpa ata wohroh a nati a chachabana a te akǝkehreh, nza kpakpa reh a ma hwa ma ikpi akyo, a nati a hwa ŋoh a te huru.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Amboh tsana akpi Musa tasa Agbugba firist mboh maka fa akeki la mata ka a tsitsiya ŋoh a de heri, mboh ma wina la tana a jiji a bleh mboh kakranda reh ma kpi amoh. Maka nyiri kyangwri mboh.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fanga Gandu Nga Kaisar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />La Farisiyawa ma ta ka gya iyo ka a nza ŋoh, maka tohmoh amboh nere atsifi mboh, amboh landa tswanza ma bu amboh a zizi la mata a na na leh a luhu ŋoh tsifa. Ma kira la nza a kpakpana neh mata tsitsiya ŋoh a de a nga amboh de kpra Agohmoh ata agohmnati nza ma a bu na wuwana reh. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Amboh nere atsifi nza reh maka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana, mbohroh meh wina la ni kǝ tsifa tasa za ni kǝ tsana a zizi tsifa yehlehleh, tasa za ni kǝ sohroh seh akyo anyi ta kpeh, ni kǝ tsana aki Nnoh ma aki a zizi. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />A zohhoh mbohroh meh ti fanga hungroh gandu nga Kaisar ha meh ti kama fanga kpeh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Yeso nza ka a wina lomo amoh reh ka a bleh mboh la, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />Tsana meh noh hungroh reh fya. Ka luhu mboh la &lt;&lt;A ka bu tohmoh tasa isa anyi nza ma a ŋa a gya nimeh hungroh reh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu Kaisar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nga noh Kaisar awumu ata nza a bu Kaisar a ŋoh ti nga nnoh Nnoh awumu nza a bu Nnoh a ŋoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Maka za wina de ŋoh na tsifa abibi anyi ma tohmoh kyangwri mboh reh za kpeh. Maka bu gbalala ma a leh a ŋara aniye na tsifa a ŋoh reh.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luhu Tsifa ma ikpi Gyuru hinga Nyi Ma Kwo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Ama 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mk 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Sadukiyawa amboh anyi, amboh ata nza ma a bleh la tsifa hinga nyi ma ikpi nyifo na afri a nati a sohroh a yama kpeh reh, maka a ba ba luhu Yeso la. <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />&lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana,&gt;&gt;&lt;&lt;Musa a ŋa gya la nza akyo atsini a kwo ata afiya ta a bu na amehreh kpeh, kyangwri reh tasa afiya atsini reh ta ka mara amehreh mboh ma kunu atsini reh. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />kyangwri amboh anyi mboh atehrehkifi na anyi. Na anyimbehreh a sa afiya ka a kwo a sohroh a bu na amehreh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Atsini na afri ka a sa afiya reh a ba ba a kwo a mara kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Na atatoh za ka a ba ba a sa afiya reh, maka lisa dehreh a gu a nana a te na ata atehrehkifi na anyi reh za ka kwo a sohroh a mara amehreh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Afiya reh za ka a ba ba a kwo. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Nehnehreh, ibi ata amboh jiji kwo mboh ma a nati a hinga anyi ikpi nyifo afiya reh ka a nati a bu afiya anyi, tana a bu kyangwri atehrehkifi na anyi ma ta ka a sa afiya reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la,&lt;&lt;Ifiya tasa tsifa mboh amboh ameh ata areh, maka a sa itoh amoh, <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />ifiya mboh tasa tsifa mboh amboh ata ma a nati a tswa mata a hinga anyi ma kwo na afri reh, mata tuma na ameh ata ba reh, ma a nati a sohroh a sa itoh amoh za kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Tasa ma a nati a za kwo kpeh; ma a nati a bu tswanza mara tohmoh Nnoh amboh amgba reh. Maka a nati a bu mara Nnoh mboh, tsifa ata mboh nza ma a bu mara hinga na afri mboh. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Ma ikpi tsifa ata bini ta ka afya shira reh neh, Musa za na ikpi ma tana a tsana la kunu mboh za ma a nati a gyuru a hinga a yiri, mata a fi Ada la, &lt;Nnoh ata Ibrahim, tasa Nnoh ata Ishaku, tasa Nnoh ata Yakubu.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />A sohroh a bu Nnoh ata amboh kwo mboh kpeh,neh a bu ata amboh fene mi. Ata areh a tsana la awumu mboh reh nambri ma a bu na fene.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Amboh tsana akpi Musa amboh anyi maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ni tsifa alindeh, kyangwri tsana!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Maka za a bu na wuwa agohsoh la mata za a luhu ŋoh tsifa mboh za kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kristi reh A bu Amehreh Anyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yeso neh ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;A ka a bu lele feh maka a bleh la Kristi reh a hwana reh anyi ma alohsoh Dawuda? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Dawuda na ikpi ma a shimba tsifa a bleh ma amgbasho Zabura la:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">&lt;&lt;&lt;Ada a bleh ma Ada amya:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">&lt;&lt;Tuma na mgba ivoh rya a kpa amya <verse eid="LUK 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Meh nati fira amboh ata nza ma a fi noh ma tohmoh mata a bu kpra gya hwana anzoh.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Dawuda a fi ŋoh la &lt;Ada.&gt; Ka a nati a lisa lele feh ta ka a bu amehreh a ŋoh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Kyangwri mboh nambri nza maka a treh a tuma a sehreh reh, Yeso ka a bleh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />&lt;&lt;Lisa nza noh amboh tsana akpi Musa reh. Maka were akuri alilehndeh a hehndeh tasa za maka kira la kyangwri mboh mata ka tsifa na amoh mata ka a nga mboh agba, ma atsi rifa na awumu mboh, maka a seh atsi tuma alindeh nimeh ida dohsohna Yahudawa mboh tasa ma atsi kira. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Maka a rina ifiya kunu mboh mata ka a hwana afiya afiya amoh mboh tasa za maka nata kwere Nnoh la kyangwri mboh mata a bleh la mboh feh. kyangwri amboh wohroh hwra akpi amoh a nati a bu veve kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Ngǝnga Afiya Kunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Nza ka a gu iyo a ka, Yeso ka a nza kyangwri amboh asabara maka buti were ngǝnga amoh mboh nimeh kakara were hungroh ma ida Nnoh. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Ka a nza afiya anyi atsifa a ŋoh kǝ kwo tasa za a bu iya a ŋoh maka a de mara hungroh nvitsi afri a ba ba were. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Mya meh bleh noh a zizi tsifa,&gt;&gt;&lt;&lt;Afiya nza a bu iya a ŋoh ma reh a were a ŋoh a keh mgbiri kyangwri mboh reh nambri. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Kyangwri mboh reh nambri ma a de ngǝnga anyi nimeh asabara ata mboh nza ma a bu na wohroh reh, afiya reh neh nimeh iya a ŋoh ka a were a ŋoh ameh hungroh ata a nati a sa awumu rya na wohroh ta a rya anvara a tuma.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kpra Trina Inziyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Mgbiri amboh tufa ŋoh mboh maka tuma tsifa na ikpi nza ma a jimi ida Nnoh reh alindeh tasa ngǝnga nza ma a de a ba ma Nnoh reh. Yeso neh ka a bleh mboh la, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />&lt;&lt;Awumu nza ni shi nza noh areh, ameh anyi a treh a ba ma a nati a druhu kpakpa amboh areh nambri anyi a nati a sohroh a tuma na ikpi atohngoh kpeh ma a nati ava mboh a sasara nambri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Maka luhu ŋoh la &lt;&lt;Kyangwri tsana,&gt;&gt;Ameh mboh feh ata areh ka nati a su? tasa za a ka a bu mboh ka a nati a bu kpra a ŋoh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Ka a sa mboh aniye la: &lt;&lt;Lisa nza noh feh akyo ta huru nnoh kpeh. Kyangwri gaga ma a nati a ba nimeh isa amya, &lt;Ma a nati a huru nnoh la mboh ma bu mya,&gt; tasa za &lt;Ameh kǝ ba hwiri.&gt;Kama tufa mboh nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Nza ni sere nnoh tsifa gofo tasa kputu agohsoh, kama nyiri nnoh kpeh. amboh ata areh ma a nati a su kanga feh, wohroh a nati a hehreh a bu trina inziyo kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Ka a bleh mboh za la: &lt;&lt;Kyangwri ma akpo afiya anyi ma a nati a na gofo na akpo afiya anyi, tasa za Agohmoh anyi a nati a na gofo na Agohmoh anyi. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Inzi a nati a zuzuna a druhuna, ŋyo tasa bishi abibi ma a nati a hama atsifi, awumu nga nyiri tasa kpra agbugba ma a nati a tamba anyi ni inza. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />&lt;&lt;Na wohroh neh, maka a jiji a nati a sa noh a de ma ta ka a nga noh iya abibi. Ma a nati a de noh a na nimeh dida Nnoh Yahudawa mboh tasa nimeh ida ka, ma a nati a hwra noh akpi ma tohmoh agohgohmoh mboh tasa amboh tuma ma ikpi kpra agbugba mboh, la tsifa isa amya. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Areh ka a nati a bu aki ata nza ni nati hunji te bleh mboh nnoh tsifa amya, ti tsana mboh nnoh aki na inza. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />nehnehreh gya noh agohsoh amohnoh la a nati a sohroh a wa nnoh aniye ha la ni nati sa mboh nnoh aniye la mboh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Meh nati nga nnoh lomo tsifa ata nza ni nati bleh noh mata wina de noh a huru kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Atsiyoh amohnoh mboh, tasa atsi amohnoh mboh, tasa kikini amohnoh mboh, tasa ziza amohnoh mboh ma a nati a de noh a nga mboh mata a mla amboh tswa amohnoh mboh a kwo. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Kyangwri ma a nati a leke nnoh nambri la tsifa isa amya. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Shina ikpi amohnoh anyimbehreh a nati a sohroh a bleh kpeh <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Nza ni de noh ikpi ahroh wuwana nnoh nnoh nati hunji noh fene.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Nza ti nza noh maka goh Urushalima na amboh gofo, nnoh nati wina noh la kǝ ba hwiri mata druhu Urushalima reh. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Neh amboh ata nza ma a bu na Yahudiya maka gbo a na amoh ma agbohgboh mboh, amboh ata nza ma a bu nimeh akpo afiya mata gbo a kate, tasa za amboh ata nza ma a bu ma akpokpo atsifi mata kama a ba amoh akpo afiya amoh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Ameh hwra akpi a nati a ba wohroh a nati a bu ameh iya agba, a nati ka a bu tswanza ma ta ka a ŋa a gya nimeh amgbasho tsifa Nnoh reh ta a su kanga. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Iya agba a nati a bu na ifiya amboh de ivru mboh tasa amboh ata mara amoh mboh nza ma a treh a momo behneh reh! Iya abibi a nati a ba ma inziyo areh, tasa za iya Nnoh a nati a tamba ma ikpi kyangwri amboh areh. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Ma a nati a mla amboh tswa na ambya gara mata a fira amboh tswa a nati te ahwra ma akpokpo atsifi. Amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh ma a nati a nga iya ma Urushalima, ameh amoh tana a su feh.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />&lt;&lt;Kpra a nati a yama na nnoh, tasa na nara tasa akpukpa mboh, ma inziyo za, kyangwri ma akpokpo afiyafiya ma a nati a nyiri ka te atsetse tsifa ata fini akre a nati a te a kwere ka gyugyuruna. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Kyangwri mboh ma a nati a hwa a kwo a yiri tsifa nyiri, tswanza nza ma a bana andromboh ata nza a nati a ba ma inziyo reh nambri, ma a nati a zuzu wuwana mboh nza ma a yama ma avereh inza reh. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Na ameh wohroh reh ma a nati a nza amehreh kyangwri atsi ba nimeh avereh na wuwana tasa nga agba ata nza bu gaga. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Nza ni kǝ nza awumu amboh ata areh maka a su a bu ba, hinga shi nnoh ti gu ikpi ka noh inza nvara amohnoh kǝ ba hwiri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh kakranda anyi la: &lt;&lt;Nza ni nza noh agbeh mgbungba tasa mgbiri agbeh mboh. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Nza ma a te asho, ni kǝ nza noh na ikpi amohnoh ni kǝ wina noh la ameh awi kǝ ba hwiri. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />A bu dehreh za, nza ni nza noh awumu amboh ika ata areh, kǝ wina noh la kpra Agohmoh Nnoh reh kǝ ba whiri. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />&lt;&lt;meh bleh noh a zizi tsifa, awumu amboh wohroh ma a nati a su feh ika ata wohroh sa ka a kwo a trina. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Inza mboh ma inziyo ma a nati a gǝga a trina, tsifa amya a nati a sohroh a gǝga kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />&lt;&lt;Lisa tuma nza noh feh, kama kira nnoh la tsifa rya irya tasa tsifa wa te ifiya mboh mata a fira kohnoh awumu inziyo mata a fira agohsoh amohnoh kpeh. Nza a bu dehreh kpeh, a nati a bleh a gya feh sa a ba ti a de noh kpeh <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />tswanza arishi reh. A nati a ba na amboh ata nza ma a bu ma inziyo areh nambri. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Tuma ti kǝ lisa nza noh feh, tasa za ti kǝ kwere nnoh Nnoh na tutu la ti hunji noh wuwana ti nvara nnoh na awumu amboh ata nza ma a nati a ba reh, tasa za ti wina shi nnoh ma tohmoh amehreh kyangwri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Na tutu Yeso ka a leh atsi tsana nimeh ida Nnoh, nza nvishi a ba reh, ka a na na a leh ma agbohgboh agbeh akpehngeh, <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />ta a sa za kyangwri mboh nambri maka a shimba atsifi a na na a ŋoh na ida Nnoh reh ma ta ka a na na a sehreh ŋoh atsi bleh tsifa Nnoh reh.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Yahuda A kira Ka a de Yeso A rifa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Ameh kira rya afohfohnoh ata nza maka a sohroh a fi atoh nimeh kpeh reh, ata nza maka a fi isa la kira gǝga handa reh waka ba hwiri. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Agbugba firist mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa reh maka a leh a fa akeki la mata ka mla Yeso reh na ayuhu ma, maka nyiri kyangwri mboh.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Agugu neh ka niye ma agohsoh yahuda, nza maka a fi sa la Iskariyoti reh, anyimbehreh nimeh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Ta a sa za Yahuda ka a gu aki a na na Agba Firist mboh tasa amboh te ndohmoh sumu da Nnoh reh maka tsifa ha ŋoh a nati a lisa lele feh ŋoh ta ka a de Yeso reh a rifa mboh.? <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Maka nza nana tsifa reh veve kpeh maka kira la ma a nati nga ŋoh hungroh. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Ka kira, kafa akeki ata nza ŋoh a nati a de Yeso reh a rifa mboh nza kyangwri mboh nza ma a yama gaga kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeso A rya Afohfohnoh mboh ma Amboh Tufa ŋoh mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Ibi rya afohfohnoh ata maka a sohroh a fi atoh nimeh kpeh ka a ba, wohroh a bu ibi ata nza maka a fa atashi ata kira gǝga handa nza bu ngǝnga ata fa woaye reh. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yeso ka tohmoh Abitrusu tasa Ayohana la, &lt;&lt;Na ni lisa turoh atsifi meh ti na ni rya afohfohnoh kira gǝga handa reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />&lt;&lt;Maka luhu Yeso la ni kǝ kira meh ti na ni lisa atsifi reh na ama?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nza ni niye na nnoh ma akpo afiya reh, ni nati dohsohna nnoh na kyangwri anyi a gu gama amwo. Tufa nnoh na nnoh ma afiya ata nza a nati aniye a na nimeh reh, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />ti bleh noh ma kyangwri afiya reh la, kyangwri tsana a tohmoh reh la meh ti luhu nnoh la, &lt;Ŋoh mboh ma amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh ma a nati a rya irya kira gǝga handa reh ma ida atamaa?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />A nati a tsana noh ida agba anyi ma ida nza, ma a lisa a treh. Lisa nnoh awumu irya gǝga handa reh ma a huru.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Maka a na amoh maka a na na a nza awumu mboh reh avoh tswanza Yeso ta ka a bleh mboh reh, maka a lisa awumu irya ata kira gǝga handa reh.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Ameh wohroh nza ka a ba, Yeso mboh ma amboh sa tohmoh nana a ŋoh mboh reh maka tuma ma atsi rya irya reh. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Meh kira meh ti rya irya kira gǝga handa reh na amohnoh fya misi wa iya. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />meh ti bleh noh zizi, meh nati za rya irya gǝga handa reh za kpeh, tama a tsana meh lomo tsifa mboh reh ta a su feh nimeh akpo afiya Nnoh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Nza ka a gu hohndoh reh, ka kwende Nnoh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Sa noh amwo inabi ata areh te gafa wa nnoh ma itoh amohnoh. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Meh bleh noh la nza anyi nehnehreh, meh nati za wa amwo inabi areh za kpeh, akpo afiya Nnoh reh tana a ba feh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Ka a gu afohfohnoh, ka kwende Nnoh ka kya ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Areh a bu itoh amya nza ma a nati a nga inziyo; kǝ lisa nnoh dehreh te kǝ kohnoh nnoh na amya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Dehreh za, nza maka a rya afohfohnoh a treh ka a gu hohndoh reh, ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Areh a bu hohndoh tsifa bleh gya afeh nimeh imya amya, nza ma a nati a sangra ni ikpi tsifa amohnoh. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Ivoh kyangwri ata nza a nati a de meh a nga mboh reh neh a bu nimeh gbugba na amya. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Amehreh kyangwri a nati a na a ŋoh tswanza ma ta ka a bleh a gya reh, iya agba na kyangwri wohroh ata nza a nati a de ŋoh a nga mboh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Maka luhu itoh amoh la a ka bu anyi nimeh amoh nza a nati a lisa dehreh reh.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Tasa za hwa aniye ka hinga nimeh amoh amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh la a ka bu anyi ma a nati a bu agba nimeh amoh <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yeso ka bleh mboh la,&lt;&lt;Agohgohmoh Amboh ata nza ma bu Yahudawa mboh kpeh reh, maka tsana wuwana; tasa agbugba amoh mboh maka a bleh la mboh ma bu amboh shingǝ kyangwri mboh. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Mohnoh neh ni bu noh dehreh kpeh, nza bu dehreh reh, ta agba nimeh amohnoh ta a bu tswanza ŋoh a bu akehreh, tasa ata nza a bu Agohmoh ta tswanza ahwra. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Atamaa a bu agba, ata nza tuma a rya irya reh ha a bu ata nza a de irya a na ŋoh reh? A bu ata nza a buti tuma rya reh kpeh? mya neh meh bu nimeh amohnoh tswanza kyangwri gafa irya.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />A bu mohnoh ni shi nnoh ma nda amya nimeh iya ata mya nza ni wa reh. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />Tasa za tswanza Ada amya nza nga meh kira la meh ti de kpra Agohmoh a ŋoh reh, mya za meh nga nnoh kira ika wohroh. <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />La mohnoh za ti rya ti wa nnoh ma atsi tuma rya irya na amya nimeh akpo afiya Nnoh, tasa za ni nati tuma noh ma ikpi kpra Agohmoh reh, ti de noh Agohmoh tasa za ti hwra noh akpi ma alohsoh Israila mboh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Yeso a fi ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Abitrusu, Abitrusu, Agugu a leh fa aki ta a tsara nnoh a nza nambri ma amohnoh tswanza nza maka a blisa yohroh akroh anyi ma atutu ŋoh reh. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Mya neh meh kǝ kwere Nnoh ma ikpi amohnoh, nnoh Siman, nga agohsoh anzoh ta kama a hwa kpeh. Tasa za nza ni gyuru ba anzoh na amya reh, ti nga atsi anzoh mboh wuwa agohsoh kanga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Ka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Ada, meh gu agohsoh amya gya meh kira meh ti wa nnoh na ma ida ka. Nza bu kwo meh ti kwo Mbohroh ma anzoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;meh bleh noh Abitrusu, la agba ta a wri andrehmeh, nnoh ni nati tana meh te na atatoh la ni sohroh wina meh kpeh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Yeso neh ka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Na ameh ata meh ti kǝ tohmoh nnoh reh hungroh tana a yama kpeh, a kpanga tasa akpehtreh hwana mboh za tama a yama kpeh. Ni fa nnoh andromboh kavoh?&gt;&gt;Maka a kira ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Uwa meh sohroh fa andromboh kavoh kpeh,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nehnehreh neh nza ni bu na hungroh, gu de, tasa a kpanga; tasa za nza ni sohroh bu na ambya gara kpeh, rifa kuri anzoh ti na ni sa anyi. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Meh bleh noh zizi, tsifa Nnoh a bu ŋa gyaa la: &lt;Ma a gu ŋoh a mangara na amboh kpakpana mboh&gt; Meh leh a bleh noh la areh a nati a su kanga ma ikpi amya. Haa, andromboh ata nza ma a ŋa a gya ma ikpi amya reh waka a buti su.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />amboh tufa ŋoh mboh maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Nza, ada, nza ambya gara afri uwe.&gt;&gt; ka a bleh mboh la &lt;&lt;Kǝ tswa dehreh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A kwere Nnoh ma Agbohgboh Akpehngeh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yeso ka a kate a na a ŋoh agbohgboh agbeh akpehngeh ika ata nza ka a lisa na tutu reh, amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka a tufa ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Nza ka a na na a te ma a huru, ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Kwere nnoh la ti kama hwa nnoh nimeh tsara kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Yeso ka a yi mboh ata ta ka a kpusu a na tohmoh shidi tswanza maka a shi kpakpa ta a na na a hwa reh ma, ka a hwa a tuma na a gboro ka kwere Nnoh. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />Ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, nza ni kira reh, gu meh hohndoh iya ata areh; Nza a bu dehreh a bu kira amya kpeh, ta ka a bu kira anzoh ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Amehreh tohmoh Nnoh ata amgba ka a tamba anyi inza a ba ba a nga ŋoh wuwana. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Tasa za nza ka a bu nimeh nza iya gaga, ka a nata nimeh kwere Nnoh reh, a ka a te hohroh ata nza ka a leh gbo a tamba ma inzi tswanza imya. <verse eid="LUK 22:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Nza ka a hinga anyi ma atsi kwere Nnoh reh ka a gyuru a na na amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh, ka a nana a hunji mboh ma atsi leh mla, la ma a kputu agohsoh amoh. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Ka a luhu mboh la,&lt;&lt;Ni kǝ leh nnoh mla tsifa umbo?&gt;&gt; Hinga ti kwere nnoh Nnoh la ti sohroh hwa nnoh nimeh tsara kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A de Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Nza ka a treh a buti tsifa duma mboh maka a kate a ba, ata nza maka a fi sa a ŋoh la Yahuda, anyimbehreh nimeh agrumavoh a hwa afri reh, ka a tsana mboh aki. Ka kpusu a ba na Yeso reh la ŋoh ta a wa aniye a ŋoh, <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Yeso neh ka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Yahuda, a bu noh ni tana amehreh kyangwri de ŋoh nga mboh te huru la ni wa aniye na amya reh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Amboh tufa Yeso nza maka a nza dehreh maka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, meh ti tsima ŋoh na ambya gara?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />anyimbehreh nimeh amoh ka a tsima ahwra Agba Firist reh, ka a shimba ashotoh mgba ivoh irya a kpa a ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 22:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Yeso neh ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ta mboh nnoh tsehe!&gt;&gt; Ka gya ivoh a bara kyangwri reh ta ka a nga ŋoh wuwana. <verse eid="LUK 22:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Yeso neh ka a bleh ma Agba Firist mboh reh la, agbugba amboh te ndohmoh sumu ida Nnoh, tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh, nza maka a ba atsi de ŋoh reh, &lt;&lt;Mya meh bu ayuhu feh ni ba atsi de meh noh na ambya tasa agbohndoh mboh? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Mya meh kǝ yama na amohnoh ma ida Nnoh na tutu ni sohroh de meh noh kpeh. Nehnehreh neh kǝ ba amohnoh ameh ata shini nza a ka a bu na wuwana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abitrusu A tana Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Maka a de Yeso, maka a wa ŋoh a na amoh afiya agba Firist reh. Abitrusu ka tufa mboh anyi gbugba na ayuhu. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Nza maka a mloh shira ka a gya ma atsitsifi nashi maka tuma, Abitrusu za ka tuma na amoh. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Ahwra anyifa anyi ka a nza ŋoh ma zana shira. Ka were ŋoh iyo ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri areh na a bu na a ŋoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Abitrusu neh ka tana ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Afya, mya meh sohroh wina ŋoh kpeh,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />A yanda kpeh kyangwri anyi ka a nza ŋoh ka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Nnoh za ni bu na amoh.&gt;&gt; Abitrusu ka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Kyangwri, a sohroh a bu mya kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Nnoh hungroh anyimbehreh nza ka a gǝga anyi ka nata la, &lt;&lt;Zizi kyangwri ata areh za ta na na a bu na a ŋoh, ŋoh za a bu kyangwri Galili.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Abitrusu ka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Kyangwri, meh sohroh wina andromboh nza ni shi tsifa reh kpeh!&gt;&gt; A ka a treh a buti tsifa, agba ka a wri. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Ada ka a gyuruna ka nza Abitrusu welele. Abitrusu neh ka kohnoh tsifa ata Ada ta ka a bleh ŋoh reh la&lt;&lt;Nnoh nati jiji tana meh ti na atatoh feh agba sa a wri andrehmeh areh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Ka kate a na a ŋoh inziyo ka a na na a kpanga a rina na.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">amboh Sumu ma ti ma Yeso Inyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Kyangwri amboh nza ma sumu Yeso reh maka a leh a te ŋoh nyi ma ta ka a mla ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Maka a lafa iyo a ŋoh a hama maka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Nza ti bleh wina! A ka bu anyi a mla nnoh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Maka a bleh ŋoh tsifa abibi amboh tswa za gaga.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso Ma Tohmoh Agbugba Mboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Nerebi nza a ka a yanda agbugba mboh tasa Agbugba Firist mboh tasa agbugba amboh tsana akpi Musa, mboh, maka dohsohna, maka a de Yeso a ba ma tohmoh amoh <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Bleh reh, a bu noh ata nza ni Kristi reh?&gt; Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Nza meh bleh noh reh, ni nati sohroh sa tsifa reh kira nnoh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />Tasa meh ti luhu nnoh ni nati sohroh sa meh noh aniye kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Nyi nehnehreh neh a gu a na tohmoh, amehreh kyangwri a nati a tuma ma atsi tuma Nnoh na mgba ivoh rya a kpa Nnoh ata nza a bu na wuwana reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Maka a luhu ŋoh nambri ma amoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu noh wohroh nza ni bu amehreh Nnoh reh?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Ka a kira mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni bleh noh yehlehleh la mya meh bu ŋoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Maka bleh la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh sehreh nyi ma aniye a ŋoh andromboh ata nza bleh reh, meh treh bana anyi za ta a ba ba bleh reh tsifa a ŋoh.<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Duma mboh reh neh maka a hinga a wa Yeso reh a na na Bilatus. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Maka buti a ŋa ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Mbohroh meh hunji kyangwri areh atsi leh kputu kyangwri mboh. A bleh mboh la mata kama a fanga Hungroh gandu a nga kaisar kpeh tasa za la ŋoh a bu Kristi, Agohmoh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Bilatus ka luhu Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Nnoh ni bu Agohmoh Yahudawa mboh reh?&gt;&gt;Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la &lt;&lt;A bu tswanza noh nza ni a bleh reh,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Bilatus neh ka a bleh ma Agba Firist mboh tasa duma mboh reh la, &lt;&lt;Mya feh, meh sohroh hunji kyangwri areh na kpakpana kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Mboh neh maka a lisa nata a keh la, &lt;&lt;Ka a gu agohsoh kyangwri mboh a ka na lomo a ŋoh ma Yahudiya na agba ma. Tana a jiji ma Galili ka a gu a ba ba a te ni mareh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Bilatus nza ka a sehreh dehreh, ka luhu la &lt;&lt;Kyangwri areh anyi Galili ŋa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Nza ka a wina la Yeso reh anyi akpo afiya ata Hirudus nza de Agohmoh reh, ka a tohmoh ŋoh a na na Hirudus, ŋoh za tana a bu ma Urushalima na ameh wohroh reh. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Hirudus nza ka a nza Yeso reh, ka a nza nana gaga, tana a jiji a leh a kira ŋoh ta a nza ŋoh na amehmeh mi. Ŋoh kǝ jiji sehreh ma kpi a ŋoh, ka gya agohsoh la Yeso ta a tsana kpra andromboh anyi ata ŋara aniye la ŋoh ta a nza. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Hirudus neh ka luhu ŋoh tsifa mboh gaga, Yeso neh ka a sohroh a sa ŋoh aniye kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Agbugba firist mboh tasa amboh tsana akpi Musa mboh za maka a shi ma a huru, maka a leh a de tsifa abibi mboh a ba na ikpi Yeso. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Hirudus mboh ma amboh de ita a ŋoh mboh maka leh a de ŋoh a te iya tasa za maka a te ŋoh nyi. Maka were ŋoh akuri Agohmoh agba, mata ka a wa ŋoh a na na Bilatus. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Ibi wohroh heri Hirudus mboh ma Bilatus maka a de iza, mboh tama ka a nza itoh amoh ni iyo kpeh.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Bilatus neh ka a fi agba firist mboh, tasa agbugba kyangwri mboh tasa kyangwri mboh a dohsoh, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;A bu noh ni de kyangwri areh ba meh noh, la ŋoh a leh a de kyangwri mboh a kputu la mata ka a wuwa ikpi. Mya neh meh luhu ŋoh nza ma iyo amohnoh, meh sohroh hunji ŋoh na kpakpana ata nza ni de ba nnoh ma ikpi a ŋoh reh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Hirudus za a sohroh a hunji ŋoh na kpakpana kpeh, a bu wohroh ŋa nza a gyuru a de ŋoh a ba na ambohroh reh; nza noh, kyangwri ata areh a sohroh a lisa andromboh a tswa atsi mla ŋoh kwo kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Nza a bu dehreh meh nati mla ŋoh na amviri meh ti ta ŋoh avoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />Nza a bu dehreh, meh nati nga ŋoh iya meh ti ta ŋoh avoh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Duma mboh reh maka te kpiriga nambri ma amoh, &lt;&lt;Ma a gu kyangwri areh a kate! Mata ata reh Barabba avoh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Tama a gu Barabba reh a fi ma ida ka tsifa a fi akpi nimeh akpo afiya tasa za ka mla kyangwri mboh a kwo. <verse eid="LUK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Bilatus ka a gyuru atsifa na amoh, ŋoh a kira ta a yi Yeso ata avoh. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Mboh neh maka nata a te kpiriga la, &lt;&lt;Ma a de ŋoh a kpa ma gbohrohgboh! ma a de ŋoh a kpa ma gbohrohgboh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Bilatus ka a gyuru atsifa na amoh na atatoh ŋoh: &lt;&lt;Tsifa umbo? kyangwri reh a te nnoh mboh abibi? mya feh meh sohroh hunji ŋoh na kpakpana a tswa atsi mla a kwo kpeh. Meh nati mla ŋoh meh ti ta ŋoh avoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Kyangwri mboh reh neh maka a nata a vuru agba mama la ma a kpa ŋoh, na trina ŋoh maka hunji rya tohmoh. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Bilatus neh ka a nza dehreh ka a shimba mboh akpi ata nza ma a kira. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Ka a tavoh kyangwri ata mboh nza ma a kira reh, ŋoh ata tama ka a de ŋoh a ka ma ida ka reh, tsifa la tana ka a fi kpi tasa za la tana a leh a mla kyangwri mboh a kwo, ka a nga mboh Yeso la ma ta ka a lisa ŋoh andromboh ata nza ma a kira reh.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A de Yeso A kpa Ma gbohrohgboh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Nza maka a wa Yeso a kate, maka a dohsohna na kyangwri anyi maka a fi sa a ŋoh la Siman ata Sayirin, ka buti nyi akpo afiya akehreh anyi, maka a gu gbohrohgboh reh a nga ŋoh la ta a de a tufa Yeso. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Duma agba maka a tufa Yeso, tasa ifiya amboh nza ma leh a kpanga a te kpiriga a tufa ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yeso ka a gyuruna a nza mboh ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;ifiya Urushalima mboh, kama kpanga meh noh kpeh; kpanga nnoh meh ikpi amohnoh tasa mara amohnoh mboh. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Ameh anyi a nati a ba kyangwri ma a nati a bleh la, &lt;Johjoh a bu na ifiya amboh ata nza ma a tuma akwri, yira amboh ata tama a mara a nza kpeh, tasa behneh ata amehreh tama a momo a nza kpeh!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Na ameh wohroh ŋa kyangwri mboh ma a nati a bleh ma kpakpa mboh la, &lt;Hwa nnoh ma ikpi ambohroh!&gt; tasa ma agbohgboh mboh la, &lt;Hama turoh!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Nza maka a lisa dehreh na ishi ata kǝ hehreh hwara kpeh reh, a nati ka bu lele na ishi ata kǝ hwara reh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Maka a de kpakpana amboh anyi mboh afri za a kate a nati a kpa a mla a kwo ma gbohrohgboh tasa Yeso. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Nza maka a na atsifi anyi maka a fi la akohkohroh ikpi, ma a huru maka a de ŋoh a kpa, mboh ma amboh kpakpana mboh reh anyimbehreh ni ivoh irya a kpa, anyi na ivoh a mina a ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yeso ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Ada, gu kpakpana amoh reh te kohhroh, ma sohroh a wina andromboh nza ma a buti lisa reh kpeh.&gt;&gt; Maka a gafa kuri a ŋoh ma itoh amoh ma aki fi seh. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Kyangwri maka a shi a nza, agbugba Yahudawa mboh neh maka a leh a te ŋoh nyi. Maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A sa amboh tswa a hwana; ta a sa ikpi a ŋoh a hwana nza ŋoh a bu Kristi ata Nnoh nza a seh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Amboh de ita mboh za maka a ba ba a leh a te ŋoh nyi. Maka a de amwo inabi ata jwa ata nza ma a lisa na mara inabi <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Maka a bleh ŋoh la &lt;&lt;Nza ni bu Agohmoh Yahudawa mboh reh, sa ikpi anzoh hwana feh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Maka a ŋa ma ikpi a ŋoh la, AREH BU AGOHMOH YAHUDAWA MBOH.<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Anyi nimeh ayuhu amboh ata nza ma a kpa mboh ma a ŋoh reh, a kya Nnoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu noh ata nza ni bu Kristi reh kpeh? Nvara ikpi anzoh ti nvara reh Mbohroh za!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ayuhu reh anyi neh ka a hwa atohngoh reh la, &lt;&lt;Ni nyiri Nnoh kpeh,&gt;&gt; Nnoh nza ma hwra akpi anzoh yehlehleh ika ata a ŋoh reh. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Mbohroh feh, ma a lisa reh yehlehleh, tsifa la mbohroh meh leh hunji firoh ndohmoh ata meh te reh, kyangwri ata areh neh a lisa andromboh abibi kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Ka a bleh ma Yeso la, &lt;&lt;Yeso, kohnoh na amya, nza tini nati ba tswanza Agohmoh reh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yeso ka a bleh ŋoh la,&lt;&lt;Meh ti bleh noh a zizi tsifa, andrehmeh ni nati tuma na amya ma atsi tuma nza nana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A kwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Ka anyi na atsitsi fi noh shini ka hungwa a hama inzi reh a gu a nana a te na hungroh nnoh atatoh ata mgba nvishi, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />nnoh reh tana a za a zana atsifi kpeh. Kuri hama anida ata nza a bu nimeh ida Nnoh reh ka a hwashina a te afri. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yeso ka vuru agba a ŋoh a ka, ka a bleh la,&lt;&lt;Ada meh yi huru amya ta na ivoh anzoh.&gt;&gt; Nza ka a bleh dehreh, ka akpi fene a ŋoh ni trina ŋoh ka a gu itoh ata avoh. <verse eid="LUK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Agba amboh de ita ata Roma ata nza a yama na a huru nza a ka nza dehreh, ka riri Nnoh ka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;Zizi areh bu kyangwri tufa yehlehleh!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Kyangwri amboh nza maka a ba atsi nza atsifi reh maka a nza dehreh, maka a gu aki a na amoh ma ta ka va ivoh ma agohsoh nimeh kputu agohsoh. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />amboh nza maka a wina Yeso reh neh, tasa ifiya amboh nza ma a tufa ŋoh anyi Galili reh, maka a shi ma gbugba, maka a shi a nza awumu amboh areh.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma Nyifo Yeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Kyangwri anyi tana a yama ma a fi isa a ŋoh la Yusufu, ŋoh a bu kyangwri alindeh tasa za ka a tufa yehlehleh. Ŋoh tana a bu nimeh agbugba amboh hwra akpi Yahudawa mboh reh. <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Ŋoh a sohroh a dohsoh aniye na amoh tasa andromboh nza ma a lisa reh kpeh. Anyi akpo afiya anyi nza maka a fi isa reh la Arimatiya nza a bu ma akpo inza Yahudawa mboh, ŋoh tana ka a bana kpra Agohmoh Nnoh nza a nati a ba reh. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Yusuf reh ka a na na Bilatus ka a na na a kwere la mata nga ŋoh itoh Yeso. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Ka a gu itoh Yeso reh a tamba neh, ka a lafa na kuri lilin, ka anyifo ŋoh ma ikpi nyifo anyi ma a shumu nimeh kpakpa, ata ma a hehreh anyifo akyo nimeh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />A bu ibi lisa awumu mboh bana mi, tasa asabar kǝ ba hwiri. <verse eid="LUK 23:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Ifiya amboh ata nza ma a tufa Yeso anyi Galili reh maka tufa Yusuf reh la mata a nana a nza ikpi nyifo reh tasa ha ma a nati anyifo itoh Yeso reh lele. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Ifiya mboh neh maka a na amoh afiya maka a na na a lisa awumu angǝshi alindeh tasa amehneh wo. Maka tuma afo ma ibi asabar la mata a tufa doka anzoh reh.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Yeso A gyuru A yiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />ifiya mboh reh maka a te a shimba atsifi ibi na anyimbehreh ŋoh nimeh sati maka a fira awumu angǝshi alindeh ata mboh nza ma a lisa a gya a na ikpi nyifo reh. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Maka a na na a nza ma a yiyi kpakpa reh a hinga ata aniye ikpi nyifo reh, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />nza maka niye a na reh neh, maka a sohroh a hunji kohmoh ada Yeso reh kpeh. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Nza maka a treh a bu nimeh sungwla na wohroh, maka a nza kyangwri amboh afri anyi maka a shi na nda amoh, ma a were akuri ata nza a kasa a srehmehna. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Nimeh nyiri gaga, ifiya mboh reh maka a hwa dohnoh ma tomo amoh ma inzi. Kyangwri mboh reh maka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ leh fa nnoh kyangwri fene nimeh ikpi nyifo tsifa umbo? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />A sohroh a yama ma mareh kpeh, kǝ hinga yiri! kohnoh nnoh na tsifa ata ta ka a bleh noh ta ka a treh a bu ma Galili reh: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />A bleh la, &lt;Ma a nati a de amehreh kyangwri a nga amboh kpakpana kanga, mata a de ŋoh a kpa a gya, ibi na atatoh neh ta a gyuru a hinga yama&gt; &gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Neh maka kohnoh tsifa a ŋoh mboh reh. <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Nza maka anyi ikpi nyifo a ba amoh reh, maka a ba ba a bleh ma agrumavoh a hwa anyimbehreh reh tasa mgbiri kyangwri mboh nambri za <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Tana a bu Maryamu ata nza anyi Magadala, tasa Yowanan, tasa Maryamu afya Yakubu, tasa ifiya amboh anyi ma ta ka a bleh ma amboh sa tohmoh nana Yeso awumu mboh reh. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Amboh sa tohmoh nana Yeso mboh reh neh maka a gu tsifa reh la bu tsifa abibi, maka sa tsifa reh leke. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Abitrusu neh, ka a hinga a gbo a na a ŋoh ikpi nyifo reh. Ka a kukuna, ka a nza hwashi kuri lilin reh ma a gu a gya na nda. Ka a gyuru a na a ŋoh afiya na nyiri, ta ka a kohnoh la, a ka a bu umbo ka a te.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma Aki Imawus</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mk 16:12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Ibi wohroh heri afri nimeh amoh maka a bu ma aki na akpo afiya anyi maka a fi isa la Imawus, izeh akpo afiya reh anyi Urushalima a bu mgba hwana atehrehkifi na anyi. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Maka a buti tsifa na itoh amoh na ikpi awumu amboh ata nza a kate reh nambri. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Nza maka a bu nimeh tsifa tasa maka a sungwra ma itoh amoh neh, Yeso na ikpi a ŋoh ka krembena a kate ka a hehndeh na amoh; <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Maka a hama mboh iyo amoh la mata kama a nza ŋoh a wina kpeh <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Ka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ hende tsifa nnoh na itoh amohnoh la umbo?&gt;&gt; Maka a shi tsehe, itoh amoh ka a kwo a tamba. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Anyimbehreh nimeh amoh isa a ŋoh bu Kiliyobas, ka luhu ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;A bu noh tsinzo ni bu sene ma Urushalima nza ni sohroh wina andromboh ata nza ma a lisa nimeh ibi afri areh kpeh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Yeso ka luhu mboh la &lt;&lt;Andromboh umbo?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Maka a bleh ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Awumu amboh ata nza ma a hunji Yeso ata Nazaret reh,&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Tana a bu kyangwri sa tohmoh Nnoh, tana a bu kyangwri wuwana nimeh tsifa tasa ndohmoh ma tohmoh Nnoh tasa kyangwri mboh nambri, <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />agba firist mboh tasa agohgohmoh ambohroh mboh tama a de ŋoh a nga mboh la mata hwra akpi ŋoh mata a mla ŋoh a kwo, maka a de ŋoh a kpa a gya ma gbohrohgboh; <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Mbohroh neh timi gya agohsoh la a bu ŋoh ŋa a nati a sa kyangwri Israila mboh reh a hwana. A hwa mboh za, kǝ te ibi na atatoh andromboh amboh areh nza ma a lisa nambri reh. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />A bu ata areh tsene kpeh, ifiya amboh anyi ma a de tsifa nza a gu agohsoh ambohroh a fi kohnoh a ba reh. Ma a shimba atsifi a na ikpi nyifo na nerebi. <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />Mboh neh ma a sohroh a nza kohmoh Yeso reh kpeh. Ma a ba ba a bleh reh la mboh ma a nza, ma a vuru mboh iyo maka a nza mara tohmoh Nnoh mboh, maka a bleh mboh la a yama na fene. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />ambohroh amboh anyi neh maka a na ikpi nyifo reh maka a na na a nza tswanza ifiya mboh reh nza ma a bleh mboh reh neh maka a sohroh a nza ŋoh kpeh,&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni kǝ duduna nnoh lele, tasa agohsoh amohnoh ka bu lele feh sa a te nnoh iya ti sa nnoh tsifa ata amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh ma ta ka atsifa reh kpeh! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Kristi tana a sohroh a nati a nza iya amboh areh feh sa niye a na nimeh aki nza a na na agba a ŋoh reh kpeh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Yeso ka a bleh mboh tsifa mboh ma ta ka a ŋa a gya nimeh amgbasho akpi ma ikpi a ŋoh ka a gu anyi na Musa a ba ba a te na amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh a bleh reh.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Nza maka a ba whiri na akpo afiya ata mboh ma ta ka a buti a gu aki a na reh, Yeso ka lisa tswanza ŋoh a nati a gǝga a na a ŋoh tohmoh reh. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Maka a nata ŋoh la, &lt;&lt;Shi na ambohroh, Nvishi kǝ ba whiri; ibi wa a nati a trina.&gt;&gt; dehreh ka niye a wa mboh a na na amoh. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Nza ka a tuma a nati a rya irya na amoh, ka a gu Afohfohnoh, ka a kwende, ka kya ka a nga mboh. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Ma a huru iyo amoh ka vuruna neh maka a nza Yeso a wina, ka lalana a bleh ma tohmoh amoh. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Maka a luhu itoh amoh la, &lt;&lt;Agohsoh ambohroh tana a sohroh afya tswanza shira, ameh ata ta ka atsifa na ambohroh ma aki, ta a tsana reh tsifa Nnoh ata nza ma a ŋa a gya nimeh amgbasho reh kpeh?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Maka a de a hinga ma hwana anyimbehreh maka a gyuru a na amoh Urushalima. Maka a na na a hunji agrumavoh a hwa anyimbehreh reh tasa amboh anyi na amoh. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Maka a bleh la, &lt;&lt;A bu zizi! Ada reh kǝ hinga tasa za kǝ kate ma Siman.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Amboh afri reh neh maka a bleh mboh andromboh ata mboh nza ma a nza ma aki, tasa mboh nza maka a nza Yeso a wina reh nza ka kya afohfohnoh reh.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yeso A krembena a kate Ma Amboh Tufa A ŋoh Mboh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Ama 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mk 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoh 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Ndo 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Nza maka a treh atsifa na ikpi wohroh reh, Yeso na ikpi a ŋoh ka a ba ba a shi nimeh amoh ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Tuma alindeh ta a yama na amohnoh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Nyiri ka a de mboh maka a nyiri itoh maka a bleh amoh la mboh ma a nza yafa mi. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Yeso neh ka a bleh mboh la, ni kǝ nyiri nnoh gaga dehreh tsifa mboh, agohsoh amohnoh za ka a sohroh a sa a kira kpeh? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Nza nnoh ivoh amya tasa hwana amya, a bu mya na ikpi amya. Gya nnoh ivoh ma itoh amya ti nza noh; yafa ka a sohroh a bu na wo tasa akofo kpeh, tswanza nza ni nza noh na amya areh kpeh.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Nza ka a bleh dehreh, ka tsana mboh ivoh a ŋoh tasa hwana a ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Nza maka a treh a bu nimeh sa tsifa reh leke nimeh nza nana agohsoh tasa ŋara aniye, ka luhu mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ni bu noh na andromboh rya ma mareh?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Amboh tufa a ŋoh mboh reh maka nga ŋoh kra wo kpo ata yaha ŋoh, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />ka a sa neh ka a rya ma tohmoh amoh.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Areh ŋa a bu awumu ata mya ti kǝ bleh noh meh ti kǝ treh yama na amohnoh reh: awumu mboh nza ma ŋa ma ikpi amya nimeh amgbasho akpi Musa reh, a bu ŋa amboh sa tohmoh Nnoh mboh tasa amumu Dawuda mboh ma ikpi amya reh a nati ka a su kanga.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Yeso ka a vuru agohsoh amoh neh la mata nza amgbasho tsifa Nnoh a wina. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Ka a bleh mboh la, &lt;&lt;Ma a ŋa la: Kristi reh a nati a wa iya ta a kwo ta a gyuru a hinga anyi ikpi nyifo ibi na atatoh ŋoh, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />ma a nati a hwra tsifa gyuruna ta kpakpana tasa gu kpakpana te kohhroh ma kyangwri mboh ma akpokpo afiyafiya mboh reh nambri nimeh isa amya, ma a nati a jiji anyi ma Urushalima. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Mohnoh ni nza noh awumu amboh ata areh nambri ni nati nza ti bleh noh ma kyangwri mboh ma ikpi ŋoh. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Meh nati tohmoh andromboh ata Ada amya ta ka a bleh a gya la ŋoh nati a lisa reh a ba nnoh. Mohnoh neh here shi noh ma akpo afya reh, tama a nga noh wuwana anyi inza feh.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ma A gu Yeso A na Inza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mk 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Ndo 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Yeso nza a ka a wa mboh a kate a na na mgba Betani, ka a fira ivoh a ka ka a te mboh atoh. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Nza ka a bu nimeh te mboh atoh reh neh, ka a yi mboh ata, maka a gu ŋoh a na amoh Inza. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Mboh reh maka a krumusu ŋoh, maka a nza nana ma agohsoh amoh gaga maka a gyuru a na amoh Urushalima. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Maka a nati a leh a riri Nnoh ma ida Nnoh reh ni tutu.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>